<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mwand</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino chotangigwa Mwanduso kwa viya ni chitabu cha mwanduso muna Dilagano da Umwaka. Nakala ya umwaka ya Chiebulania ya chitabu chino yokwandusa na mbuli “Baho mwanduso.” Chitabu chino cholagusa kuwa vinhu vose vilawa kulihi na viya Mulungu viyatendile na wanhu haumwanduso. Wasomi wengi siku zino wana magesa mengi kusonhela munhu hebu wanhu wowandike chitabu cha Mwanduso, na lusita lulihi chitabu chino vichandikigwe. Wauko wowogesa kuwa chitabu chino chiduganyigwa kwa kulawa senga mbasakanyo za umwaka muna ikaline ya 5 mbaka 6 KK (Ing'hali Chilisito). Wamwenga wotogola na mahokelo yoyotogoligwa mwa iwanhu weli wengi kuwa Musa kandika chitabu cha Mwanduso, iviya na vitabu vimwenga vya Kulawa na Mbuli za Walawi na Peta na Kumbukumbu da Malagilizo muna imiyaka ya 1,300 hebu 1,400, ing'hali Chilisito hana kwelekigwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Mwanduso chimema mbuli zili muhimu ng'hani zowataza Wachilisito kuvimanya hanhu hose hamwenga ha Bibilia, ziwe za Lagano da Umwaka hebu Lagano da Sambi. Chitabu cha Mwanduso cholagusa viya uhasanyi vouwingile muna iisi, na viya wanhu wose vowomulonda mkombola. Iviya chitabu chino chofunula lungilo da Mulungu da kuwakombola wanhu. Ino yowoneka muna uulotezi wa mwanduso woulotela kumsonhela Yesu, Mwanduso 3:15, iviya ahadi ya Mulungu kwa Abulahamu ya kuzitemela mate nyelesi zose zili mwiisi, Mwanduso 12:3.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mulungu kalumba isi na iviya kawaumba Adamu na Hawa fana viisimuliligwa muna isula ya 1 na 2.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Sula ya 3 mbaka 5 yomulonganya Adamu na Hawa na uhasanyi wao na welesi wao.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Sula ya 6 mbaka 9 yomulonganya Nuhu na mbuli za digombo dikulu.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Viimalile baho chitabu cha Mwanduso cholonga chiya chochilawile muna ulusita lwa Nuhu na uja ulusita wa Abulahabu na kongeza mbuli za lingo da Babeli muna isula ya 10 mbaka 11.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Sula ya 12 mbaka 50 zomsohnela Abulahamu na welesi wake na mwanduso wa Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="io2">Ugima wa Abulahamu na muke wake Sala yosimuliligwa kulawa muna isula ya 12 mbaka 25.</para>
  <para style="io2">Ugima wa Isaka na muke wake Labeka yosimuliligwa kulawa muna isula ya 21 mbaka 28 na udanganiko wake wosimuliligwa muna isula ya 35.</para>
  <para style="io2">Ugima wa Yakobo na wanage na viwasegele kulawa Kanaani kuhita Misili wosimuliligwa muna isula ya 25 mbaka 50.</para>
  <para style="io2">Sula 37 mbaka 50 imema mbuli za Yosefu, mwana nyachende wa Yakobo na iviya viyezile kutendigwa mtawala wa isi ya Misili.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Ulumbaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1"/>Baho mwanduso, Mulungu kalumba ulanga na isi yose na chila chinhu chili umo, <verse eid="GEN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2"/>nayo isi ikala yabule umbo hebu yabule chinhu chochose. Na ziza dikala digubika mchanyha ya mazi, Muhe wa Mulungu kakala katanda uchany'ha ya mazi. <verse eid="GEN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3"/>Maabaho Mulungu kalonga, “Dilawilile bung'hulo” na bung'hulo dilawilila. <verse eid="GEN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4"/>Mulungu kawona kuwa bung'hulo dinoga, na kavigola bung'hulo na ziza. <verse eid="GEN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5"/>Bung'hulo kaditanga “Misi” na ziza kaditanga “Chilo.” Iwa imitondo iwa ichigulogulo siku ya mwanduso.<verse eid="GEN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6"/>Maabaho Mulungu kalonga, “Hanhu hagati ya mazi hayagole yamazi banzi mbili.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7"/>Ivo Mulungu kausa hanhu na kayagola yamazi yeli mchanyha na yaja yeli hasi. Ilawilila ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8"/>Mulungu kahatanga hanhu baho “Langa.” Iwa imitondo iwa ichigulogulo, siku yekaidi.<verse eid="GEN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9"/>Maabaho Mulungu kalonga, “Mazi yeli hasi ya ulanga yaiduganye hanhu hamwe, idahe kulawilila hanhu hanyalile.” Ilawilila ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10"/>Mulungu kahatanga hanhu hanyalile “Isi” na hanhu hayaiduganye yamazi hamwe kahatanga “Bahali.” Mulungu kawona kuwa vinoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11"/>Maabaho Mulungu kalonga, “Isi yoteze chila modeli ya mimeya yoikwima mbeyu zake na chila modeli ya mibiki yoikwima matunda yeli na mbeyu zozigendelela koteza mimeya imwenga ya modeli yake.” Ilawilila ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12"/>Ivo isi yoteza chila modeli ya mimeya yoikwima mbeyu na chila modeli ya mibiki yoikwima matunda yeli na mbeyu. Mulungu kawona kuwa vinoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13"/>Iwa imitondo iwa ichigulogulo, siku yetatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14"/>Maabaho Mulungu kalonga, “Mabung'hulo yalawilile kuulanga, yagole imisi na ichilo, yalaguse lusita lwa dugila na siku na miyaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15"/>yamwemwese kuulanga muladi isi iwe na bung'hulo.” Ilawilila ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16"/>Maabaho Mulungu katenda mabung'hulo maidi makulu, zua dimwemwese imisi na mwezi umwemwese ichilo, iviya kausa nhondo. <verse eid="GEN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17"/>Mulungu keka mabung'hulo yayo kuulanga muladi yamwemwese isi. <verse eid="GEN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18"/>Yatawale imisi na ichilo na kuvigola bung'hulo na ziza. Na Mulungu kawona kuwa vinoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19"/>Iwa imitondo iwa ichigulogulo siku yekane.<verse eid="GEN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20"/>Maabaho Mulungu kalonga, “Mazi yamemezwe vilumbe vili na ugima na langa dimemezwe ndege woguluka.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21"/>Mulungu kalumba wanyama wakulu ng'hani mwiibahali na chila modeli mbasakanyo ya vilumbe vili na ugima vovigenda mwiibahali, na chila modeli ya ndege. Mulungu kawona kuwa vinoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22"/>Kavitemela mate na kavilongela vilumbe va muna yamazi, “Yongezekeni na yelekeni na muimemeze bahali,” na kawalongela ndege wongezeke muiisi. <verse eid="GEN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23"/>Iwa imitondo iwa ichigulogulo, siku yetano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24"/>Maabaho Mulungu kalonga, “Leka isi ilave chila modeli mbasakanyo ya vilumbe vili na ugima, wanyama wowofugigwa na wang'onyo wotambala na wanyama wa kumbago,” ilawilila ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25"/>Mulungu kausa chila modeli mbasakanyo ya wanyama wa kumbago na chila modeli ya wanyama wowofugigwa na chila modeli ya wang'onyo wotambala. Mulungu kawona vinoga.<verse eid="GEN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26"/>Maabaho Mulungu kalonga, “Lelo chimulumbe munhu yalingile fana cheye. Yatawale somba wa mwiibahali na ndege woguluka na wanyama wowofugigwa na isi yose na wang'onyo wose wowotambala.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27"/>Ivo Mulungu kalumba munhu, yalingile fana yeye mwenyewo. Kawalumba mulume na muke. <verse eid="GEN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28"/>Kawatemela mate na kalonga, “Yelekeni wana wengi, welesi wenu ukale na kuimemeza isi yose na kuitawala. Muwatawale somba weli mwiibahali, ndege woguluka na chila chiumbe chili na ugima chochigenda mwiisi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29"/>Maabaho Mulungu kalonga, “Lola, nomwing'hani chila modeli ya mimeya ili na mbeyu na chila modeli ya mibiki yoikwima matunda yeli na mbeyu muje. <verse eid="GEN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30"/>Na wanyama wose na ndege wose woguluka na wang'onyo wose wotambala mwiisi na viumbe weli na ugima, ndiya yawo izakuwa mayani ya mimeya.” Ilawilila ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31"/>Mulungu kalola chila chinhu chiyatendile, kawona kweli vinoga ng'hani. Iwa imitondo iwa ichigulogulo, siku yesita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1"/>Ivo isi na ulanga na vose vili umo vikomelezeka. <verse eid="GEN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2"/>Muna isiku yesaba Mulungu kakomeleza sang'hano yake yose, na siku iyo yesaba Mulungu kahumula. <verse eid="GEN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3"/>Mulungu kaitemela mate siku yesaba na kaitenda iwe kwa ichimu chake, kwaviya siku iyo Mulungu kakomeleza sang'hano yake yose ya ulumbaji na kahumula.<verse eid="GEN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4"/>Vino niivo Mndewa Mulungu viyalumbile ulanga na isi yose.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 2:4">Mgunda wa Edeni</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Lusita ulo Mndewa Mulungu viyalumbile ulanga na isi, <verse eid="GEN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5"/>hakukalile na masavu bule muna iisi na mimeya haisukile kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu haitonyele mvula iisi na iviya kwabule munhu wa kulima. <verse eid="GEN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6"/>Nzasa ilawa hasi ya ulongo na itapagiza isi yose.<verse eid="GEN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kasola ulongo wa isi na kamuusa mulume, kamuhuvila mhumuzi ya ugima muimhula, na mulume iyo kawa mgima.<verse eid="GEN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kahanda mgunda hatangigwe Edeni, ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa, umo kamwika mulume iyo yoyamuusile. <verse eid="GEN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9"/>Mndewa Mulungu koteza mibiki kulawa muna iisi, chila modeli ya mibiki yoinogeza na yoikwima matunda yofaya kwa ndiya. Hana uludonho lwa mgunda uwo kukala na mbiki woulava ugima na mbiki wa kuwatendeza wanhu wayamanye yanogile na yehile.<verse eid="GEN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10"/>Lwanda lokuluma kulawa muna mgunda wa Edeni na mazi yakulumila muna ichizi, kulawa uko wiigola nyanda nne. <verse eid="GEN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11"/>Zina da lwanda lwa mwanduso ni Pishoni, ulo loizunguluka isi ya Havila ili na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12"/>Zahabu ya isi iyo inoga. Uko iviya kuna mvumbavumba wounung'hila goya wotangigwa bedola na mabwe ya bei ng'hulu yotangigwa oneki. <verse eid="GEN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13"/>Zina da lwanda lwekaidi ni Gihoni, ulo loizunguluka isi yose ya Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14"/>Zina da lwanda lweketatu ni Tigili, ulo lokulumila banzi ya ulawilo wa zua wa isi ya Ashulu. Zina da lwanda lwekane ni Efulati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamsola mulume iyo na kamwika muna mgunda wa Edeni yachilime na yachilolese. <verse eid="GEN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Kodaha kuja matunda ya mbiki wowose muna umgunda, <verse eid="GEN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17"/>mbali sekeuje matunda ya mbiki wa kuyamanya yanogile na yehile, mana siku dondauje matunda ya mbiki uwo, kweli kwizadanganika.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Havinogile bule munhu kukala yaidumwe. Nizamuusila mtazi yomfaya.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19"/>Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kasola ulongo wa isi na kausa chila modeli ya mnyama na ndege woguluka. Maabaho kamgalila mulume iyo muladi yaweng'he mazina, nayo kaweng'ha chila chiumbe yeli na ugima zina jake. <verse eid="GEN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20"/>Ivo mulume iyo kaweng'ha mazina wanyama wofugigwa na ndege woguluka na wanyama wa kumbago, mbali habule hata imwe yoyofaya kumtaza.<verse eid="GEN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamgalila mulume iyo vuwevuwe da nhongo na viyakalile muna zinhongo, kasola lubavu lwake lumwe na kahagubika hanhu baho kwa nyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulava muke muna ulubavu lolusoligwe kulawa kwa mulume iyo, na kamgala kwa mulume iyo. <verse eid="GEN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23"/>Maabaho mulume kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Dino niijo divuha da mivuha yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">nyama ya nyama zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">kezatangigwa muke</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">kwaviya kalavigwa mwa mulume.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24"/>Lekamana mulume kowaleka tati yake na mami yake na koilumba na muke wake, nawo wokuwa lukuli lumwe. <verse eid="GEN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25"/>Mulume na muke wose waidi wakala ukengele, mbali hawawonile chinyala bule.<verse eid="GEN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu woleka kumtegeleza Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1"/>Lelo zoka dikala vwizi kufosa wanyama wose wa kumbago wowalumbigwe na Mndewa Mulungu. Zoka dimuuza imuke, “Vino Mulungu kawalongela kuwa sekemuje tunda da mbiki wowose muna umgunda?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2"/>Muke ija kamwidika, “Chodaha kuja tunda da mbiki wowose muna umgunda, <verse eid="GEN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3"/>mbali Mulungu kachilongela sekechije matunda ya mbiki uli haludonho hebu kuudalisa. One chahatenda ivo chizadanganika.”<verse eid="GEN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4"/>Zoka dimwidika muke iyo, “Siyo kweli, hamwizadanganika.” <verse eid="GEN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5"/>Mana Mulungu kavimanya kuwa muhaja matunda yayo meso yenu yezagubuligwa na mwizakuwa fana yeye na mwizamanya yanogile na yehile.<verse eid="GEN 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6"/>Kawona uja mbiki wounogeza ng'hani na matunda yake yodaha kudika, na kagesa unoga ng'hani uhadahile kuwa na ubala, ivo kaha tunda na kaja. Maabaho kamwing'ha mulumake, nayo iviya kaja. <verse eid="GEN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7"/>Bahobaho viwakomeleze kuja, meso yawo yagubuligwa na wavimanya kuwa waukengele, ivo wasola mayani wayawala.<verse eid="GEN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8"/>Ichigulogulo mbeho viziholile, mulume na muke wake wamuhulika Mndewa Mulungu kogenda muna umgunda, ivo waifisa hagati ya mibiki muladi sekeyawawone. <verse eid="GEN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9"/>Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kamtanga mulume na kamuuza, “Kwa kulihi?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10"/>Nayo kamwidika, “Nikuhulika muna umgunda, nidumba kwaviya naukengele. Ivo niifisa.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamuuza, “Yelihi yoyakulongele weye kwa ukengele? Vino weye kuja tunda da mbiki unikulongele sekeuje?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12"/>Mulume kamwidika, “Mwanamke youmwikile hano na niye, youning'hile, iyo yaning'hile tunda da mbiki uwo. Na niye nidija.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamuuza mwanamke, “Weye kutenda choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Mwanamke kamwidika, “Zoka dinivwizila, na niye nija ditunda.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowatagusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14"/>Mndewa Mulungu kadilongela dizoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">“Kwaviya kuyatenda yano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">weye kuduwiligwa kufosa wanyama wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">Kwizatambala na kwizakuja timbwisi siku zose za ugima wako.<verse eid="GEN 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15"/>Nizatenda weye wiihile na muke ija,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">ulelo wake wiihile na ulelo wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">Yeye kezakuhonda ditwi jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">Na weye kwizamuluma chisiginho chake.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16"/>Na kamulongela mwanamke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">“Nizakongezela usungu vondauwe na wimo na usungu vondawiibasule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">Kwizakuwa na hamu ya kumtawala mulumako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">nayo kezakutawala.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17"/>Na kamulongela imulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">“Kumtegeleza muke wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">na kuja tunda dinikulongele sekeuje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">Kwa chiya chiutendile, isi iduwiligwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">Kwizatenda sang'hano ndala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">siku zose za ugima wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">muladi kupata ndiya ifaya.<verse eid="GEN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18"/>Isi izakwima miwa na mbigili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">na weye kwizakuja mimeya ya isi.<verse eid="GEN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19"/>Kwizatenda sang'hano ndala za kulava vuke kuitenda isi ilave ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">mbaka vondaubwele muna ulongo moulawile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">Weye ni ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">na kwizabwela kuwa ulongo kaidi.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20"/>Mulume kamtanga muke wake Hawa, kwaviya niiyo mama wa wanhu wose weli na ugima. <verse eid="GEN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21"/>Mndewa Mulungu kawatendela viwalo va mbende za wanyama Adamu na muke wake, na kawayawaza.<verse eid="GEN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Hawa wowingigwa muna umgunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Lelo munhu iyo kawa fana imwe wetu, kayamanya yanogile na yehile. Mbali yolondeka kumgomesa kuja diya ditunda da mbiki wa ugima, mana yahadija kezakala siku zose.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23"/>Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kamuwinga Adamu muna umgunda wa Edeni na kamtendeza yalime muna ulongo uyalawile. <verse eid="GEN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24"/>Kamuwinga Adamu, na keka wasenga wakalizi wa kuulanga ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa mgunda wa Edeni, wakala na panga da moto dodikalile dohinduka kuno na kuno muladi waukalize umbiki wa ugima.<verse eid="GEN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kaini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1"/>Adamu kambandama Hawa muke wake, na kapata wimo. Kamweleka mwana wa chilume yatangigwe Kaini, nayo kalonga, “Kwa kutazigwa na Mndewa Mulungu nipata mwana wa chilume.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2"/>Hamwande kamweleka mwana imwenga zina jake Abeli. Abeli kakala mdimi wa ng'hondolo na Kaini kakala mulimi wa isi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3"/>Maabaho Kaini kagala mavuno yake yamwenga na kayalava kuwa nhosa kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4"/>Abeli nayo kagala nyama inogile na mavuta ya ng'hondolo wake wa mwanduso kwelekigwa kuwa nhosa. Mndewa Mulungu kanogelwa na Abeli na nhosa yake. <verse eid="GEN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5"/>Mbali Kaini hatogoligwe na Mndewa Mulungu na nhosa yake, ivo Kaini kengilwa na ludoko ng'hani, na kakwesa ng'hombali. <verse eid="GEN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamuuza Kaini, “Habali kuna ludoko fana ivo? Habali kukwesa ng'hombali? <verse eid="GEN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7"/>Vino uhatenda yanogile hutogoligwa bule? One uhatenda yehile, uhasanyi wokusepasepa muna ulwivi lwako, wokulonda kukutawala mbali kolondeka uuhume.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8"/>Maabaho Kaini kamulongela mdodo wake Abeli, “Chihite kumgunda.” Viwakalile kumgunda, Kaini kamzumhila mdodo wake na kamkoma.<verse eid="GEN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamuuza Kaini, “Kakulihi mdodo wako Abeli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Kamwidika, “Niye sivimanyile bule. Vino niye ndolezi wa mdodo wangu?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kauza, “Kutenda choni? Damu ya mdodo wako ilinga fana dizi donililila kulawa muna uulongo. <verse eid="GEN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11"/>Kwaviya kumkoma mdodo wako na damu yake itika muna isi, weye koduwiligwa kulawa iisi youkala. <verse eid="GEN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12"/>One uhageza kulima ndiya, ulongo hawizakupatila chinhu chochose. Kwizawegela na kwizakuwa kwabule ukazi muna iisi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13"/>Kaini kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Nhaguso yangu iwa ndala na ibasanya siidaha hata kuipapa. <verse eid="GEN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14"/>Lola diyelo kuniwinga muna iisi inogile na kunisegeza haulongozi hako. Nizakuwa nabule ukazi na nowegela muna iisi yose, na munhu yoyose yondayaniwone kezanikoma.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15"/>Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Aka. Munhu yoyose yondayamkome Kaini, kezalihilizigwa miyanza saba.” Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamwika nhale kumzuma yoyose yondayaiting'hane nayo, sekeyamkome. <verse eid="GEN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16"/>Kaini kahasegela ha Mndewa Mulungu na kakala isi itangigwa “Nodi”, niiyo ili ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua wa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Welesi wa Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17"/>Kaini kambandama muke wake, nayo kapata wimo na kamweleka Henoko. Maabaho Kaini kazenga bululu na kaditanga Henoko, zina da mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18"/>Henoko kapata mwana na kamtanga zina jake Iladi; Iladi nayo kamweleka Mehuyaeli; Mehuyaeli kamweleka Mesusayeli, Mesusayeli kamweleka Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19"/>Lameki kakala na wake waidi, imwe katangigwa Ada na imwenga katangigwa Zila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20"/>Ada kamweleka Yabali, yakalile tata wa wafugaji wokala muna yamahema. <verse eid="GEN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21"/>Ndugu yake kakala Yubali, iyo kakala tata wa wose wavina wila na wotowa vimbeta na vingodongodo. <verse eid="GEN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22"/>Zila nayo kamweleka Tubalikaini, yoyakalile muhunzi wa via vose va shaba na mazuma. Lumbu wa Tubalikaini katangigwa Nama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23"/>Lameki kawalongela wake zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Zila nitegelezeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Mweye wake wa Lameki tegelezeni yonimulongelani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Niye nimkoma munhu kwaviya kaning'ha banha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Nimkoma imbwanga kwaviya kanilumiza.<verse eid="GEN 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24"/>Ihawa Kaini kolihigwa miyanza saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">Lameki kezalihigwa miyanza malongo saba na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seti na Enosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25"/>Adamu kambandama kaidi muke wake, nayo keleka mwana wa chilume. Kalonga, “Mulungu kaning'ha mwana wa chilume badala ya Abeli, yoyakomigwe na Kaini.” Ivo kamtanga Seti. <verse eid="GEN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26"/>Seti nayo kapata mwana wa chilume, kamtanga Enosi. Baho wanhu wandusa kumtambikila Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 4:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Welesi wa Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1"/>Uno uwo ludongo lwa welesi wa Adamu. Kwandusila Mulungu viyamulumbile munhu, kamulumba fana yeye mwenyewo, <verse eid="GEN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2"/>Mulungu kawalumba mulume na muke, maabaho kawatemela mate na kaweng'ha zina “Munhu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3"/>Adamu viyakalile na miyaka gana na malongo matatu, kapata mwana yoyalingile yeye, yeli na chihanga fana chake mwenyewo na kamtanga zina jake Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4"/>Viyakomeleze kumweleka Seti, Adamu kakala miyaka magana manane na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike. <verse eid="GEN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5"/>Adamu kadanganika na miyaka magana kenda na malongo matatu.<verse eid="GEN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6"/>Seti viyakalile na miyaka gana na tano, kamweleka mwana zina jake Enosi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7"/>Seti viyamweleke Enosi, kakala miyaka magana manane na saba na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike. <verse eid="GEN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8"/>Seti kadanganika na miyaka magana kenda na longo na midi.<verse eid="GEN 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9"/>Enosi viyawile na miyaka malongo kenda, kamweleka mwana zina jake Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10"/>Enosi viyamalile kumweleka Kenani, kakala miyaka magana manane na longo na tano na kaweleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike. <verse eid="GEN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11"/>Enosi kadanganika na miyaka magana kenda na mitano.<verse eid="GEN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12"/>Kenani viyakalile na miyaka malongo saba, kamweleka mwana zina jake Mahalaleli, <verse eid="GEN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13"/>maabaho viyamalile kumweleka Mahalaleli kakala na miyaka magana manane na malongo mane na kaweleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike. <verse eid="GEN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14"/>Kenani kadanganika na miyaka magana kenda na longo.<verse eid="GEN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15"/>Mahalaleli viyakalile na miyaka malongo sita na tano, kamweleka mwana zina jake Yaledi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16"/>Mahalaleli viyamweleke Yaledi, kakala na miyaka magana manane na malongo matatu, kaweleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na chike, <verse eid="GEN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17"/>Mahalaleli kadanganika na miyaka magana manane na malongo kenda na tano.<verse eid="GEN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18"/>Yaledi viyakalile na miyaka gana na malongo sita na midi, kamweleka mwana zina jake Henoko. <verse eid="GEN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19"/>Maabaho Yaledi viyamalile kumweleka Henoko kakala na miyaka magana manane. Kaweleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike. <verse eid="GEN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20"/>Na kadanganika na miyaka magana kenda na malongo sita na midi.<verse eid="GEN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21"/>Henoko viyakalile na miyaka malongo sita na mitano, kamweleka mwana zina jake Mesusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22"/>Henoko viyamweleke Mesusela kakala kwa kumnogeza Mulungu kwa miyaka magana matatu na kaweleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike. <verse eid="GEN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23"/>Henoko kakala miyaka magana matatu na malongo sita na mitano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24"/>Henoko kakala kwa kumnogeza Mulungu maabaho kasegela, kwaviya Mulungu kamsola.<verse eid="GEN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25"/>Mesusela viyakalile na miyaka gana na malongo manane na saba, kamweleka mwana zina jake Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26"/>Maabaho viyamalile kumweleka Lameki, Mesusela kakala na miyaka magana saba na malongo manane na midi, kaweleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike. <verse eid="GEN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27"/>Mesusela kadanganika na miyaka magana kenda na malongo sita na kenda.<verse eid="GEN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28"/>Lameki viyakalile na miyaka gana na malongo manane na midi, kamweleka mwana wa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29"/>Lameki kamtanga mwana iyo zina jake Nuhu, na kalonga, “Mwana ino niyo yondayachigele moyo kwa kulawa muna isang'hano yetu ndala, yochiitenda kwa makono yetu muna iisi yoyaiduwile Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30"/>Lameki viyamalile kumweleka Nuhu, kakala na miyaka magana matano na malongo kenda na mitano na kaweleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike. <verse eid="GEN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31"/>Lameki kadanganika na miyaka magana saba na malongo saba na saba.<verse eid="GEN 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32"/>Nuhu viyawile na miyaka magana matano, kaweleka wana watatu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafesi.<verse eid="GEN 5:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Wihi wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1"/>Wanhu viwanduse kongezeka muna iisi yose, na wana wa chike welekigwa kumwawo, <verse eid="GEN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2"/>wasenga wa Mulungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya cholongwa, “Wana wa Mulungu,” lusita mwingi ina fambulo da viumbe wa chimuhe siyo wanhu.</char></note> wawawona wandele wa wanhu kuwa lumondo, na wawasola kuwa wake zawo fana viwalondile. <verse eid="GEN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Muhe wangu hawizakala kwa wanhu siku zose, kwaviya wawo ni lukuli. Kwandusila sambi na kugendelela, hawezakala miyaka kufosa miyaka gana na malongo maidi.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4"/>Lusita ulo na kugendelela, kukala na Wanefili <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Wanefili” fambulo jake “mizinhu mitali inenehe.” </char></note> mwiisi, wawo wakala welesi wa wana wa Mulungu na wandele wa wanhu. Wawo niiyo wanhu wakalile magalu, wamanyike ng'hani baho umwaka. <verse eid="GEN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5"/>Mndewa Mulungu kawona wihi mkulu wa wanhu muna iisi na magesa yawo yehile chila siku, <verse eid="GEN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6"/>Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kengilwa usungu ng'hani kwa kumulumba munhu na kumwika muna iisi, na kawona usungu ng'hani muna umoyo wake. <verse eid="GEN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7"/>Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Nizamsegeza munhu yonimulumbile muna isi, na iviya nizawasegeza wang'onyo, waja wotambala na ndege wa kuulanga. Nojuta kwaviya niwalumba.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8"/>Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kanogelwa na Nuhu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9"/>Zino ni mbuli za ugima wa Nuhu yoyakalile yotenda yanogile haulongozi wa Mulungu, mkamilifu muna uwelesi wake. Nuhu kakala kwa kumnogeza Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10"/>Nuhu kaweleka wana watatu wa chilume, wowatangigwe Shemu na Hamu na Yafesi. <verse eid="GEN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11"/>Chila munhu kakala mwihi haulongozi wa Mulungu, na tibwilitibwili jenela chila hanhu. <verse eid="GEN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12"/>Mulungu kawona isi yose imema wihi, kwaviya wanhu watenda ihe.<verse eid="GEN 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13"/>Mulungu kamulongela Nuhu, “Nilamula kuwadanganiza wanhu wose kwaviya waimemeza iisi tibwilitibwili. Kweli nizawadanganiza ng'hani hamwe na isi. <verse eid="GEN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14"/><figure style="fig" file="Noah'sArk.jpg" size="col" ref="6:14">Safina ya Nuhu</figure>Zenga safina kwa mabanzi ya mibiki midala. Gola viheleto na uhake tulasi kunze na mgati. <verse eid="GEN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15"/>Vino niivo vondauizenge, utali wake iwe makono magana matatu na ugalamu wake makono malongo matano na chimo chake makono malongo matatu. <verse eid="GEN 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16"/>Utende chisuwili na chiwe mkono umwe hagati wa digulu maabaho ika lwivi ubanzi umwe, safina iwe na golofa nhatu. <verse eid="GEN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17"/>Na niye nizagala gombo muna iisi muladi kudanganiza chila chiumbe chili na ugima. Chila chinhu muna iisi chizadanganika. <verse eid="GEN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18"/>Mbali nizatenda lagano na weye. Kwizakwingila muna isafina na muke wako, wanago na wake zawo. <verse eid="GEN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19"/>Wagale mwiisafina chila modeli ya viumbe vili na ugima vidi, va chilume na va chike, na uvilolese vikale. <verse eid="GEN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20"/>Wingize chila ndege wa kuulanga, chila wang'onyo wotambala na chila wanyama, waidi waidi muladi wawe wagima. <verse eid="GEN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21"/>Usole chila modeli ya ndiya wiike goya kwa ichimu chenu na kwa ichimu chawo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22"/>Nuhu kasang'hana chila chinhu fana viyalagilizigwe na Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Gombo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Nuhu, “Ingila mwiisafina weye na wanago wose, kwaviya nikuwona weye muhala kunoga haulongozi wangu mwa iwanhu wa isi yose. <verse eid="GEN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2"/>Iviya muna iwanyama wodigwa usole malume saba na mazike saba, mbali wanyama hawadigwa sola lume dimwe na zike dimwe. <verse eid="GEN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3"/>Iviya sola ndege wa kuulanga malume saba na mazike saba, muladi uwakalize ugima wawo mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4"/>Zihafosa siku saba kwandusila sambi nizagala mvula yondaitonye kwa siku malongo mane, imisi na ichilo, muladi kuvibanaga viumbe vigima vose vonivilumbile.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5"/>Nuhu katenda chila chinhu choyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6"/>Gombo vidizile muna iisi, Nuhu kakala na miyaka magana sita. <verse eid="GEN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7"/>Nuhu na muke wake na wanage wa chilume na wake zawo, wengila muna isafina muladi kugomboka na digombo. <verse eid="GEN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8"/>Wose wanyama iwe wambule mwiko hebu hawambule mwiko na wang'onyo na ndege, <verse eid="GEN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9"/>wengila mwiisafina waidi waidi, muke na mulume hamwe na Nuhu, fana Nuhu viyalagilizigwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10"/>Vizifosile siku saba gombo diza.<verse eid="GEN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11"/>Nuhu viyawile na miyaka magana sita, muna isiku ya longo na saba mwezi wekaidi, siku iyo nzasa zose hasi ng'hani ya isi zilava mazi ng'hani na mazonzo ya kuulanga yavuguka. <verse eid="GEN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12"/>Mvula itonya mwiisi siku malongo mane, imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="GEN 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13"/>Siku iyo iyo Nuhu na muke wake wengila muna isafina hamwe na wanawe watatu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafesi na wake zawo. <verse eid="GEN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14"/>Wahita hamwe na chila modeli ya wanyama wa kumbago na chila modeli ya wanyama wofugigwa na chila modeli ya wang'onyo wotambala na chila modeli ya ndege na chila chiumbe chili na mabawa. <verse eid="GEN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15"/>Chila viumbe waidi waidi walume na wake, chila chilumbe chili na ugima chingila muna isafina hamwe na Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16"/>fana Mulungu viyamulagilize. Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kahinda ulwivi hachisogo cha Nuhu.<verse eid="GEN 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17"/>Gombo digendelela kwa siku malongo mane, na yamazi yamema mbaka safina iyengeluka uchanyha ya mazi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18"/>Mazi yawa na china chitali na safina iyengeluka muna yamazi. <verse eid="GEN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19"/>Mazi yakala mengi ng'hani muna iisi, yaigubika milima mitali chila hanhu. <verse eid="GEN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20"/>Mazi yamema mbaka yaigubika milima utali wa makono longo na mitano. <verse eid="GEN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21"/>Vilumbe vose vili na ugima muna iisi vidanganika, ndege wose na wanyama wose wofugigwa na wanyama wose wa kumbago na wang'onyo wose wotambala na wanhu wose. <verse eid="GEN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22"/>Chila chilumbe chikala muna iisi inyalile chidanganika. <verse eid="GEN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23"/>Mndewa Mulungu kavinanga viumbe vose vigima mwiisi, wanhu na wanyama wang'onyo wotambala na ndege woguluka. Kasigala Nuhu muhala na waja wowakalile hamwe nayo muna isafina. <verse eid="GEN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24"/>Mazi yakala muna iisi siku gana na malongo matano.<verse eid="GEN 7:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Uhelelo wa Gombo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1"/>Mbali Mulungu kamkumbuka Nuhu na wanyama wose wa kumbago na wanyama wose wofugigwa wowakalile hamwe nayo muna isafina. Ivo Mulungu kahembelula beho muna iisi na mazi yandusa kuhunguka. <verse eid="GEN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2"/>Nzasa zose za mazi hasi ng'hani ya isi na mazonzo ya kuulanga vihindigwa, na mvula ileka kutonya. <verse eid="GEN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3"/>Mazi yagendelela kuhunguka ugalugagaluga muna iisi. Viifikile siku gana na malongo matano, mazi yahunguka ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4"/>Muna isiku ya longo na saba ya mwezi wa saba, safina ifika muna imilima ya Alalati na ikala baho. <verse eid="GEN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5"/>Mazi yagendelela kuhunguka ugalugagaluga, na siku ya mwanduso ya mwezi wa longo, vidonho va milima viwoneka.<verse eid="GEN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6"/>Vizimalile siku malongo mane, Nuhu kavugula zonzo da isafina yoyaitendile, <verse eid="GEN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7"/>na kamtuma howe kunze, na kaguluka kuno na kuja, mbaka mazi viyanyalile mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8"/>Maabaho Nuhu kamtuma nziwa yawone one mazi yahunguka muna iisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9"/>Mbali kwaviya mazi yakala yang'hali yaigubika isi yose, nziwa hapatile hanhu ha kwima bule. Kabwela kwa Nuhu kuna isafina, Nuhu kaugolosa mkono wake kamsola na kumbweleza muna isafina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10"/>Nuhu kagozela siku zimwenga saba, maabaho kamtuma kaidi nziwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11"/>Nziwa kabwela kwa Nuhu ichigulogulo kuno kana tambi bisi da mzaituni muna umulomo wake. Ivo Nuhu kavimanya kuwa mazi yakala yahunguka muna iisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12"/>Maabaho kagozela siku zimwenga saba, kamtuma kaidi nziwa, mwanza uno nziwa habwelile bule.<verse eid="GEN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13"/>Nuhu viyakalile na miyaka magana sita na umwe, siku ya mwanduso ya mwezi mosi, kawona mazi yakala yanyala muna iisi. Nuhu kagubula chigubiko cha safina, kalola na kuwona isi ikala inyala. <verse eid="GEN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14"/>Siku ya malongo maidi na saba ya mwezi wekaidi, isi ikala inyala ng'hani.<verse eid="GEN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15"/>Maabaho Mulungu kamulongela Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16"/>“Lawa mwiisafina weye na muke wako na wanago na wake zawo. <verse eid="GEN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17"/>Sola chila chiumbe chili na ugima chili na weye, ndege na wanyama wose na wang'onyo ulawe nawo kunze muladi weleke na kwenela muna iisi yose.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18"/>Nuhu kalawa kunze muna isafina hamwe na muke wake na wanage na wake zawo. <verse eid="GEN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19"/>Wanyama wose na vilumbe weli na ugima viya vitambala muiisi na chila modeli wa ndege walawa muna isafina, kwa kusondelela modeli wawo.<verse eid="GEN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu kolava nhosa za kutimbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20"/>Nuhu kamzengela Mndewa Mulungu lupango, kalava nhambiko wanyama wamwenga wodigwa na ndege wodigwa, kamtimbulila Mulungu mchanyha ya ulupango. <verse eid="GEN 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21"/>Mnung'ho unogile wa nhosa iyo umnogeza Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kalonga muna umoyo wake, “Sizaiduwila kaidi isi kwa ichimu cha wanhu. Kwaviya magesa ya wanhu yeha kwandusila kuudodo wawo. Ivo sizainanga kaidi isi fana vinitendile. <verse eid="GEN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22"/>Chipindi isi viikalile, msimu wa kuhanda na kugobola, lusita lwa chihuhe na vuke na masika na zua, chilo na misi, havizamala.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kokwika lagano na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1"/>Mulungu kamtemela mate Nuhu na wanage na kawalongela, “Yelekeni na mongezeke na muimemeze isi yose. <verse eid="GEN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2"/>Wanyama wose muna iisi na ndege woguluka na wang'onyo wotambala na somba wose muna ibahali wezawadumbani. Wawo wose mwizawatawala. <verse eid="GEN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3"/>Chila chinhu chili na ugima na chitambala molondeka kuchija. Fana vinimwing'hileni mibiki isuka, sambi nomwing'hani chila chinhu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4"/>Mbali sekemuje nyama ili na damu, kwaviya ugima wake waumo muna idamu. <verse eid="GEN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5"/>One munhu yoyose hebu mnyama yahamkomani, nizamtagusa. Na one munhu yahamkoma miyage, kezatagusigwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6"/>“Munhu yoyose yondayamkome miyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">iviya nayo kezakomigwa na munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">Mana munhu kalumbigwa yalingile fana Mulungu mwenyewo.<verse eid="GEN 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7"/>Yelekeni na kwenela isi yose.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8"/>Maabaho Mulungu kamulongela Nuhu na wanage, <verse eid="GEN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9"/>“Lelo nokwika lagano jangu na mweye na welesi wenu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10"/>na vilumbe vili na ugima vose vili na weye, ndege na wanyama wofugigwa na chila mnyama wa kumbago yoyalawile muna isafina hamwe na weye. <verse eid="GEN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11"/>Nodikanhamiza lagano jangu na mweye, vilumbe vose vili na ugima havizanangigwa na gombo, hebu gombo hadizalawilila kaidi kuinanga isi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12"/>Mulungu kalonga, “Chino niicho chilaguso cha lagano dinikwika hagati ya niye na mweye na chila chilumbe chili na ugima chikala hamwe na mweye kwa welesi wose mbaka welesi ukwiza, <verse eid="GEN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13"/>nokwika pinde da Mulungu kuna yamawingu. Chizakuwa chilaguso cha lagano jangu na isi yose. <verse eid="GEN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14"/>Chila nahayatanda mawingu muna uulanga na pinde da Mulungu dizalawilila muna yamawingu, <verse eid="GEN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15"/>Nizadikumbuka lagano jangu na mweye na vilumbe vose vili na ugima. Mazi hayezagaluka kaidi kuwa gombo kuvinanga vilumbe vose vili na ugima. <verse eid="GEN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16"/>Baho pinde da Mulungu vondadiwoneke kuna yamawingu, nizadiwona na kudikumbuka lagano jangu na vilumbe vili na ugima mwiisi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17"/>Mulungu kamulongela Nuhu, “Chino ni chilaguso cha lagano donitendile na vilumbe vose vili na ugima muna iisi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu na Wanage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18"/>Wanage Nuhu wowalawile muna isafina wakala Shemu na Hamu na Yafesi. Hamu kakala niiyo tata wa Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19"/>Kufosela wanhu wawo watatu wa Nuhu, wanhu wenela muiisi yose.<verse eid="GEN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20"/>Nuhu kakala wa mwanduso kuhanda mgunda wa mizabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21"/>Kang'wa divai na kakoligwa, maabaho kagona ukulunge muna dihema jake. <verse eid="GEN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22"/>Hamu tata wa Kanani kauwona ukengele wa tati yake, kalawa kunze na kuwalongela ndugu zake waidi. <verse eid="GEN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23"/>Maabaho Shemu na Yafesi wasola walo na waigeleka mmayega yawo na wahita chisengelenyuma na kuugubika ukengele wa tati yawo. Walola mumgwazo na hawauwonile bule ukengele wa tati yawo. <verse eid="GEN 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24"/>Nuhu upele viukunguzuke kavimanya viyatendiligwe na mwanage imdodo, <verse eid="GEN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25"/>kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Nayaduwiligwe Kanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Kezakuwa mtumwa kwa ndugu zake.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26"/>Iviya kalonga, “Yatunhizigwe Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Shemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanani yawe mtumwa wa Shemu.<verse eid="GEN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27"/>Mulungu yamwing'he wana wengi Yafesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">yakale hamwe na Shemu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">na Kanani yawe mtumwa wake.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28"/>Vidimalile gombo, Nuhu kakala miyaka magana matatu na malongo matano <verse eid="GEN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29"/>Nuhu kadanganika na miyaka magana kenda na malongo matano.<verse eid="GEN 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Welesi wa Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1"/>Uno niuwo welesi wa wana wa Nuhu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafesi. Wano watatu weleka wana vidimalile digombo.<verse eid="GEN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2"/>Wana wa Yafesi wakala Gomeli na Magogu na Madayi na Yavani na Tubali na Mesheki na Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3"/>Wana wa Gomeli wakala Ashikenazi na Lifazi na Togoma. <verse eid="GEN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4"/>Wana wa Yavani wakala Elisha na Talishishi na Kitimu na Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5"/>Kufosela wawo wanhu wa mhwani wapwililika muna izisi zawo hamwe na ulonzi wawo na ng'holo zawo na makabila yawo.<verse eid="GEN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6"/>Wana wa Hamu wakala Kushi na Misili na Puti na Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7"/>Wana wa Kushi wakala Seba na Havila na Sabita na Lama na Sabuteka. Wana wa chilume wa Lama wakala Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8"/>Kushi kamweleka Nimulodi, yoyakalile galu wa mwanduso mwiisi yose. <verse eid="GEN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9"/>Kakala galu wa kusaka wanyama haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu, lekamana wanhu wolonga, “Uwe fana Nimulodi yakalile galu wa kusaka haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10"/>Mwanduso wa ufalume wake ukala Babeli na Eleki na Akadi na Kalinehi muna iisi ya Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11"/>Nimulodi viyalawile uko, kahita Ashulu kazenga mabululu ya Ninawi na Lehobosi na Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12"/>na Leseni ili hagati ya Ninawi na Kala, bululu dikulu.<verse eid="GEN 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13"/>Welesi wa Misili ukala Waludima na Wanami na Walehabi na Wanafutuhima <verse eid="GEN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14"/>na Wapatilusi na Wakashuhi na Wakafitoli, Wafilisiti niiyo mwanduso wa Wakashuhi.<verse eid="GEN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15"/>Kanani kakala tata wa Sidoni, mwanage chaudele, na imwenga katangigwa Hiti, <verse eid="GEN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16"/>na Kanani iviya ni tata wa Wayebusi na Waamoli na Wagiligashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17"/>na Wahivi na Waaliki na Wasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18"/>na Waavadi na Wazemali na Wahamati. Hamwande wanhu wa welesi wa Wakanaani waimwaga. <verse eid="GEN 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19"/>Hanhu ha Wakanaani handusila Sidoni kuhita Gelali mbaka kufika Gaza na nzila ya kuhita Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimu mbaka Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20"/>Uno niuwo welesi wa Hamu muna yamakabila yawo na ulonzi wawo na hanhu howokala na ng'holo zawo.<verse eid="GEN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21"/>Nayo Shemu niiyo sekulu wa Yafesi, na kakala wasaho wa wana wose wa Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22"/>Wana wa Shemu wakala Elamu na Ashulu na Alifakisadi na Ludi na Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23"/>Wana wa Alamu wakala Usi na Huli na Geteli na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24"/>Alifakisadi kamweleka Shela, na Shela kamweleka Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25"/>Ebeli keleka wana waidi wa chilume, zina da wa mwanduso ni Pelegi, kwaviya muna ulusita lwake isi iigola, na imwenga zina jake Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26"/>Yokitani kakala tata wa Alimodadi na Shelefu na Hasalimaweti na Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27"/>na Hadolamu na Uzali na Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28"/>na Obeli na Abimayeli na Sheba <verse eid="GEN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29"/>na Ofili na Havila na Yobabu. Wawo wose wakala welesi wa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30"/>Isi yowakalile yenela kulawa Mesha mbaka Sifali kuna mulima wa isi ya ulawilo wa zua. <verse eid="GEN 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31"/>Uno niuwo welesi wa Shemu muna izisi zawo na ulonzi wawo na makabila yawo na ng'holo zawo.<verse eid="GEN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32"/>Zino ni ng'holo za wana wa Nuhu, kusondelela ludongo lwa welesi wawo hamwe na zisi zawo. Wanhu wano wapwililika mwiizisi zose vidimalile digombo.<verse eid="GEN 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Lingo da Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1"/>Umwaka wanhu wa zisi zose wakala na ulonzi umwe muhala na walonga mbuli zimwe muhala. <verse eid="GEN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2"/>Wanhu viwagendile kulawa ulawilo wa zua, wafika bawe da Shinali, wakala. <verse eid="GEN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3"/>Wailongela, “Izoni! Chitende matafali chiyasome moto vinogile.” Wakala na matafali badala ya mabwe, na tulasi badala ya ulongo. <verse eid="GEN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4"/>Maabaho walonga, “Lelo chiizengele bululu jetu na lingo dizafika mbaka kuulanga, muladi zina jetu dimanyike ng'hani na sekechiimwage muna iisi.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5"/>Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kahumuluka na kudiwona bululu na lingo dodikalile dizengigwa na wanhu. <verse eid="GEN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6"/>Na Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Lola wanhu wano wose ni wamwe na wolonga ulonzi umwe, uno ni mwanduso wa sang'hano yawo. Lelo wezadaha kutenda chinhu chochose chiwoilungila. <verse eid="GEN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7"/>Leka chihumuluke na kutibula ulonzi wawo muladi sekewaitegeleze.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8"/>Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kawapwililisa muna iisi yose, nawo waleka kuzenga dibululu. <verse eid="GEN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9"/>Lekamana bululu ijo ditangigwa Babeli, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu katibula ulonzi wa isi yose, na kulawa uko Mndewa Mulungu kawapwililisa wanhu mwiisi yose.<verse eid="GEN 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Welesi wa Shemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10"/>Uno uwo ludongo lwa welesi wa Shemu. Shemu viyakalile na miyaka gana kamweleka Alifakisadi, iyo ikala miyaka midi vidimalile digombo. <verse eid="GEN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11"/>Shemu viyamweleke Alifakisadi kakala miyaka magana matano, na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike.<verse eid="GEN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12"/>Alifakisadi viyakalile na miyaka malongo matatu na mitano, kamweleka Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13"/>Alifakisadi viyamweleke Shela, kakala miyaka magana mane na mitatu, na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike.<verse eid="GEN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14"/>Shela viyakalile na miyaka malongo matatu, kamweleka Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15"/>Shela viyamweleke Ebeli kakala miyaka magana mane na mitatu, na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike.<verse eid="GEN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16"/>Ebeli viyakalile na miyaka malongo matatu na mine kamweleka Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17"/>Ebeli viyamweleke Pelegi kakala miyaka magana mane na malongo matatu, na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike.<verse eid="GEN 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18"/>Pelegi viyakalile na miyaka malongo matatu, kamweleka Lewu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19"/>Pelegi viyamweleke Lewu kakala miyaka magana maidi na kenda, na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike.<verse eid="GEN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20"/>Lewu viyakalile na miyaka malongo matatu na midi kamweleka Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21"/>Lewu viyamweleke Selugi kakala miyaka magana maidi na saba, na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike.<verse eid="GEN 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22"/>Selugi viyakalile na miyaka malongo matatu, kamweleka Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23"/>Selugi viyamweleke Naholi kakala miyaka magana maidi, na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike.<verse eid="GEN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24"/>Naholi viyakalile na miyaka malongo maidi na kenda kamweleka Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25"/>Naholi viyamweleke Tela kakala miyaka gana na longo na kenda, na keleka wana wamwenga wa chilume na wa chike.<verse eid="GEN 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26"/>Tela viyakalile na miyaka malongo saba kaweleka Abulamu na Naholi na Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Welesi wa Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27"/>Uno niuwo welesi wa Tela. Tela kaweleka Abulamu na Naholi na Halani. Nayo Halani kamweleka Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28"/>Halani kadanganika Ulu kuna iisi ya Wakalidayo kuyavumbukile chipindi Tela tati yake yang'hali kokala uko. <verse eid="GEN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29"/>Abulamu na Naholi wasola wake. Muke wa Abulamu katangigwa Salayi na muke wa Naholi katangigwa Milika, mndele wa Halani. Halani iviya niiyo tati yawo Milika na Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30"/>Mbali Salayi kakala kabule wana kwaviya kakala mgumba.<verse eid="GEN 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31"/>Tela kamsola Abulamu mwanage, na Lutu mzukulu wake yoyelekigwe mwanage Halani, na Salayi muke wake Abulamu, na wasegela wose hamwe kulawa Ulu, bululu da Wakalidayo, kuhita kuna iisi ya Kanaani. Viwafikile Halani wakala uko. <verse eid="GEN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32"/>Tela viyakalile na miyaka magana maidi na mitano, kadanganika uko Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Mulungu komtanga Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Abulamu, “Segela muna iisi yako, leka ndugu zako na kaye ya tati yako na uhite kuna iisi yondanikulagusile. <verse eid="GEN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2"/>Nizakutenda uwe kabila kulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:2">na nizakutemela mate</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:2">na nizaditenda zina jako dimanyike ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:2">na kwizawatemela mate wamwenga.<verse eid="GEN 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3"/>Nizawatemela mate wose wowokutemela mate weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Mbali yoyose yokuduwila, nizamduwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">na ng'holo zose muna iisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">zizatemeligwa mate kufosela weye.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4"/>Abulamu viyasegele Halani kakala na miyaka malongo saba na tano, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulongele kutenda. Na Lutu kahita hamwe nayo. <verse eid="GEN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5"/>Abulamu kamsola Salayi muke wake, na mwihwage Lutu na vinhu vake vose na wanhu wose wowawapatile uko Halani. Wasegela kuhita isi ya Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Viwafikile muna iisi ya Kanani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6"/>Abulamu kafosa muna iisi ya Shekemu, hanhu heli na mbiki mkulu uko Mole. Lusita ulo Wakanaani wakala wokala muna iisi iyo. <verse eid="GEN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulawilila Abulamu na kamulongela, “Ino iyo iisi yondaniweng'he welesi wako.” Maabaho Abulamu kamzengela lupango Mndewa Mulungu, yoyamulawilile. <verse eid="GEN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8"/>Viyafosile yayo, kasegela mbaka kuna mulima uli ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua wa Beseli, kasimika hema jake hagati ya Beseli ubanzi wa uswelo wa zua na bululu da Ayi ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua. Baho iviya kamzengela Mndewa Mulungu lupango na kamtambikila. <verse eid="GEN 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9"/>Maabaho Abulamu kagendelela kulawa hanhu mbaka hanhu ubanzi wa Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu uko Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10"/>Kuna iisi ya Kanani kukala na nzala. Ivo Abulamu kahita Misili kukala uko fana mgeni, kwaviya nzala ikala ng'hulu muna iisi. <verse eid="GEN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11"/>Viyakalile habehi kufika Misili, kamulongela Salayi muke wake, “Novimanya kuwa weye kwa muke lumondo. <verse eid="GEN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12"/>Lusita Wamisili vondawakuwone, wezalonga kuwa weye muke wangu, ivo wezanikoma na kukuleka. <verse eid="GEN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13"/>Uwalongele kuwa weye kwa lumbu jangu, muladi kwa ichimu icho wezanitendela yanogile na kunileka mgima kwa ichimu chako.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14"/>Abulamu viyengile Misili, Wamisili wamuwona muke wake kakala lumondo. <verse eid="GEN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15"/>Wakulu womtaza mfalume viwamuwone Salayi, wamtogoza kwa mfalume na kagaligwa muna imhongono ya mfalume. <verse eid="GEN 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16"/>Kwa ichimu cha Salayi, mfalume kamtendela yanogile Abulamu na kahokela ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na vihongwe wa chilume na wa chike na watumwa wa chilume na wa chike na ngamiya.<verse eid="GEN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17"/>Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kamgaza mfalume na wanhu wose weli muimhongono yake kwa matamu makulu kwa ichimu cha Salayi muke wa Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18"/>Maabaho mfalume kamtanga Abulamu na kamuuza, “Chino choni chounitendele? Habali hunilongele kuwa kakala muke wako? <verse eid="GEN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19"/>Habali kulonga kuwa ino mwali wako na niye nimsola kuwa muke wangu? Lelo ayo muke wako, msole na msegele hano.” <verse eid="GEN 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20"/>Maabaho mfalume kawalongela wanhu wake wamuleke Abulamu yasegele hamwe na muke wake na vinhu vake vose.<verse eid="GEN 12:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Abulamu na Lutu woigola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1"/>Abulamu kabwela kulawa Misili kengila ubanzi wa Negebu. Kakala na muke wake na vinhu vake vose hamwe na Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2"/>Abulamu kakala tajili ng'hani. Kakala na fugo na hela na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3"/>Kagendelela kugenda kulawa hanhu ha Negebu mbaka Beseli, kafika hanhu hoyakalile kasimika hema baho haichanduso hagati ya Beseli na Ayi, <verse eid="GEN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4"/>hanhu hoyakalile yazengile lupango. Baho Abulamu kamtambikila Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5"/>Iviya Lutu yoyagendile na Abulamu, kakala na ng'ombe na ng'hondolo na mahema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6"/>Isi haiwafaiye wose waidi kukala hamwe kwaviya wakala na fugo nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7"/>Kwa ivo kulawilila ndwagi hagati ya wadimaji wanyama wa Abulamu na wadimaji wa Lutu. Chipindi icho Wakanaani na Wapelizi wakala wokala muna iisi ija.<verse eid="GEN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8"/>Maabaho Abulamu kamulongela Lutu, “Cheye cha ndugu, sekechigombe, hebu wadimaji wako sekewagombe na wadimaji wangu. <verse eid="GEN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9"/>Lola isi ino yose haulongozi wako, chiigole. Uhahita ukumoso niye nizahita ukulume, hebu uhahita ukulume niye nizahita ukumoso.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10"/>Lutu kenula meso yake na kadiwona bawe da lwanda lwa Yoludani, kawona dina mazi ya kufaya chila hanhu, fana viya mgunda wa Mndewa Mulungu na iviya fana isi ya Misili ubanzi wa Soali. Mndewa Mulungu kakala hanayananga mabululu ya Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11"/>Kwa ivo Lutu kasagula bawe jose da lwanda lwa Yoludani, na kahita ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua. Ivo waigola. <verse eid="GEN 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12"/>Abulamu kakala muna iisi ya Kanaani, mbali Lutu kakala muna yamabululu yaja ya dibawe na kahamila Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13"/>Wanhu wa Sodoma wakala weha na wamuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu kohamila Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14"/>Abulamu viyakomeleze kwiigola na Lutu, Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Inula chihanga chako ulole banzi zose. <verse eid="GEN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15"/>Isi ino yose yowiiwona, nizakwing'ha weye na welesi wako siku zose. <verse eid="GEN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16"/>Welesi wako wizakuwa fana msanga, habule munhu yondayadahe kuupeta. <verse eid="GEN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17"/>Lelo hita na ukaizunguluke isi ija, kwaviya nizakwing'ha.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18"/>Ivo Abulamu kahamiza hema jake, kahita kukala habehi na mibiki mikulu ya Mamule kuja Hebuloni, na uko kamzengela lupango Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Abulamu komkombola Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1"/>Siku izo mfalume Amilafeli wa Shinali na Aliyoki wa Elasali na Kedolilaoma wa Elamu na Tidali wa Goimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2"/>wahita kwiitowa ng'hondo na wafalume wano. Wafalume wawo ni Belo wa Sodoma na Bilisha wa Gomola na Shinabu wa Adima na Shebeli wa Seboimu na mfalume wa Bela iviya yotangigwa Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3"/>Wafalume wawo wayahanganya majeshi yawo yose hana dibawe da Sidimu, vino sambi ni Bahali ya Munyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4"/>Kwa lusita lwa miyaka longo na midi, wakala wolangulizigwa na mfalume Kedolilaoma, mbali viifikile mwaka wa longo na tatu, wamuhinduka. <verse eid="GEN 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5"/>Muna umwaka wa longo na nne, mfalume Kedolilaoma na wafalume wayage weza na kuwahuma Walefai wa uko Ashiteloshi Kiliasaimu na Wazuzi uko Hamu na Waemi uko Shawe Kiliyasaimu. <verse eid="GEN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6"/>Iviya wawahuma Waholi uko kuna mulima wa Seili, wawawinga kutali mbaka Elipalani habehi na dibwilingu. <verse eid="GEN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7"/>Maabaho wabwela kuchisogo mbaka Enimishipati iviya yotangigwa Kadeshi, waihuma isi yose ya Waamaleki na kuwahuma Waamoli wowakalile Hasasoni Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8"/>Maabaho wafalume wa Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimu na Bela iviya yotangigwa Soali, watenda ng'hondo na wehi wawo kuna dibawe da Sidimu <verse eid="GEN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9"/>waitoa na mfalume Kedolilaoma wa Elamu na Tidali wa Goimu na Amilafeli wa Shinali na Aliyoki wa Elasali, wafalume wane waitowa na wafalume watano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10"/>Bawe da Sidimu dikala dimemile makombo ya lami, na baho wafalume wa Sodoma na Gomola viwagezile kukimbila ng'hondo, watumbukiya umo na wamwenga waibangila muna ivigongo. <verse eid="GEN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11"/>Wafalume wawo wane wahumile wasola chila chinhu cha Sodoma na Gomola na ndiya zawo zose, maabaho wasegela. <verse eid="GEN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12"/>Wamgwila Lutu, mwihwa wa Abulamu, yoyakalile yokala Sodoma, wasola na vinhu vake vose, maabaho wasegela.<verse eid="GEN 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13"/>Munhu imwe yoyasulupuke kahita kumulongela ija Muebulaniya Abulamu yoyakalile kokala habehi na mibiki mikulu ya Mamule Muamoli, yoyakalile ndugu yake Eshikoli na Aneli. Wose wakala wailumba na Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14"/>Abulamu viyahulike ndugu yake kagwiligwa, kawatanga wanhu wose wa muna ikaye yake wadahile kwiitowa, wakala magana matatu na longo na nane. Wawasondelela wafalume waja mbaka bululu da Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15"/>Ichilo Abulamu kawagola wanhu wake kuna yamabumbila waitowe na wafalume waja, nayo kawatowa na kuwawinga mbaka Hoba, ili ubanzi wa kasikazi wa Damasiki. <verse eid="GEN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16"/>Kavibweleza vinhu vose visoligwe na wafalume waja, na kambweleza Lutu mwihwage, vinhu vake hamwe na wanaake na wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="GEN 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu kotemiligwa mate na Melikizedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17"/>Abulamu viyabwelile kulawa kuwahuma Kedolilaoma na wafalume wamwenga, mfalume wa Sodoma kahita kuiting'hana nayo hana dibawe da Shawe, iviya ditangigwa Bawe da mfalume. <verse eid="GEN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18"/>Melikizedeki yoyakale mfalume wa Salemu yoyakalile mkulu wa nhambiko wa Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha, kamgalila Abulamu gate na divai. <verse eid="GEN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19"/>Kamtemela mate Abulamu na kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">“Abulamu yatemeligwe mate na Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">yalumbile ulanga na isi.<verse eid="GEN 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20"/>Yatunhizigwe Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:20">yoyakutendile uwahume wehi wako.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Abulamu kamwing'ha Melikizedeki chinhu chimwe muna ichila vinhu longo viyapatile kuna ing'hondo.<verse eid="GEN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21"/>Na mfalume wa Sodoma kamulongela Abulamu, “Niye ning'he wanhu, mbali vinhu ivo sola weye.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22"/>Abulamu kamwidika mfalume wa Sodoma, “Noilaha haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha, yalumbile ulanga na isi yose, <verse eid="GEN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23"/>sizasola lusingija hebu luzabi lwa chilatu, hebu chinhu chako chochose, muladi sekeulonge kuwa kunitendeza niwe tajili. <verse eid="GEN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24"/>Ivo sizasola chochose, ila ndiya ziya muhala ziwadile wanike na vinhu viwapatile kuna ing'hondo. Wowolondeka waja wowakalile hamwe na niye, Aneli na Eshikoli na Mamule uwaleke wawe na vinhu vawo.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kokwika Lagano na Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1"/>Maabaho mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwezila Abulamu kwa malaguso, ilonga, “Sekeudumbe. Niye ni ngawo yako na nizakugweka.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2"/>Mbali Abulamu kamwidika, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwizaning'ha choni na kuno nogendelela kukala bila mwana na muhazi wangu ni Eliyazali wa Damasiki?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3"/>Abulamu kalonga, “Lola huning'hile mwana, mtumwa yavumbuke muna ikaye yangu kezakuwa muhazi wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4"/>Maabaho kahulika mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila kaidi: “Ino mtumwa wako Eliyazali hezakuwa muhazi wako, mbali mwanago yondaumweleke mwenyewo niiyo yondayawe muhazi wako.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulava kunze na kumulongela “Lola kuulanga na geza kuzipeta nhondo, kwizakuwa na welesi mwingi fana nhondo izo.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6"/>Abulamu kamuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu, na kwa ichimu icho Mndewa Mulungu kanogezigwa nayo na kamtogola kanoga haulongozi hake.<verse eid="GEN 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Abulamu, “Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu yonikulavile kulawa Ulu bululu da Wakalidayo, muladi nikwing'he isi ino iwe yako.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8"/>Mbali Abulamu kalonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu nizavimanyaze kuwa isi ija izakuwa yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Abulamu, “Nigalile ng'ombe muke wa miyaka mitatu na mwana luti muke wa miyaka mitatu na bebelu da ng'hondolo da miyaka mitatu na huwa na kinda da nziwa.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10"/>Abulamu kamgalila Mndewa Mulungu wanyama wawo wose, kabalula chila mnyama vihande vidi, keka chila chihande kwa kusonhela miyage, mbali ndege hawakanhile. <verse eid="GEN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11"/>Vilele weza na wema muna imitufi, mbali Abulamu kawawinga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12"/>Zuwa vidikalile doswa, Abulamu kakala na vuwevuwe da nhongo, ziza totolo dimgubika. <verse eid="GEN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Abulamu, “Uvimanye kuwa welesi wako wezakuwa nyambenyambe muna iisi siyo yawo na wezakuwa watumwa na wezagazigwa kwa miyaka magana mane. <verse eid="GEN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14"/>Mbali nizawatagusa wanhu wondawawasang'hanile fana watumwa na hamwande wezasola vinhu vingi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15"/>Weye mwenyewo kwizakala miyaka mingi, maabaho kwizadanganika kwa tindiwalo na kuwandigwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16"/>Welesi wako wizabwela hano muna uwelesi wekane, kwaviya uhasanyi wa Waamoli haunakuwa mwingi muladi niwataguse.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17"/>Zuwa vidiswile na ziza disonga, tanuli difuka yosi na wenge diwoneka na difosa hagati ya maunde ya nyama. <verse eid="GEN 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu katenda chilagano na Abulamu, kalonga, “Nolagana kuweng'ha ino welesi wako wose kusongela lwanda lwa Misili mbaka lwanda lukulu lwa Efulati, <verse eid="GEN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19"/>isi ya Wakeni na Wakenizi na Wakadimoni <verse eid="GEN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20"/>na Wahiti na Wapelizi na Walefai <verse eid="GEN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21"/>na Waamoli na Wakanaani na Wagiligashi na Wayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16"/>
  <para style="s">Salayi na Hajili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1"/>Salayi muke wake Abulamu kakala hanakweleka mwana. Kakala na mtumwa wa chike Mmisili yoyatangigwe Hajili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2"/>Salayi kamulongela Abulamu, “Kuvimanya Mndewa Mulungu haninogele kupata wana. Lelo kambandame mtumwa wangu muladi niwapate wana kufosela yeye.” Abulamu katogola chiya choyalongile Salayi. <verse eid="GEN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3"/>Maabaho Salayi kamsola Hajili mtumwa wake kulawa Misili kamwing'ha Abulamu yawe fana muke wake. Yano yalawilila lusita Abulamu viyakalile kuna isi ya Kanaani miyaka longo. <verse eid="GEN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4"/>Abulamu kambandama Hajili nayo kapata wimo. Hajili viyawonile kapata wimo, kandusa kumwehula Salayi.<verse eid="GEN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5"/>Salayi kamulongela Abulamu, “Wihi uno unitendiligwa kwizahusika nawo. Niye nikugolela mtumwa wangu wa chike, mbali viyawile na wimo kanyehula. Mndewa Mulungu nayahumize hagati ya niye na weye.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6"/>Abulamu kamulongela Salayi, “Mtumwa wako kahasi yako weye, mtendele choulonda.” Maabaho Salayi kamgaza Hajili mbaka kaibanga.<verse eid="GEN 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7"/>Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamvika Hajili kudibwilingu kuna inzasa ya mazi, nzila ya kuhita Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8"/>Na kalonga, “Hajili msang'hani wa Salayi, kulawa kulihi na kohita kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Kamwidika, “Nomkimbila Salayi yonimsang'hanila.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9"/>Msenga ija wa Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Bwela kwa youmsang'hanila ukamtegeleza.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10"/>Maabaho msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Nizakwing'ha welesi mwingi habule munhu yondayadahe kuwapeta.”<verse eid="GEN 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11"/>Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">“Weye kuna wimo na kwizakweleka mwana wa chilume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">na zina jake kwizamtanga Ishumaili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishumaili fambulo jake Mulungu kohulika.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kohulika manhesa yako.<verse eid="GEN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12"/>Ishumaili kezakala fana mhunda mbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">kezakuwa mwihi wa chila munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">na chila munhu kezakuwa mwihi wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">Kezaigola na ndugu zake.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13"/>Hajili kamwing'ha zina Mndewa Mulungu yoyalongile nayo, “Weye ni Mulungu yoniwona.” Na kalonga, “Kweli niye nimuwona yeye yoniwona.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14"/>Lekamana nzasa ija yotangigwa Beeli Laha Iloi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beeli Laha Iloi fambulo jake nzasa ya Mulungu yolola na yeli mgima.</char></note>. Nzasa iyo yahagati ya Kadeshi na Beledi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15"/>Hajili kamwelekela Abulamu mwana wa chilume. Abulamu kamtanga zina jake Ishumaili. <verse eid="GEN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16"/>Hajili viyamweleke Ishumaili, Abulamu kakala na miyaka malongo manane na sita.<verse eid="GEN 16:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Lagano na Ulungwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1"/>Abulamu viyakalile na miyaka malongo kenda na kenda, Mndewa Mulungu kamulawilila na kamulongela, “Niye ni Mulungu mwene Udaho. Nitegeleze siku zose na ukale bila ya kutenda yehile. <verse eid="GEN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2"/>Nizatenda lagano jangu na weye na kukwing'ha welesi mwingi.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3"/>Abulamu katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chidalisa hasi. Mulungu kamulongela, <verse eid="GEN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4"/>“Notenda lagano dino na weye. Nokulongela kwizakuwa tata wa makabila mengi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5"/>Kwandusila sambi, hwizatangigwa Abulamu kaidi, mbali kwizatangigwa Bulahimu, kwaviya nikutenda uwe tata wa makabila mengi. <verse eid="GEN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6"/>Nizakwing'ha welesi mwingii na makabila mengi na wafalume wezalawa kumwako.<verse eid="GEN 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7"/>“Lagano jangu na weye na welesi wako dabule uhelelo. Ivo nizakuwa Mulungu wako na Mulungu wa welesi wako. <verse eid="GEN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8"/>Nizakwing'ha weye na welesi wako isi ino imuli nyambenyambe sambi. Isi yose ya Kanaani izakuwa yenu siku zose, na niye nizakuwa Mulungu wawo.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9"/>Maabaho Mulungu kamulongela Bulahimu, “Weye iviya kolondeka wamhe lagano jangu, weye na welesi wako wose. <verse eid="GEN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10"/>Vino niivo vimulondeka kutenda weye na welesi wako, chila mulume kolondeka yengizigwe ulungwana. <verse eid="GEN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11"/>Mwizakwingizigwa ulungwana, na ino izakuwa chilaguso cha lagano da mweye na niye. <verse eid="GEN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12"/>Chila mwana wa chilume wa siku nane vimuli kolondeka yengizigwe ulungwana na chila mulume wa welesi wenu, yawe mtumwa yelekigwe muna ikaye yenu hebu yoyaguligwe kwa hela zenu kulawa kwa manyambenyambe <verse eid="GEN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13"/>na chila mwana wa chilume yelekigwe muna ikaye yako hebu yaguligwe kwa hela kolondeka yengizigwe ulungwana. Chino chizakuwa chilaguso muna ulukuli kulagusa kuwa lagano donikile na weye ni da siku zose. <verse eid="GEN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14"/>Mulume yoyose hengizigwe ulungwana kezabaguligwa na wanhu wake, kwaviya hadikile lagano jangu bule.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15"/>Maabaho Mulungu kamulongela Bulahimu, “Mke wako hwizamtanga kaidi Salayi, kwandusila sambi zina jake Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16"/>Nizamtemela mate, nayo kezakwelekela mwana wa chilume. Nizamtemela mate Sala, nayo kezakuwa mama wa makabila mengi na wafalume wa zisi nyingi wezalawa kumwake.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17"/>Bulahimu katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi, kaseka na kalonga muna umoyo wake, “Vino mulume yeli na miyaka gana kodaha kupata mwana? Vino Sala kodaha kupata mwana na miyaka malongo kenda?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18"/>Bulahimu kamuuza Mulungu, “Habali humuleka Ishumaili yahazi chiya chounilaganile?”<verse eid="GEN 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19"/>Mulungu kedika, “Siyo. Muke wako Sala kezakwelekela mwana wa chilume, nayo kwizamtanga Isaka. Nizakwika lagano jangu kumwake na welesi wake. Ijo ni lagano da siku zose. <verse eid="GEN 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20"/>Nihulika pulo jako kusonhela Ishumaili, ivo nizamtemela mate na kumwing'ha wana wengi na welesi mwingii. Kezakuwa tata wa wafalume longo na waidi, na nizakutenda uwe kabila kulu. <verse eid="GEN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21"/>Mbali nizakwika lagano jangu kwa mwanago Isaka, yondayelekigwe na Sala lusita fana luno mwaka ukwiza.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22"/>Mulungu viyakomeleze kulonga na Bulahimu, kahita kuchanyha kuulanga.<verse eid="GEN 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23"/>Bulahimu kawasola Ishumaili mwanage na walume wamwenga wose, wowelekigwe mwiikaye yake na wowaguligwe kwa hela zake, kawengiza ulungwana fana Mulungu viyamulagilize. <verse eid="GEN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24"/>Bulahimu viyengizigwe ulungwana kakala na miyaka malongo kenda na kenda, <verse eid="GEN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25"/>na Ishumaili mwanage viyengizigwe ulungwana kakala na miyaka longo na mitatu. <verse eid="GEN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26"/>Bulahimu na Ishumaili mwanage wengizigwa ulungwana siku iyo. <verse eid="GEN 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27"/>Walume wose weli muna ikaye ya Bulahimu, wowelekigwe muna ikaye yake na wowaguligwe kwa hela, wengizigwa ulungwana hamwe nayo.<verse eid="GEN 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kolagusa chilagano chake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulawila Bulahimu heli na mibiki mikulu ya Mamule. Bulahimu kakala yakalile hana ulwivi lwa dihena jake lusita lwa vuke da imisi. <verse eid="GEN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2"/>Kalola uchanyha na kawawona wanhu watatu wema habehi nayo. Kawakimbilila hima hima kuwahokela, kadulisa ditwi jake mbaka chihanga chidalisa hasi, <verse eid="GEN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3"/>na kalonga, “Wenevale, one munogelwa na niye sekemuifose kaye yangu bila kwima, nahano muladi nidahe kuwasang'hanila. <verse eid="GEN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4"/>Niwagalileni mazi muladi mudahe kuguma nhende na kuhumula hasi hana umbiki uno. <verse eid="GEN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5"/>Kuno mohumula niifunganye ndiya chidogo muladi muje mpate nguvu ya kugendelela na mwanza wenu, kwaviya munizila niye mtumwa wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Nawo wamwidika “Vinoga, sang'hana fana viulongile.” <verse eid="GEN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6"/>Bulahimu kabwela hima kuna ihema kamulongela Sala, “Lopola, sola mhishi tano za usage unogile na uhonde magate.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7"/>Maabaho Bulahimu kakimbila kuna dibumbila da zing'ombe kasagula dang'ang'a dimwe ng'ombe dinenehe, kamwing'ha msang'hani, yoyadisasale hima hima. <verse eid="GEN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8"/>Maabaho Bulahimu kasola matombo, matombo yagandile na ija inyama ifunganyigwe, kawasasalila ndiya manyambenyambe na kawekila, nayo kema habehi viwakalile woja haja hasi hana umbiki.<verse eid="GEN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9"/>Maabaho wamuuza, “Kakulihi muke wako Sala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Kawedika, “Kakuja kugati kuna ihema.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10"/>Imwe wa nyambenyambe waja kamulongela Bulahimu, “Lusita fana luno mwaka ukwiza nizakubwelela, na muke wako Sala kezakuwa na mwana wa chilume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sala kakala hachisogo chake hana ulwivi lwa ihema kotegeleza. <verse eid="GEN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11"/>Bulahimu na Sala wakala walala ng'hani, na Sala kafosa lusita lwa kweleka. <verse eid="GEN 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12"/>Kwa ivo Sala kaseka chimoyomoyo na kalonga, “Sambi niye namulala. Lelo nodahaze kudeng'helela kupata wimo kwa mulumangu yeli mulala?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13"/>Baho Mndewa Mulungu kamuuza Bulahimu, “Habali Sala kaseka na kalonga, ‘Kweli izadahika nyeleke mwana na niye mulala?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14"/>Vino kuna jojose hadidahika kwa Mndewa Mulungu? Lusita fana luno mwaka ukwiza nizabwela, na Sala kezakuwa na mwana wa chilume.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15"/>Ivo Sala kadumba, kabela na kalonga, “Sisekile bule.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Ona, kuseka.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bulahimu kowapulila wanhu wa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16"/>Maabaho wanhu wawo wasegela wahita hanhu howadahile kudiwona bululu da Sodoma, na Bulahimu kawasindikiza. <verse eid="GEN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17"/>Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Nimfise Bulahimu mbuli zondanitende? <verse eid="GEN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18"/>Bulahimu kezakuwa tata wa kabila kulu, kufosela yeye wanhu wa zisi zose wezatemeligwa mate. <verse eid="GEN 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19"/>Nimsagula yeye muladi yawafundize wanage na waja wokala muna ikaye yake kusondelela nzila ya Mndewa Mulungu kwa kutenda yanogile haulongozi wangu. Na niye nizamtendela Bulahimu chiya chonimulaganile.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Nihulika kuna mbuli zihile nyingi kwa wanhu wa Sodoma na Gomola, na uhasanyi wawo ubasanya. <verse eid="GEN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21"/>Nihumuluke nihite uko nikalole mwenyewo fana yoniyahulike ni kweli.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22"/>Maabaho wanhu waja wasegela na wahita kusonhela Sodoma mbali Mndewa Mulungu kasigala na Bulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23"/>Bulahimu kamkwenhukila Mndewa Mulungu kamuuza, “Vino weye kwizawananga wanhu wanogile hamwe na wehile? <verse eid="GEN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24"/>Yahawa muna dibululu muna wanhu wanogile haulongozi wa Mulungu, vino kwizadinanga bululu ijo jose? Vino kwizadinanga bululu jose badala ya kudileka kwa ichimu cha wanhu wanogile malongo matano weli umo? <verse eid="GEN 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25"/>Sigesa kuwa kwizatenda ivo, kuwakoma wanhu wanogile hamwe na wehile, kuwatendelela wanhu wanogile na wehile. Vino msemi wa isi yose hatenda yanogile?”<verse eid="GEN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Nahawafika wanhu wanogile malongo matano kuja kudibululu da Sodoma nizadileka bululu jose kwa ichimu chawo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27"/>Bulahimu kamulongela kaidi, “Nolamba unilekelele nilonge na Mndewa, niye nili matimbwisi na maivu. Niye ni munhu muhala na sifaya kulonga chinhu chochose. <verse eid="GEN 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28"/>Mbali huwenda wopatika wanhu wanogile malongo mane na tano. Ivo kwizadinanga bululu jose kwaviya waswela wanhu watano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Mndewa Mulungu kedika, “Sizadinanga bule bululu one nahawafika wanhu wanogile malongo mane na tano.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29"/>Bulahimu kalonga kaidi, “Huwenda kwizakuwa na wanhu wanogile malongo mane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Kamwidika, “Sizadinanga bule one kuna wanhu malongo mane.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30"/>Bulahimu kalonga, “Nokulamba Mndewa, sekeuwe na ludoko mbali leka nilonge kaidi. One wahawafika wanhu malongo matatu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Kamwidika, “Sizatenda ivo bule one nahawafika wanhu malongo matatu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31"/>Bulahimu kalonga, “Kwaviya nikulamba bila ya ludumbo, nokulamba kaidi Mndewa. One wahawafika wanhu malongo maidi muhala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Kamwidika, “Sizadinanga bule one nahawafika wanhu malongo maidi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32"/>Bulahimu kalonga, “Nokulamba Mndewa sekeuwe na ludoko, mbali nolamba nilonge kaidi mwanza umwe muhala. Yokuwaze wahawafika wanhu longo muhala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Sizadinanga bule dibululu ijo one nahawafika wanhu longo.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33"/>Mndewa Mulungu viyakomeleze kulonga na Bulahimu, kasegela, Bulahimu kabwela ukaye.<verse eid="GEN 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19"/>
  <para style="s">Wihi wa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1"/>Wasenga wa kuulanga waidi wafika Sodoma ichigulogulo, Lutu kakala yakalile hana ulwivi lwa dibululu. Viyawawone, kahita kuwahohela na kuwatumbalila mavindi mbaka chihanga chidalisa hasi. <verse eid="GEN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2"/>Kalonga, “Wenevale wangu, ingileni muna ikaye yangu niye msang'hani wenu. Modaha kunawa nhende na kugona chilo cha diyelo, igolo imitondo modaha kusegela na kugendelela na mwanza wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Mbali wawo wamwidika, “Bule, chizakala chilo chose hano hana ulubuga.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3"/>Lutu kawabembeleza ng'hani mbaka watogola, wahinduka na kwingila muna ikaye yake. Lutu kawasasalila magate hayagumigwe lusu na kasasalila dugila kwa manyambenyambe. Manyambenyambe waja zindiya zisasaligwe.<verse eid="GEN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4"/>Nyambenyambe wang'hali hawanagona, walume wa Sodoma waizunguluka kaye ya Lutu. Walume wose wa bululu diya, wakulu na wadodo wakala baho. <verse eid="GEN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5"/>Wamtanga Lutu kunze na wamuuza, “Wakulihi walume waja wezile kumwako? Chilavile kunze muladi chiwabandame.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6"/>Lutu kalawa kunze na kahinda ulwivi. <verse eid="GEN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7"/>Kawalongela, “Mbwiya zangu, nowalamba sekemutende wihi uno. <verse eid="GEN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8"/>Mbali ninawo wali waidi wang'hali mhambe. Lekeni nimwing'heni wawo na mweye mwizawatenda chochose chimulonda kuwatenda. Mbali wanhu wano sekemuwatende chochose, kwaviya wano ni nyambenyambe wangu, nolondeka niwakalize.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9"/>Mbali wawo walonga, “Teng'hu segela hano! Weye kwa nyambenyambe, na weye kwa yelihi kochilongela cha kutenda? Koitenda weye kwa msemi wetu? Ivo chokutenda yehile kufosa wawo wafosanzila wako.” Wamsung'ha Lutu kuchisogo wamsegeza mbaka walonda kulubena ulwivi lwake. <verse eid="GEN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10"/>Mbali waja iwanhu waidi wowakalile mgati, wagolosa makono yawo, wamkwesa Lutu mgati mwa ikaye na kuluhinda ulwivi. <verse eid="GEN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11"/>Maabaho kawatenda wanhu wose wowakalile haulwivi watulike yameso, wakulu kwa wadodo, mbaka hawadahile bule kulupata ulwivi.<verse eid="GEN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutu kosegela Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12"/>Wanhu waja iwaidi wamulongela Lutu, “One kuna munhu yoyose yokala hano, wanago wa chilume na wandele zako na wakoyi hebu ndugu imwenga yokala muna dibululu, uwalave hanhu hano himahima. <verse eid="GEN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13"/>Chizahananga hanhu hano, kwaviya kuiyalala kwa wanhu wa hano kumfikila Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kachituma chidinange bululu da Sodoma.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14"/>Maabaho Lutu kawagendela wakoyi zake wowolonda kuwasola wandele zake na kawalongela, “Segeleni hano himahima, Mndewa Mulungu kohananga hanhu hano.” Mbali wawo wamuwona fana viya kehuka.<verse eid="GEN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15"/>Vikuchile wasenga waja wa kuulanga wamulongela Lutu, “Lopola na umsole muke wako na wano wandele zako waidi muladi sekemwize kunangigwa lusita bululu dino vondaditagusigwe.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16"/>Mbali Lutu kakalama. Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kamuwonela ubazi, waja iwasenga wa kuulanga wawamha Lutu na muke wake na wandele zake waidi, wawalava mudibululu. <verse eid="GEN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17"/>Viwakomeleze kuwalava, imwe wa wasenga waja wa kuulanga kalonga, “Kimbileni muladi muhonyeke. Sekemulole kuchisogo na sekemwime muna dibawe, kimbilileni muna imilima muladi sekemukomigwe.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18"/>Mbali Lutu kamwidika, “Siyo, wenevale wangu. <verse eid="GEN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19"/>Muninogela na kunihonya ugima wangu kwa kunilagusa ulondo. Mbali milima yakutali, ivo kunangigwa kuno kwizanifika ning'hali sinafika uko na nizadanganika. <verse eid="GEN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20"/>Loleni kuja kuna bululu dodo nodaha kudikimbilila kwaviya dahabehi. Lelo nilekelele nikimbilile uko. Diya ni bululu dodo muhala na uko nizahonyeka.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21"/>Nayo kamwidika, “Vinoga, nitogola chiupulile, sizadinanga bululu diya. <verse eid="GEN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22"/>Kimbila! Himahima! Sizadaha kutenda chochose mbaka vondaufike uko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:22">Lutu kaditanga bululu ijo “Soali” fambulo jake “Dodo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kunangigwa kwa Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23"/>Zuwa dikala dilawile lusita Lutu viyafikile Soali. <verse eid="GEN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kagala makala ya moto kulawa kuulanga muna yamabululu ya Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25"/>Kayananga mabululu yayo na bawe jose na wanhu wose wowakalile uko na mimeya yose yoikalile muna isi. <verse eid="GEN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26"/>Mbali muke wake Lutu kalola kuchisogo na kagaluka mhanda ya munyu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27"/>Igolo yake imitondo, Bulahimu kahita himahima hoyakalile kema haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28"/>Viyakalile baho, kalola Sodoma na Gomola na banzi zose za dibawe, kalola na kawona yosi dofuka kulawa muna isi, yosi fana viya da tanuli kulu. <verse eid="GEN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29"/>Baho Mulungu viyanangile mabululu ya dibawe Lutu hoyakalile kokala, kamkumbuka Bulahimu kwa kumulava Lutu muna yamabululu yano, muladi Lutu sekeyanangigwe.<verse eid="GEN 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanduso wa Wamowabu na Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30"/>Kwaviya Lutu kakala kodumba kukala Soali, yeye na wandele zake waidi wasegela kuna na wahita kukala kuna dituka kuna imilima. <verse eid="GEN 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31"/>Imndele imkulu kamulongela mdodo wake, “Sambi tati yetu mulala na muna iisi habule mulume wa kuchisola chipate wana fana viili muna isi. <verse eid="GEN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32"/>Lelo chimng'wize upele tati yetu muladi chidahe kwiibandama nayo chimwelekele wana.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33"/>Ichilo icho wamng'wiza upele tati yawo, na imndele imkulu kahita kaibandama nayo. Mbali tati yake havimanyile bule lusita imndele wake viyaibandame nayo, kwaviya kakala yakoligwe.<verse eid="GEN 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34"/>Igolo yake imndele imkulu kamulongela imdodo, “Niibandama na tata ichilo, Lelo leka chimng'wize upele kaidi maabaho weye wiibandame nayo, ivo chose chizakweleka nayo wana.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35"/>Ivo ichilo icho wamng'wiza upele tati yawo, maabaho ija imndele imdodo, kahita kaibandama nayo. Mbali tati yake havimanyile bule lusita mndele wake viyaibandame nayo, kwaviya kakala yakoligwe. <verse eid="GEN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36"/>Kwa nzila ino wandele wose wa Lutu weng'higwa wimo na tati yawo. <verse eid="GEN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37"/>Imndele imkulu keleka mwana na zina jake kamtanga Moabu, iyo niiyo wasaho yawo Wamoabu mbaka diyelo. <verse eid="GEN 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38"/>Imndele imdodo iviya keleka mwana na zina jake kamtanga Benami. Iyo niiyo wasaho yawo Waamoni mbaka diyelo.<verse eid="GEN 19:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Bulahimu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1"/>Bulahimu kasegela kahita ubanzi wa Negebu, kakala Gelali hagati ya Kadeshi na Shuli kwa lusita. <verse eid="GEN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2"/>Bulahimu kalonga kuwa Sala kakala lumbu jake. Ivo mfalume Abimeleki wa Gelali kamsola Sala. <verse eid="GEN 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3"/>Mbali ichilo Mulungu kamulawilila Abimeleki muna zinzozi na kamulongela, “Kwizadanganika kwaviya kumsola muke ino, yoyamalile kusoligwe.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4"/>Mbali Abimeleki hambandame Sala na kalonga, “Mndewa, niye ninoga haulongozi wako! Vino kwizaninanga niye na kabila jangu? <verse eid="GEN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5"/>Bulahimu mwenyewo kalonga kuwa kakala lumbu jake, Sala iviya kalonga ivo ivo. Nitenda voilondeka na sisang'hane wihi.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6"/>Mulungu kamwidika Abimeleki muna zinzozi, “Vinoga, novimanya kuwa yayo youtendile yanoga muumoyo, ivo nikugomesa sekeunitendele uhasanyi na sikulekile umdalise muke iyo. <verse eid="GEN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7"/>Mbali lelo mbweleze muke iyo kwa mulumake, Bulahimu ni mulotezi wa Mulungu nayo kezakutosela, hwizadanganika bule. Mbali one humbweleze, nokuzuma uvimanye kwizadanganika weye na wanhu wako wose.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8"/>Imitondo ng'hani Abimeleki kawatanga wasang'hani wake wose na kawalongela mbuli zose zozilawilile, nawo wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9"/>Maabaho Abimeleki kamtanga Bulahimu na kamuuza, “Kuchitendela choni? Nikubananga choni mbaka kunitenda niwe habehi na kutenda uhasanyi niye na ufalume wangu? Kunitendela mbuli za mdukula hazifaya bule kusang'hanigwa.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10"/>Abimeleki kamuuza Bulahimu, “Habali kusang'hana ivo?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11"/>Bulahimu kamwidika, “Nitenda ivo kwaviya nigesa hanhu hano habule munhu yomdumba Mulungu, iviya mwahadahile kunikoma muladi mumsole muke wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12"/>Iyo kweli ni lumbu jangu. Yeye ni mwana wa tati yangu, mbali siyo mwana wa mami yangu, na nimsola. <verse eid="GEN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13"/>Lusita Mulungu viyanisegeze muna ikaye ya tati yangu na kunigala kuna iisi imwenga, nimulongela muke wangu, ‘One uhanilonda, hohose hondachihite umulongele chila munhu kuwa weye ni lumbu jangu.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14"/>Maabaho Abimeleki kambweleza Sala kwa Bulahimu, iviya kamwing'ha ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na watumwa wa chilume na watumwa wa chike. <verse eid="GEN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15"/>Maabaho Abimeleki kamulongela Bulahimu, “Lola isi ino yose yangu, kala hohose houlonda.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16"/>Maabaho Abimeleki kamulongela Sala, “Nomwing'ha lumbu jako vihande magana longo va hela, kuwalagusa wose weli hamwe na weye kuwa kunoga haulongozi wa Mulungu. Chila munhu yavimanye kuwa kwabule wihi.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17"/>Maabaho Bulahimu kampula Mulungu, na Mulungu kawahonya Abimeleki na muke wake na watumwa wake wa chike, ivo weleka wana. <verse eid="GEN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18"/>Mana Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda wanhu wa kaye ya Abimeleki sekeweleke wana, kwa ichimu cha Sala muke wa Bulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Kwelekigwa kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamtemela mate Sala fana viyamulongele. <verse eid="GEN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2"/>Sala kapata wimo na kamwelekela Bulahimu mwana viyakalile mulala. Imwana kelekigwa lusita luja Mulungu loyalongile kezakwelekigwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3"/>Bulahimu kamtanga zina jake Isaka, <verse eid="GEN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4"/>Isaka viyakalile na siku nane, Bulahimu kamwingiza ulungwana fana Mulungu viyamulagilize. <verse eid="GEN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5"/>Bulahimu kamweleka Isaka viyakalile na miyaka gana. <verse eid="GEN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6"/>Sala kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu kanigalila deng'ho na seko. Chila yondayahulike mbuli ino kezaseka na niye.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7"/>Maabaho Sala kongezela kulonga, “Yelihi yahadahile kumulongela Bulahimu kuwa niye Sala nizakong'heza wana? Mbali nimwelekela mwana wa chilume muna ulala wake.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8"/>Imwana kakula, na siku viyalekezigwe kong'ha, Bulahimu katenda dugila kulu.<verse eid="GEN 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hajili na Ishumaili wowingigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9"/>Siku dimwe Sala kamuwona Ishumaili mwana wa Bulahimu yoyelekigwe na Hajili Mmisili, koseka. <verse eid="GEN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10"/>Sala kawawona na kamulongela Bulahimu, “Msegeze mtumwa ino na mwanage. Mwana wa mwanamke mtumwa hadaha kuhazi hamwe na mwanangu Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11"/>Mbuli ino imguma luholozi ng'hani Bulahimu, kwaviya Ishumaili nayo iviya kakala mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12"/>Mbali Mulungu kamulongela Bulahimu, “Sekeuwe na luholozi kwa ichimu cha mwana ino na Hajili mami yake. Mbuli yoyose yondayakulongele Sala uitende, kwaviya kufosela Isaka kwizakuwa na welesi wonikulaganile. <verse eid="GEN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13"/>Iviya nizampatila wana wengi, mwana wa mtumwa wako wa chike, nizamwing'ha makabila mengi kwaviya iyo nayo mwanago.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14"/>Igolo yake imitondo Bulahimu kamwing'ha Hajili ndiya na nongo imemile mazi. Kamtwika mwanage mdiyega na kumuwinga hamwe na mami yake. Wasegela na wengila muna dibwilingu da Belisheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15"/>Mazi viyamalile yose muna inongo, kamuleka imwana hasi ya mbiki mguhi. <verse eid="GEN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16"/>Nayo kahita kumgwazo utali wa magulu gana. Kuno kolongelela kuna umoyo wake, “Sidaha bule kumuwona mwanangu viyodanganika.” Hajili viyakalile kumgwazo kandusa kulila kwa dizi kulu.<verse eid="GEN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17"/>Mulungu kamuhulika imwana kolila, msenga wa Mulungu kulawa kuulanga kamulongela Hajili, “Kuna uzidilwa waki Hajili? Sekeudumbe kwa viya Mulungu kahulika imbwanga viyolila. <verse eid="GEN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18"/>Ima na umwinule imwana vinogile, mana nizamtenda yawe wasaho wa makabila mengi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19"/>Maabaho Mulungu kamgubula yameso Hajili, nayo kawona sima da mazi. Kahita na kaimemeza mazi inongo na kamwing'ha mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20"/>Mulungu kawa hamwe na imwana, nayo kakula, kakala muna dibwilingu da Palani, iviya kakala galu wa kutowa misale. <verse eid="GEN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21"/>Kakala kuna dibwilingu da Palani, mami yake kamsolela muke kulawa isi ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lagano da Bulahimu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22"/>Chipindi icho Abimeleki hamwe na Fikoli mkulu wa wakalizi wake, kamulongela Bulahimu, “Mulungu kahamwe na weye kwa chila chinhu chiutenda. <verse eid="GEN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23"/>Ivo ilahile kwa zina da Mulungu kuwa hwizanivwizila niye na wanangu na welesi wangu. Fana niye viniwile mwaminika kumwako, ivo na weye uwe mwaminika kumwangu na kwa isi yuukala.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24"/>Bulahimu kalonga, “Noilaha.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25"/>Maabaho Bulahimu kamulongela Abimeleki kwa ichimu cha sima diya dowamuhokile watumwa wa Abimeleki. <verse eid="GEN 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26"/>Mbali Abimeleki kamulongela, “Niye sivimanyile bule yelihi yoyatendile vino. Na weye hunilongele bule mbuli zino, hebu sinahulika mbuli zino mbaka diyelo.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27"/>Maabaho Bulahimu kasola ng'hondolo na ng'ombe lume na kamgolela Abimeleki, nawo waidi weka lagano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28"/>Bulahimu kawabagula wanang'hondolo wa chike saba, <verse eid="GEN 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29"/>Abimeleki kamuuza Bulahimu, “Habali kutenda ivo?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30"/>Bulahimu kamwidika, “Wanang'hondolo wano wa chike saba, nokwing'ha kwa mkono wangu mwenyewo muladi iwe ukalangama kuwa niye iyo nihimbile sima dino.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31"/>Hanhu baho hatangigwa Belisheba, fambulo jake, “Sima da kuilahila.”<verse eid="GEN 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32"/>Viwakomeleze kutenda lagano uko Belisheba, Abimeleki na Fikoli yakalile mkulu wake wa wakalizi wasegela kubwela kuna iisi ya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33"/>Bulahimu kahanda mbiki woutangigwa tamalisiki uko Belisheba na katambika kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa siku zose. <verse eid="GEN 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34"/>Bulahimu kakala muna iisi ya Wafilisiti kwa siku nyingi.<verse eid="GEN 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22"/>
  <para style="s">Mulungu komgeza Bulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1"/>Viyafosile yayo Mulungu kamgeza Bulahimu. Kamulongela, “Bulahimu!” Nayo Bulahimu kamwidika, “Nabaha!”<verse eid="GEN 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2"/>Mulungu kamulongela, “Umsole Isaka mwanago nyachende youmulonda na uhite mbaka isi ya Moliya na umulave nhosa ya kutimbuligwa muna mulima uja wondanikulongele.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3"/>Imitondo ng'hani Bulahimu kalamka na kampapiza mbahasha chihongwe wake na kawasola wasang'hani wake waidi na Isaka mwanage, kahita kukanha ngodi kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula. Maabaho wahita hanhu hoyalongeligwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4"/>Siku yetatu Bulahimu kenula yameso yake na kahawona hanhu baho kwa kutali. <verse eid="GEN 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5"/>Maabaho Bulahimu kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Kaleni hano hamwe na ichihongwe, niye na ino imbwanga chohita kuja mchanyha kutosa maabaho chizawabwelela mweye.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6"/>Bulahimu kasola zingodi kamtwika Isaka mwanage kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya kutimbuligwa na Bulahimu kasola moto na mwele, wose waidi wahita hamwe. <verse eid="GEN 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7"/>Isaka kamulongela tati yake, “Tata!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Bulahimu kamwidika, “Aino mwanangu, kolongaze?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaka kamuuza, “Moto na ngodi ivo vino, mbali ng'hondolo wa nhambiko ya kutimbula kakulihi?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8"/>Bulahimu kamwidika, “Mulungu mwenyewo kezaning'ha ng'hondolo wa nhambiko ya kutimbula.” Wawo waidi wagendelela na umwanza.<verse eid="GEN 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9"/>Viwafikile hanhu baho Mulungu hoyamulongele, Bulahimu kazenga lupango na kwika ngodi uchanyha yake. Maabaho kamfunga Isaka mwanage na kamtambalisa uchanyha ya zingodi muulupango. <verse eid="GEN 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10"/>Bulahimu kawinula mwele wake kumchinja mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11"/>Mbali msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamtanga kulawa kuulanga, “Bulahimu, Bulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Bulahimu kamwidika, “Nabaha.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12"/>Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Sekeumulumize imwana, hebu sekeumtendele chinhu chochose,” Lelo nivimanya weye komtegeleza Mulungu, kwaviya hunimile bule mwanago nyachende.<verse eid="GEN 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13"/>Bulahimu kenula meso na kawona bebelu da ng'hondolo dinamata mhembe zake kuna ichisolo, Bulahimu kahita na kamsola, kamulava nhambiko ya kutimbula badala ya mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14"/>Bulahimu kahatanga hanhu baho, “Mndewa Mulungu kaning'ha.” Mbaka diyelo wanhu wolonga, “Muna mulima wa Mndewa Mulungu wanhu wokwing'higwa.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15"/>Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kulawa kuulanga kamtanga Bulahimu mwanza wekaidi, <verse eid="GEN 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16"/>kamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu kolonga vino, ‘Niilaha kwa zina jangu mwenyewo kuwa kwaviya kutenda vino, hebu hunimile mwanago yaidumwe, <verse eid="GEN 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17"/>ivo nizakutemela mate na nizawongezela welesi wako fana viya nhondo za kuulanga na fana viya msanga uli mumgwazo ya bahali. Welesi wako wezayasola mabululu ya wehi wawo. <verse eid="GEN 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18"/>Kufosela welesi wako makabila yose yezatemeligwa mate, kwaviya kunitegeleza.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19"/>Bulahimu kawabwelela wasang'hani wake, na wabwela wose hamwe mbaka Belisheba, hanhu hoyakalile Bulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20"/>Viyafosile yayo Bulahimu kalongiligwa kuwa Milika kamwelekela wana Naholi sekulu wake, <verse eid="GEN 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21"/>mwanage chaudele katangigwa Usi na wamwenga Busi na Kemueli tati yake Alamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22"/>Kesedi na Hazo na Pilidashi na Yidilafu na Besueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23"/>Besueli kamweleka Lebeka, Milika kamweleka Naholi, ndugu yake Bulahimu, wana wawo wanane. <verse eid="GEN 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24"/>Na Leuma mtumwa wa chike wa Naholi yoyamtendile fana muke wake, iviya kamwelekela wana, Teba na Galamu na Tahalashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23"/>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1"/>Sala kakala miyaka gana na malongo maidi na saba. <verse eid="GEN 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2"/>Sala kadanganika uko Kiliasi Aliba, iviya yotangigwa Hebuloni, muna iisi ya Kanaani, na Bulahimu kamtendela tanga na kamulilila.<verse eid="GEN 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3"/>Bulahimu kasegela hanhu hautambalisigwe ulukuli lwa muke wake, kahita kwa Wahiti na kawalongela, <verse eid="GEN 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4"/>“Niye nyambenyambe, yonikala hano hamwe na mweye, nichuuzileni hanhu ha kuwandila muladi nidahe kumuwanda muke wangu na wanhu wa kabila jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5"/>Wahiti wamwidika Bulahimu, <verse eid="GEN 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6"/>“Mwenevale chitegeleze, weye ni mulangulizi mkulu yousaguligwe na Mulungu kumwetu. Muwande muke wako muna dileme jojose dondaudisagule. Habule munhu yoyose yondayakwime leme jake, hebu kukugomesa sekeumuwande muke wako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7"/>Maabaho Bulahimu kema na kainama haulongozi ha Wahiti, wanhu wa isi ija <verse eid="GEN 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8"/>kawalongela, “Yahawa munitogolela niwawande wanhu wa kabila jangu, nolamba mpuleni Efiloni mwana wa Sohali <verse eid="GEN 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9"/>yanichuuzile tuka da Makipela dili habehi na imhaka ya mgunda wake. Mulongeleni yanichuuzile nitende maleme yanichuuzile kwa beyi yoilondeka hano hano kuno molola.” <verse eid="GEN 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10"/>Efiloni mwenyewo kakala imwe wa Wahiti wawo wowakalile waiting'hana hana ulwivi lwa dibululu. Ivo Efiloni Muhiti kamwidika Bulahimu haulongozi ha wanhu wose wowakalile baho, <verse eid="GEN 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11"/>“Unitegeleze, mwenevale, nokwing'ha mgunda wose na tuka dili umo, ivo nokugolela kuno wakaya wayangu wolola, udahe kuwawanda wanhu wa kabila jako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12"/>Bulahimu kainama haulongozi ha wanhu wa isi ija <verse eid="GEN 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13"/>na kamulongela Efiloni kuno wanhu wose wohulika, “Unihulike nokulamba, nizagula mgunda wako, nokulamba uhokele maliho yano, nidahe kuwawanda wanhu wa kabila jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14"/>Efiloni kamwidika Bulahimu, <verse eid="GEN 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15"/>“Mwenevale nitegeleze, mgunda wa magana sehekeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shekeli imwe sawa na gilamu longo na imwe na nusu.</char></note> magana mane ya hela. Ni choni hagati yako na niye? Wawande wanhu wa kabila jako umo.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16"/>Bulahimu waitogolela na Efiloni, kamulingila chibugulu cha hela chiyalondile kuno Wahiti wose wolola, shekeli magana mane ya hela, chiyasi cha wachuluzi wa chipindi icho.<verse eid="GEN 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17"/>Ivo mgunda wa Efiloni uli uko Makipela habehi na Mamule, tuka dodikalile umo muungunda na mibiki yose ikalile hamwe na mwela wose diwa jake <verse eid="GEN 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18"/>Bulahimu haulongozi wa Wahiti wose wowaiting'hane hana ulwivi wa dibululu.<verse eid="GEN 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19"/>Maabaho Bulahimu kamuwanda Sala muke wake muna dituka ijo dili Makipela habehi na isi ya Mamule, niiyo Hebuloni, muna iisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20"/>Mgunda na tuka dodikalile umo, itogoleka na Wahiti ni hanhu ha Bulahimu ha kuwandila.<verse eid="GEN 23:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24"/>
  <para style="s">Isaka kosola muke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1"/>Bulahimu kakala mulala ng'hani, na Mndewa Mulungu kamtemela mate kwa chila chinhu choyatendile. <verse eid="GEN 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2"/>Bulahimu kamulongela msang'hani wake yoyakalile mulala, iviya ndolezi wa vinhu vake vose, “Nokulamba wike mkono wako hasi ya mawambo yangu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vino niivo viwatendaga wanhu wa umwaka wahaikila chilaho.</char></note>, nikulahize. <verse eid="GEN 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3"/>Nolonda kukulahiza kwa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa ulanga na isi, kuwa hwizamsolela mwanangu muke kulawa kwa Wakanaani wonikala nawo. <verse eid="GEN 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4"/>Kolondeka uhite kuna isi ija yonyelekiligwe na umsolele muke mwanangu Isaka kulawa mwa ndugu zangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5"/>Ija imsang'hani kamuuza, “Fana imndele hezatogola bule kwiileka kaye na kunisondelela kwiza kuno kwiisi ino, lelo nimgale mwanago kuna isi youlawile?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6"/>Bulahimu kamwidika, “Uteganye, sekeumbweleze mwanagu uko! <verse eid="GEN 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7"/>Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa ulanga kanigala kulawa kaye ya tati yangu na kulawa isi ya ndugu zangu, kanilongela na kanilahila kuwa kezaweng'ha isi ino welesi wangu. Kezamtuma msenga wake wa kuulanga kuulongozi wako, ivo kwizampatila muke mwanangu kulawa kuna iisi iyo. <verse eid="GEN 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8"/>One imndele halonda kwiisondelela na weye, basi kwizalekeleligwa chilaho icho. Mbali kwa vovose mwanangu sekeumbweleze uko.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9"/>Msang'hani keka mkono wake hasi ya diwambo da Bulahimu mwenevale wake, na kumulahila kwa mbuli iyo.<verse eid="GEN 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10"/>Maabaho msang'hani kasola wanyama wotangigwa ngamiya longo wa Bulahimu, na ndolendole zinogile mbasakanyo, na kahita kuna dibululu da Mesopotamiya mbaka buluu da Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11"/>Viyafikile, kawatumbaliza mavindi iwangamiya habehi na disima kunze ya dibululu, ikala ichigulogulo, chipindi wanaake wohita kuna disima kudeha mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12"/>Kampula Mulungu, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa mwenevale wangu Bulahimu, diyelo nolonda ufanikiwe na ulaguse ulondo wa kufunya umoyo kwa mwenevale wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13"/>Nahano hamgwazo ha inzasa ya mazi hanhu wandele wakaya wa bululu howokwiza kudeha mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14"/>Ija imndele yondanimulongele yanenule nongo yake ya mazi na kuning'ha ning'we, nayo yahaning'ha ning'we niye na ngamiya wangu, iyo niiyo youmsagulile msang'hani wako Isaka. One ihawa ivo, nizavimanya kulagusa ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo kwa mwenevale wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15"/>Yang'hali hanakomeleza kulonga, Lebeka kafika na kuno kaitwika nongo ya mazi muna diyega jake. Mwana wa chike wa Besueli mwana wa Milika, muke wa Naholi, Naholi ni ndugu wa Bulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16"/>Mndele iyo kakala lumondo na kakala mhambe yang'ali hanaibandama na mulume yoyose. Ivo kagidimila muna disima, kadeha nongo yake na kalawa. <verse eid="GEN 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17"/>Msang'hani kakimbila himahima kuiting'hana nayo na kalonga, “Nokulamba uning'he mazi ning'we kulawa muna inongo yako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18"/>Imndele kamwidika, “Haya, ing'wa mwenevale,” bahobaho kanenula nongo yake, kayamhilila na kumng'wiza. <verse eid="GEN 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19"/>Viyakomeleze kumwing'ha yamazi, kamulongela, “Iviya nizawadehela mazi ngamiya wako wang'we mbaka ng'hilu imale.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20"/>Chahimahima kayaguma yamazi ya inongo yake muna diziga da kung'wila zingamiya, na kakimbila kuna inzasa kudeha mazi yamwenga na kaweng'ha ngamiya wake wose. <verse eid="GEN 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21"/>Msang'hani ija wa Bulahimu halongile mbuli yoyose, mbali kakala yomulola yawone fana Mndewa Mulungu kautemela mate mwanza wake.<verse eid="GEN 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22"/>Viyakomeleze kuweng'ha ngamiya mazi, msang'hani wa Mndewa Mulungu kasola mhete ya zahabu iguligwe hela ng'hulu na kamwing'ha Lebeka, na makung'u maidi ya zahabu yazamile ng'hani, kamvaza muna yamakono yake. <verse eid="GEN 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23"/>Kalonga, “Nokulamba unilongele, vino weye tati yako yelihi? Vino muna ikaye ya tati yako muna chiheleto cha kugona?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24"/>Lebeka kamwidika, “Tati yangu ni Besueli mwana wa Milika muke wa Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25"/>Iviya kumwetu kuna mgina na hanhu ha kuchungila na chiheleto cha kugona.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26"/>Maabaho msang'hani wa Bulahimu kainama na katambikila kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27"/>Kalonga, “Yatunhizigwe Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa mwenevale wangu Bulahimu niiyo yang'hali hanazimiza ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo na kwaminika kwake kwa mwenevale wangu. Mndewa Mulungu kanilanguliza mbaka kwa ndugu wa mwenevale wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28"/>Mndele ija kakimbila kuhita kuna ikaye ya mami yake na kumulongela mbuli zose. <verse eid="GEN 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29"/>Lebeka kakala na lumbu jake yatangigwe Labani, Labani kakimbila kuhita kuna inzasa kuja kuyakalile msang'hani wa Bulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30"/>Labani viyaiwonile ija imhete na dikung'hu muna yamakono ya mwali wake, na kuzihulika mbuli Lebeka ziyalongiligwe na munhu iyo. Labani kamfika munhu iyo kema habehi na ngamiya wake hamgwazo wa inzasa. <verse eid="GEN 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31"/>Labani kamulongela, “Izo. Weye munhu utemeligwe mate na Mndewa Mulungu. Habali kokwima hano hanze? Nisasala chiheleto na hanhu ha kukala ngamiya wako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32"/>Msang'hani iyo wa Bulahimu kengila muikaye, nayo Labani kawafungula iwangamiya wake na kaweng'ha mgina na hanhu ha kugona. Maabaho kamwing'ha mazi ya kuguma nhende yeye na wanhu wake. <verse eid="GEN 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33"/>Viwamgalile ndiya, msang'hani ija kalonga, “Sizakuja bule mbaka nilonge mbuli yangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani kamwidika, “Haya longa.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34"/>Ivo kalonga, “Niye namsang'hani wa Bulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamtemela mate mwenevale wangu, na kamtenda munhu tajili ng'hani. Kamwing'ha mabumbila ya ng'hondolo na luti na ng'ombe na hela na zahabu, wanaake na walume na watumwa na ngamiya na vihongwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36"/>Sala, muke wa mwenevale wangu, viyakalile mulala kamwelekela mwana mwenevale wangu, kamwing'ha mwana iyo vinhu vake vose. <verse eid="GEN 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37"/>Mwenevale wangu kanilahiliza kwamha lagilizo jake. Kalonga, ‘Sekeumsolele muke mwanangu kulawa muna iisi ya Kanaani yonikala. <verse eid="GEN 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38"/>Mbali hita kwa wanhu wa tati yangu na kwa ndugu zangu umsolele muke mwanangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39"/>Na nimuuza mwenevale wangu, ‘One yahalema kwiza na niye?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40"/>Kedika, ‘Mndewa Mulungu, yonimtegeleza siku zose, kezakugalila msenga wa kuulanga na kukutenda ufanikiwe. Kwizamsolela muke mwanangu kulawa muna ikaye ya tati yangu na ndugu zangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41"/>Kuna nzila imwe muhala ya kukutenda uilegehe na chilaho chako, one uhahita kwa ndugu zangu na wahakulema, kwizakuwa kuilegeha.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42"/>“Diyelo vinifikile hana inzasa, nitosa, ‘Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa mwenevale wangu Bulahimu, unitende nipate choniwinzile muna umwanza wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43"/>Hano nahana inzasa. One mndele yaheza kudeha mazi, nizampula mazi ya kung'wa kulawa muna inongo yake. <verse eid="GEN 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44"/>Nayo one yahaning'ha na kuwadehela mazi ngamiya wangu, iyo niiyo yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu kuwa muke wa mwana wa mwenevale wangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45"/>Ning'hali sinakomeleza kutosa muna umoyo wangu, lola! Lebeka kalawilila na nongo yake ya mazi muna diyega, kagidimila muna inzasa na kudeha mazi. Na niye nimpula, ‘Nolamba uning'he mazi ning'we.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46"/>Nayo kanenula nongo yake himahima na kalonga, ‘Haya ing'wa na nizawang'wiza mazi iviya ngamiya wako.’ Ivo niye ning'wa na ngamiya wangu iviya wang'wizigwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47"/>Ivo nimuuza mndele iyo, ‘Vino weye tati yako yelihi?’ Nayo kanidika, ‘Tati yangu ni Besueli mwana wa Milika muke wa Naholi.’ Maabaho nimwing'ha mhete ndodo ya kwika muna imhula na kumvaza kung'hu muna yamakono. <verse eid="GEN 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48"/>Niidulika mbaka chihanga chidalisa hasi na kumwing'ha hewela Mndewa Mulungu na Mndewa Mulungu kamtemela mate, Mulungu wa mwenevale wangu Bulahimu, yoyanilongoze vinogile muinzila kumsola mndele ino kwa ichimu cha mwana wa mwenevale wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49"/>Lelo nilongeleni one mutogola kumtendela mwenevale wangu kwa uwaminika na voilondeka na one siivo longeni, na niye nizavimanya cha kutenda.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50"/>Maabaho Labani na Besueli wamwidika, “Mbuli ino ilawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu, cheye chabule cha kukulongela chihile hebu chinogile. <verse eid="GEN 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51"/>Lebeka iyo baho, umsole uhite nayo. Yakawe muke wa mwana wa mwenevale wako, fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52"/>Msang'hani wa Bulahimu viyahulike mbuli izo, kainama na kamtambikila Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53"/>Msang'hani iyo wa Bulahimu kalava viwalo na via va hela na mahambo ya zahabu na kamgolela Lebeka. Iviya kamgolela ndolendole za hela ng'hulu lumbu jake na mami yake Lebeka.<verse eid="GEN 24:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54"/>Maabaho msang'hani wa Bulahimu na wanhu wowezile nayo waja wang'wa na wakala na kugona ichilo chose. Viwalamuke imitondo, msang'hani kalonga, “Nilekeni nibwele kwa mwenevale wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55"/>Mbali lumbu jake Lebeka na mami yake walonga, “Muleke imndele yakale na cheye kwa juma dimwe hebu siku longo, maabaho kodaha kuhita.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56"/>Mbali msang'hani kawalongela, “Nolamba sekemunikalamize, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kautemela mate mwanza wangu kamala, lekeni nibwele kwa mwenevale wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57"/>Wawo walonga, “Leka chimtange mndele mwenyewo chimuuze.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58"/>Ivo wamtanga Lebeka na wamuuza, “Kolonda kuhita na munhu ino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Nayo kedika, “Ona nizahita.” <verse eid="GEN 24:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59"/>Ivo wamuleka Lebeka yahite na msang'hani wa Bulahimu na wanhu wake. Iviya waisondelela na yaya wa Lebeka. <verse eid="GEN 24:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60"/>Wamtemela mate Lebeka kwa mbuli ino, “Weye mwali wetu uwe mama wa wanhu wengi ng'hani! Welesi wako wasole mabululu ya wehi wawo!”<verse eid="GEN 24:60"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61"/>Maabaho Lebeka na wasang'hani wake wa chike waisasala na wakwela ngamiya na kumsondelela iyo imsang'hani wa Bulahimu, nawo wose wasegela.<verse eid="GEN 24:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62"/>Lusita ulo Isaka kakala kasegela uko Beeli laha iloi, kakala kokala ubanzi wa Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63"/>Ichigulogulo Isaka kasegela na kahita kumgunda kugesa na kawona ngamiya wokwiza. <verse eid="GEN 24:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64"/>Lebeka viyamuwone Isaka, kahumuluka muna ingamiya wake <verse eid="GEN 24:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65"/>na kamuuza msang'hani wa Bulahimu, “Munhu ija yelihi yogenda mumgunda yokwiza kuchihowela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Msang'hani kamwidika, “Ni mwenevale wangu.” Maabaho Lebeka kasola chitambala kaigubika ichihanga.<verse eid="GEN 24:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66"/>Msang'hani wa Bulahimu kamulongela Isaka chila chinhu choyatendile. <verse eid="GEN 24:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67"/>Maabaho Isaka kamsola Lebeka mbaka muna ihema da Sala mami yake, na kawa muke wake. Isaka kamulonda Lebeka yoyamsangalaze viyadanganike mami yake.<verse eid="GEN 24:67"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25"/>
  <para style="s">Welesi umwenga wa Bulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1"/>Bulahimu kasola muke imwenga, zina jake Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2"/>Muke iyo kamwelekela Bulahimu Zimulani na Yakishani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na Shuwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3"/>Yakishani kamweleka Sheba na Dedani, wana wa Dedani ni Waashulu na Waletusi na Waleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4"/>Wana wa Midiani wakala Efa na Efeli na Henoki na Abida na Elidawa. Wose wawo wakala welesi wa Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5"/>Bulahimu kamwing'ha Isaka vinhu vake vose, <verse eid="GEN 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6"/>mbali wana wa watumwa wake wakalile fana wanaake zake wowamwelekele wana kawagolela ndolendole viyakalile yang'hali hanadanganika, kawagala kuna iisi ya ulawilo wa zuwa, kutali na mwanage Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Bulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7"/>Bulahimu viyadanganike kakala na miyaka gana na malongo saba na tano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8"/>Bulahimu kadanganika mulala ng'hani na kakala na deng'ho, kahita kuilumba na wasaho zake. <verse eid="GEN 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9"/>Wanage, Isaka na Ishumaili wamuwanda umo muna dituka da Makipela ulawilo wa zuwa wa Mamule mumgunda woukale wa Efiloni, mwana wa Sohali Muhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10"/>Bulahimu na Sala muke wake wawandigwa kuna umgunda uja Bulahimu uyagulile kwa Wahiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11"/>Viifosile ifa ya Bulahimu, Mulungu kamtemela mate Isaka mwana wa Bulahimu, yoyokalile kakala habehi na disima da Beeli laha iloi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wana wa Ishumaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12"/>Uno uwo ludongo lwa welesi wa Ishumaili mwana wa Bulahimu yoyelekigwe na Hajili Mmisili, yoyakalile msang'hani wa chike wa Sala. <verse eid="GEN 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13"/>Yano yayo yamazina ya wana wa Ishumaili kwa kusondelela kwelekigwa kwawo, chaudele wa Ishumaili ni Nebayoti na wamwenga ni Kedali na Abideli na Mibisamu <verse eid="GEN 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14"/>na Mishima na Duma na Masa <verse eid="GEN 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15"/>na Hadadi na Tema na Yetuli na Nafishi na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16"/>Wano ni wana wa Ishumaili, wowakalile walangulizi wa makabila longo na waidi. Ukazi na vibululu vawo vimanyika kwa mazina yawo. <verse eid="GEN 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17"/>Ishumaili viyadanganike kakala na miyaka gana na malongo matatu na saba, kahita kuiting'hana na wasaho zake. <verse eid="GEN 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18"/>Welesi wa Ishumaili wakala hagati ya Havila na Shuli, habehi na Misili mwiinzila ya kuhita Ashulu. Wakala kwa kuigola na welesi umwenga za Bulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19"/>Uno ulo ludongo lwa welesi wa Isaka mwana wa Bulahimu. Bulahimu kamweleka Isaka <verse eid="GEN 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20"/>Isaka kakala na miyaka malongo mane viyamsolile Lebeka mwana wa Besueli, Mwalamu wa Padani Alamu. Lebeka kakala lumbu wa Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21"/>Lebeka kakala halela, ivo Isaka kampula Mndewa Mulungu, nayo Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika chiyapulile, ivo Lebeka kapata wimo. <verse eid="GEN 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22"/>Wimo uwo ukala na mambasa, wana wawo waihuma muinda ya Lebeka. Nayo kalonga, “Chino choni chochinilawilila?” Ivo kahita kumuuza Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Lebeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Muinda yako muna makabila maidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Makabila maidi yondayelekigwe na weye yezaigola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Dimwe dizakuwa na nguvu kufosa dimwenga;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Imkulu kezamsang'hanila imdodo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24"/>Lusita lwake lwa kuvumbula vilufikile, kavumbula mambasa. <verse eid="GEN 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25"/>Chaudele kelekigwa na mbende ndung'hu na lukuli lwake lose lukala fana walo dili na mazoya, ivo zina jake kamtanga Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26"/>Wekaidi kavumbuka kuno kamhilila chisiginho cha Esau, ivo zina jake katangigwa Yakobo. Esau na Yakobo viwavumbuke Isaka kakala na miyaka malongo sita.<verse eid="GEN 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kochuuza haki ya uchaudele wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27"/>Wana wawo wakula. Esau kakala mkala, yoyolonda kukala muna ivyuwala, na Yakobo kakala yaholile yolonda kukala hakaye. <verse eid="GEN 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28"/>Mbali Isaka kamulonda Esau, kwaviya kanogelwa kuja wanyama woyawakomile Esau, mbali Lebeka kamulonda Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29"/>Siku dimwe Yakobo kakala yokwambika ndiya, Esau keza kulawa kuukala kuno kana nzala, <verse eid="GEN 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30"/>ivo kamulongela Yakobo, “Nina nzala ng'hani, nokulamba uning'he ndiya iyo indung'hu.” Lekamana Esau katangigwa Edomu fambulo jake ndung'hu.<verse eid="GEN 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31"/>Yakobo kamwidika, “Nizakwing'ha one uhanichuuzila haki ya uchaudele wako.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32"/>Esau kamulongela, “Vinoga! Nahabehi kudanganika. Haki yonifaya choni?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33"/>Yakobo kamwidika, “Teng'hu ilahile kuwa kwizanichuluzila haki yako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:33">Esau kailaha na kamwing'ha Yakobo haki yake. <verse eid="GEN 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34"/>Maabaho Yakobo kamwing'ha gate na nzugu. Kaja na kang'wa na maabaho kenuka na kasegela. Ivo niivo Esau viyaizehile haki yake ya uchaudele.<verse eid="GEN 25:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26"/>
  <para style="s">Isaka kokala Gelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1"/>Maabaho kulawilila nzala muna iisi, nzala iyo haikalile ija yoikalile lusita lwa Bulahimu. Isaka kahita kwa Abimeleki mfalume wa Wafilisiti, uko Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2"/>Mndewa Mulungu kamulawilila Isaka na kamulongela, “Sekeuhite Misili, mbali kala muna iisi iyo mbaka vondanikulongele. <verse eid="GEN 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3"/>Kala hano, na niye nizakuwa na weye na nizakutemela mate. Nizakwing'ha zisi zino zose kuwa zako na welesi wako. Nizakwika goya chilagano choniilahile na tati yako Bulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4"/>Nizakwing'ha welesi mwingi fana viya nhondo zili kuulanga na kuweng'ha zisi zino zose. Kufosela welesi wako wanhu wa makabila yose wezatemeligwa mate. <verse eid="GEN 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5"/>Nizakutemela mate kwaviya Bulahimu kanitegeleza na kamha malagilizo yangu na ndagilizi zangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6"/>Ivo Isaka kakala uko Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7"/>Wanhu wa uko viwamuuzile mbuli za muke wake, Isaka kawedika kuwa iyo ni lumbu jake. Kwaviya kadumba kulonga iyo ni muke wake mana kadumba wanhu wa uko sekewamkome kwa ichimu cha Lebeka, yoyakalile lumondo. <verse eid="GEN 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8"/>Isaka viyakalile uko kwa lusita lutali, Abimeleki mfalume wa Wafilisiti kasungulila muna dizonzo na kamuwona Isaka kamuhagatila Lebeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9"/>Abimeleki katuma usenga kwa Isaka na kalonga, “Humbe iyo ni muke wako! Habali kulonga ni lumbu jako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isaka kedika, “Nigesa one nilongile kuwa ni muke wangu, nihakomigwe.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10"/>Abimeleki kalonga, “Kuchitendela choni?” “Imwe wa wanhu wangu one yambandame muke wako, weye uhachitendile chihasanye.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11"/>Abimeleki kawazuma wanhu wose, “Munhu yoyose yondayamdalise munhu ino hebu muke wake kolondeka yakomigwe.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12"/>Isaka kahanda mbeyu muna iisi ija, na mwaka uwo kagobola ng'hani kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kamtemela mate. <verse eid="GEN 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13"/>Isaka kawa tajili na utajili wake ugendelela kongezeka mbaka kawa tajili ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14"/>Isaka kawa na mabumbila ya ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na wasang'hani wengi mbaka Wafilisiti wamuwonela migongo. <verse eid="GEN 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15"/>Wafilisiti wazisiliza nzasa zose zozihimbigwe na wasang'hani wa Bulahimu tati yake, lusita Bulahimu viyakalile yang'hali mgima.<verse eid="GEN 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16"/>Abimeleki kamulongela Isaka, “Segela muna iisi yetu, mana weye kuna nguvu ng'hani kufosa cheye.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17"/>Ivo Isaka kasegela uko na kazenga lago jake muna dizanda da Gelali, na kakala uko. <verse eid="GEN 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18"/>Isaka kahimba kaidi masima yaja yahimbigwe na Bulahimu tati yake viyakalile mgima. Masima yaja yasilizigwa na Wafilisiti lusita Bulahimu viyadanganike. Isaka kayagolela mazina yaja yaja yoyayatangile tati yake.<verse eid="GEN 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19"/>Wasang'hani wa Isaka wahimba chisima muna dizanda na wafika sima da mazi ya ugima. <verse eid="GEN 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20"/>Wadimi wa kuja Gelali wagomba na wadimi wa Isaka na walonga, “Mazi yano yetu.” Ivo Isaka kachitanga chisima icho “Eseki,” fambulo jake “Ndwagi” <verse eid="GEN 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21"/>Wasang'hani wa Isaka wahimba chisima chimwenga, icho nacho wachigombela, ivo Isaka kachitanga chisima icho “Sitina,” fambulo jake “Kulema”. <verse eid="GEN 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22"/>Maabaho kasegela hanhu baho na kahimba chisima chimwenga. Baho hahakalile na ndwagi, ivo kachitanga zina “Lehobosi”. Kalonga, “Lelo Mndewa Mulungu kaching'ha ulegeho wa kukala muna isi, na chizakala hano na kongezeka.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23"/>Isaka kasegela na kahita Belisheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24"/>Chilo icho Mndewa Mulungu kamulawila na kamulongela, “Niye ni Mulungu wa tati yako Bulahimu. Nahamwe na weye, sekeudumbe. Nizakutemela mate na kukongeza welesi mwingi kwa ichimu cha msang'hani wangu Bulahimu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25"/>Isaka kazenga lupango uko na kamtambikila Mndewa Mulungu. Uko kasimika hema na wasang'hani wake wahimba sima uko.<verse eid="GEN 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki woilumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26"/>Abimeleki keza kulawa Gelali hamwe na Ahuzati, mbwiyake ng'hani, na Fikoli mkulu wa wakalizi wake, kumulola Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27"/>Ivo Isaka kawauza, “Habali mwiza kumwangu kunilola, na kuno munihila na muniwinga muna iisi yenu?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28"/>Wawo wamwidika, “Lelo chovimanya Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na weye. Ivo chiitogolela yofaya chiilahile na kutenda lagano na weye, <verse eid="GEN 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29"/>kuwa weye hwizachilumiza na cheye iviya hachizakulumiza weye. Chikutendela yanogile na chikuleka usegele kwa tindiwalo na sambi weye kutemeligwa mate na Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30"/>Isaka kawasasalila ndiya ya dugila, nawo waja na wang'wa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31"/>Igolo yake imitondo ng'hani, chila munhu keka lagano jake kwa kwiilaha. Maabaho Isaka kawalaga mbwiya zake na waileka kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="GEN 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32"/>Siku ija wasang'hani wa Isaka wamwizila na wamulongela mbuli ya chisima chowachihimbile. Wamulongela, “Chiyafika mazi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33"/>Isaka kachitanga chisima icho “Siba,” fambulo jake “Chilaho.” Ivo bululu ijo dotangigwa Belisheba mbaka diyelo.<verse eid="GEN 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Waanake wa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34"/>Esau viyawile na miyaka malongo mane, kasola wanaake waidi Wahiti, Yudisi mwana wa Beeli na Basemati mwana wa Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35"/>Wanaake wawo wawatenda Isaka na Lebeka wakale kwa usungu.<verse eid="GEN 26:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27"/>
  <para style="s">Isaka komtemela mate Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1"/>Isaka viyakalile mulala meso yake yawa hayalola bule. Ivo kamtanga Esau mwanage chaudele na kamulongela, “Mwanangu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Nayo kamwidika, “Aino hano.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2"/>Isaka kalonga, “Lola niye namulala, na siku yangu ya kudanganika siimanyile bule. <verse eid="GEN 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3"/>Sola msale na upinde wako na uhite kumbago na ukanisakile mnyama wa mwiimbago kwa ichimu changu. <verse eid="GEN 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4"/>Nyambikile ndiya inogile ija yoniilonda, na unigalile. Nahamala kuja, niye mwenyewo nizakutemelela mate ning'hali sinadanganika.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5"/>Humbe Isaka viyakalile kolonga na Esau, Lebeka kakala yotegeleza. Ivo Esau viyahitile kusaka kwiimbago, <verse eid="GEN 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6"/>Lebeka kamulongela Yakobo, “Nimuhulika tati yako viyamulongele sekulu wako Esau, <verse eid="GEN 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7"/>‘Nigalile mnyama na unyambikile ndiya inogile. Nahakomeleza kuja nizakutemela mate haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu ning'hali sinadanganika.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8"/>Lebeka kagendelela kulonga, “Lelo mwanangu, nitegeleze na utende chinikulongela. <verse eid="GEN 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9"/>Hita kuna dibumbila da iwaluti unigalile wanaluti waidi wanogile muladi nimwambikile tati yako ndiya inogile yoyailondaga ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10"/>Na kwizamgalila tati yako yaje muladi yakutemele mate yang'hali hanadanganika.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11"/>Mbali Yakobo kamulongela Lebeka mami yake, “Kuvimanya kuwa sekulu wangu Esau ni munhu mwene upipi, mbali niye nabule. <verse eid="GEN 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12"/>Yodahika tati yangu kezalonda kunibabasa, na niye nizawoneka fana viya nomvwizila, kwa ivo nizaigalila duwilo badala ya kutemeligwa mate.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13"/>Mami yake kamulongela, “Duwilo jako dimhate niye, mbali weye mwanangu tenda fana viya vinikulagiliza, na hita ukanigalile wanaluti.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14"/>Ivo Yakobo kahita na kawasola iwanaluti waidi na kamgalila mami yake, nayo kasasala ndiya inogile yoyailondile tati yake. <verse eid="GEN 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15"/>Maabaho Lebeka kalava viwalo vinogile va Esau mwanage imkulu, voyavikile muna ikaye, na kamuyawaliza Yakobo mwanage imdodo. <verse eid="GEN 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16"/>Iviya kamuyawaliza mbende za iwanaluti waja mmakono na muna ulukuli lutelebuke ulibule upipi muna isingo yake. <verse eid="GEN 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17"/>Lebeka kamwing'ha Yakobo indiya inogile, hamwe na diya digate doyadisasale.<verse eid="GEN 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18"/>Maabaho Yakobo kahita kwa tati yake na kamtanga, “Tata!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Nayo kedika, “Aino.” Tati yake kamuuza, “Weye mwanangu yelihi?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19"/>Yakobo kamwidika, “Niye Esau chaudele wako. Nisang'hana fana viunilagilize. Nolamba tata ukale uje nyama yonikugalile, muladi udahe kunitemela mate.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20"/>Isaka kamuuza, “Mwanangu iwaze kupata himahima fanile ivo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakobo kamwidika, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako kanitaza kupata ivo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21"/>Isaka kamulongela Yakobo, “Mwanangu kwenhuka haguhi nidahe kukubabasa muladi nivimanye fana kweli weye kwa Esau mwanangu hebu siyo.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22"/>Yakobo kamkwenhukila tati yake, nayo kambabasa na kalonga, “Dizi jako dohulikika fana viya dizi da Yakobo, mbali makono yalinga fana makono ya Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23"/>Isaka hammanyile Yakobo kwaviya makono yake yakala na upipi fana Esau. Ivo kakala kokwandusa kumtemela mate. <verse eid="GEN 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24"/>Mbali kamuuza kaidi, “Weye kweli mwanangu Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Yakobo kamwidika, “Iyo niye.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25"/>Isaka kalonga, “Nigalile nyama muladi nije na kukutemela mate.” Yakobo kamgalila na kaja, nayo iviya kamgalila divai kang'wa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26"/>Maabaho Isaka tati yake kamulongela, “Mwanangu, nikwenhukile uninonele.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27"/>Yakobo kamkwenhukila na kamnonela, Isaka viyahulike mnung'ho wa viwalo vake, kamtemela mate na kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">“Lola mnung'ho wa mwanangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">ulinga fana mnung'ho wa mgunda woutemeligwe mate na Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28"/>Mulungu yakwing'he mvula kulawa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">na yakwing'he ulongo unogile ulava nafaka na divai nyingi.<verse eid="GEN 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29"/>Makabila yose wezakusang'hanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na wezakutumbalila mavindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">kwizakuwa mulangulizi wa wandugu zako wose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na welesi wa mami yako wakutumbalile mavindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">wanhu wokuduwila weye waduwiligwe na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">wokutemela mate wezatemeligwa mate.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30"/>Isaka viyakomeleze kumtemela mate Yakobo, lusita Yakobo viyasegele, Esau sekulu wake kabwela kulawa kuukala. <verse eid="GEN 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31"/>Iviya Esau kambika ndiya inogile na kamgalila tati yake. Kamulongela, “Haya tata, kala uje nyama yonikugalile, muladi udahe kunitemela mate.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32"/>Isaka kamuuza, “Weye kwa yelihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Nayo kamwidika, “Niye niiyo Esau mwanago chaudele.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33"/>Isaka kagudemeka ng'hani na kalonga, “Humbe yelihi yoyalawile kuukala na kanigalila nyama, na niye nija yose nimala ung'hali hunakwiza? Iviya nimtemela mate nimala, ivo katemeligwa mate kamala!”<verse eid="GEN 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34"/>Esau viyahulike ivo kalila kwa dizi kulu na giyogiyo ng'hani na kalonga, “Tata, na niye iviya nitemele mate!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35"/>Mbali Isaka kamwidika, “Mdodo wako kanizila na kunivwizila. Na kasola kutemeligwa mate kwako.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36"/>Esau kalonga, “Lekamana kotangigwa Yakobo kwaviya kanivwizila miyanza midi. Mosi kasola haki yangu ya uchaudele, maabaho kasola kutemeligwa mate kwangu.” Esau kalonga, “Hunisigazile kutemeligwa mate kwangu?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37"/>Isaka kamwidika Esau, “Nimala kumtenda Yakobo kuwa mulangulizi wako na nimwing'ha ndugu zake wose kuwa wasang'hani wake. Nimpatila nafaka na divai. Lelo nikutendele choni weye mwanagu?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38"/>Esau kamulongela tati yake, “Kodaha kutemela mate mwanza umwe muhala tati yangu? Tati yangu na niye iviya nhemele mate!” Kandusa kulandula dizi na kalila.<verse eid="GEN 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39"/>Maabaho Isaka tati yake kamwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Kwizakala kutali na mgunda unogile ulava nafaka na divai nyingi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">na kutali na mvula ya kuulanga.<verse eid="GEN 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40"/>Kwizakala kwa kuwakoma wanhu kwa sengo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Kwizamsang'hanila ndugu yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Mbali uhalema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">kwizatenda voulonda mwenyewo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41"/>Esau kamwihila Yakobo kwa ichimu cha kutemeligwa mate koyatemeligwe na tati yake. Kagesa, “Siku za matanga ya tata zaabehi, zihamala nizamkoma mdodo wangu Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42"/>Mbali Lebeka viyavimanyile chiyailungile Esau, kamtumila usenga kumtanga Yakobo na kalonga, “Wiiteganye, sekulu wako Esau koiguma moyo kwa kulonda kukukoma. <verse eid="GEN 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43"/>Lelo mwanangu tegeleza chonikulongela na uchitende. Hima kimbilila kwa lumbu jangu Labani uko Halani, <verse eid="GEN 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44"/>kala nayo kwa lusita, mbaka ludoko lwa sekulu wako luhunguke. <verse eid="GEN 27:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45"/>Ludoko lwa sekulu wako vondaluhunguke na vondayazimize youmtendele, nizamtuma munhu yakubweleze. Habali nidanganikiligwe na mweye wose waidi siku dimwe?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka komtuma Yakobo kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46"/>Lebeka kamulongela Isaka, “Niye ndegezigwa na wanaake wano Wahiti wa Esau. One Yakobo iviya yahasola muke kulawa mwa wanaake wano Wahiti, muhavu nidanganike.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1"/>Isaka kamtanga Yakobo, kamtemela mate na kamulongela, “Sekeusole mwanamke yoyose Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2"/>Hita kuna iisi ya Padani Alamu, muna ikaye ya wasaho yako Besueli, na ukasole imwe wa wana wa mtumba wako Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3"/>Mulungu mwene Udaho yaitemele mate sola yako na yakwing'he wana wengi, ivo kwizakuwa tata wa makabila mengi. <verse eid="GEN 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4"/>Yakutemele mate weye na welesi wako fana viya viyamtemele mate Bulahimu muladi udahe kuhazi isi ino youkala fana nyambenyambe, Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Bulahimu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5"/>Isaka kamtuma Yakobo yahite kwiisi ya Padani Alamu kwa Labani, yoyelekigwe na Besueli, Mwalamu, Labani lumbu jake Lebeka yeli mami yawo Yakobo na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kosola muke weketatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6"/>Esau kavimanya kuwa Isaka kamala kumtemela mate Yakobo na kumtuma yahite Padani Alamu yakasole muke. Iviya kavimanya kuwa Isaka viyamtemele mate, kamulongela sekeyasole muke Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7"/>Kavimanya kuwa Yakobo kawategeleza tati yake na mami yake na kahita Padani Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8"/>Esau kavimanya kuwa Isaka tati yake hanogeligwa bule na wanaake wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9"/>Esau kahita kwa Ishumaili mwana wa Bulahimu na kamsola muke imwenga yotangigwa Mahalati, lumbu jake Nebayoti.<verse eid="GEN 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nzozi ya Yakobo uko Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10"/>Yakobo kasegela Belisheba na kuhita Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11"/>Kafika hanhu hamwe ha kugona chilo chimwe kwaviya zuwa dikala diswa. Kasola dibwe dimwe da hanhu baho kadika hasi ya iditwi jake, kagona. <verse eid="GEN 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12"/>Kalota kuwa kawona vidando vimizigwa kulawa muna iisi mbaka kuulanga, wasenga wa kuulanga wokwela na kuhumuluka hasi kwa ividando ivo. <verse eid="GEN 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13"/>Mndewa Mulungu kema habehi nayo kamulongela, “Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa tati yako Bulahimu na Isaka,” kalonga, “Nizakwing'ha weye na welesi wako isi ino yuwiigonela. <verse eid="GEN 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14"/>Welesi wako wizakuwa mwingi fana msanga wa isi. Wezakwenela chila hanhu, ulawilo wa zuwa na uswelo wa zuwa, kasikazi na kusi. Kufosela weye na welesi wako wanhu wose wezatemeligwa mate. <verse eid="GEN 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15"/>Niye nahamwe na weye na kukukaliza hohose houhita, na nizakubweleza muna iisi ino. Sizakuleka mbaka vondanikutendele yose yonikulaganile.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16"/>Yakobo kalamka na kalonga, “Kweli Mndewa Mulungu ka hanhu hano, niye sivimanyile bule!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17"/>Nayo kadumba na kalonga, “Hanhu hano hodumbiza ng'hani! Kweli ni kaye ya Mulungu na lwivi lwa kuulanga.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18"/>Igolo yake imitondo ng'hani Yakobo kalamuka, kasola idibwe dodikalile hasi ya ditwi jake, kadisimika fana mhanda ya ukumbuso na kudigidila mavuta. <verse eid="GEN 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19"/>Kahatanga hanhu baho Beseli. Umwaka bululu ijo ditangigwa Luzu. <verse eid="GEN 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20"/>Maabaho Yakobo kailaha kwa Mndewa Mulungu, “One wahawa hamwe na niye, na kunikaliza muna umwanza wangu na kuning'ha ndiya na viwalo, <verse eid="GEN 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21"/>na one nahabwela vinogile kuna ikaye ya tati yangu, ivo Mndewa Mulungu kwizakuwa Mulungu wangu. <verse eid="GEN 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22"/>Dibwe dino donidisimike hano fana mhanda ya ukumbuso, dizakuwa kaye ya Mulungu, na niye nizakwing'ha chinhu chimwe muna ichila vinhu longo vondauning'he.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kofika kuna ikaye ya Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1"/>Yakobo kagendelela na mwanza wake na kafika muna iisi ya ulawilo wa zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2"/>Kalola na kawona chisima mwiichuwala na mumgwazo yake mabumbila matatu ya ng'hondolo wagona. Ng'hondolo wakala wong'wizigwa muna ichisima icho chochigubikigwe na dibwe kulu. <verse eid="GEN 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3"/>Mabumbila yose ya ng'hondolo yahaiduganya, wadimaji wobimbilisa idibwe ijo kwa hamwe kulawa hana ichisima na kuwang'wiza iwang'hondolo. Maabaho wogubika kaidi ichisima kwa dibwe ijo.<verse eid="GEN 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4"/>Yakobo kawauza waja iwadimi, “Wambwiya zangu, mweye mulawa kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Wamwidika, “Cholawa Halani.” <verse eid="GEN 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5"/>Kawauza kaidi, “Vino mummanya Labani mwana wa Naholi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Wamwidika, “Ona chimmanya.” <verse eid="GEN 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6"/>Yakobo kagendelela kuwauza, “Vino mgima?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Nawo wamwidika, “Mgima! Lola mndele wake Laheli iyo ija kokwiza na ng'hondolo zake.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7"/>Yakobo kalonga, “Nowona ing'hali misi na siyo lusita lwa kuwaduganya ng'hondolo hamwe, ivo wang'wizeni mazi muhite mukawadime.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8"/>Nawo wamwidika, “Hachidaha bule mbaka ng'hondolo wose wawe hano, na dibwe dibimbiliswe mwiichisima, maabaho chowang'wiza mazi ng'hondolo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9"/>Yakobo viyakalile yang'hali kolonga nawo, Laheli yakalile mdimi wa ng'hondolo, kafika na ng'hondolo wa tati yake. <verse eid="GEN 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10"/>Yakobo viyamuwone Laheli mndele wa mtumba wake Labani hamwe na zing'hondolo, kahita hana disima na kudibimbilisa idibwe kulawa hana disima na kuwang'wiza mazi iwang'hondolo wa mtumba wake. <verse eid="GEN 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11"/>Maabaho Yakobo kamnonela Laheli na kandusa kulila kwaviya kakala na deng'ho. <verse eid="GEN 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12"/>Yakobo kamulongela Laheli, “Niye ni ndugu wa tati yako, na mwana wa Lebeka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:12">Maabaho Laheli kakimbila kumulongela tati yake. <verse eid="GEN 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13"/>Labani viyahulike mbuli ya Yakobo mwihwage, kahita yokimbila kumuhowela, viyamfikile kamuhagatila na kamnonela na kamkalibisha ukaye yake. Yakobo kamulongela mbuli zose zozilawilile. <verse eid="GEN 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14"/>Labani kalonga, “Ivo weye ni lukuli lumwe na damu imwe na niye.” Yakobo kakala na Labani mwezi umwe.<verse eid="GEN 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kowasola Laheli na Leya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15"/>Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Weye kwa ndugu yangu hudaha kunisang'hanila bila kukuliha. Lelo nikulihe hela nyingahi?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16"/>Labani kakala na wandele waidi, imkulu zina jake Leya na imdodo Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17"/>Leya kakalayanogile, mbali Laheli kakala lumondo ng'hani.<verse eid="GEN 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18"/>Yakobo kamulonda Laheli, ivo kamulongela Labani, “Nizakusang'hanila miyaka saba, one uhanitogolela kumsola Laheli.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19"/>Labani kamwidika, “Muhavu nikwing'he weye Laheli sembuse kumwing'ha munhu imwenga yoyose. Gendelela kukala hano na niye.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20"/>Yakobo kamsang'hanila Labani miyaka saba muladi yampate Laheli, mbali kumwake miyaka saba ni fana viya siku ndodo, kwaviya kamulonda Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21"/>Maabaho Yakobo kamulongela Labani, “Lusita lwangu lufika, ning'he muke wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22"/>Ivo Labani kasasala dugila na kawagoneka wanhu wose wa hanhu haja. <verse eid="GEN 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23"/>Mbali viifikile ichigulogulo, Labani kamulava Leya mwanage imkulu na kumgala kwa Yakobo, nayo Yakobo kagona nayo. <verse eid="GEN 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24"/>Labani kamwing'ha Zilipa mtumwa wake wa chike yawe mtumwa wa Leya mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25"/>Igolo yake imitondo, Yakobo katola kuwa ni Leya. Kamgendela Labani na kamuuza, “Choni chino chounhendele? Nikusang'hanila muladi nimpate Laheli. Habali kunivwizila?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26"/>Labani kamwidika, “Chino siyo chihendo chetu kusoligwa imndele imdodo kuno imkulu yang'ali hanasoligwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27"/>Gozela mbaka siku saba za dugila, maabaho nizakwing'ha Laheli kwa usang'hano wa miyaka saba imwenga.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28"/>Yakobo katogola, viifikile juma da dugila, Labani kamwing'ha Laheli mwanage yawe muke wake. <verse eid="GEN 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29"/>Labani kamulava Biliha mtumwa wake wa chike, yawe mtumwa wa Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30"/>Yakobo kagona na Laheli iviya, na Yakobo kamulonda kufosa Leya. Maabaho Yakobo kamsang'hanila Labani miyaka saba imwenga.<verse eid="GEN 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31"/>Mndewa Mulungu kawona kuwa Leya halondigwa goya, ivo kamtenda yeleke, mbali Laheli heleke bule. <verse eid="GEN 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32"/>Leya kapata wimo na kaibasula mwana wa chilume na kamtanga zina jake Lubeni kwa viya kalonga, 'Mwana aino'. Leya kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu kawona manhesa yangu na lelo mulume wangu kezanilonda.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33"/>Maabaho kapata wimo kaidi na kaibasula mwana imwenga wa chilume. Kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu kahulika kuwa nokwihilwa.” Ivo Leya kamtanga zina jake Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34"/>Leya kapata wimo kaidi na kaibasula mwana imwenga wa chilume, nayo kamtanga zina jake Lawi. Leya kalonga, “Lelo mulume wangu kezailumba vinogile na niye, kwaviya nimwelekela wana wa chilume watatu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35"/>Maabaho kapata wimo kaidi na kaibasula mwana imwenga wa chilume na kalonga, “Lusita luno nizamtogoza Mndewa Mulungu.” Kamtanga zina jake Yuda, maabaho Leya kaleka kweleka.<verse eid="GEN 29:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1"/>Mbali Laheli hamwelekele Yakobo wana wowose, na ivo kamuwonela migongo mwali wake na kamulongela Yakobo, “Ning'he wana, buleivo nizadanganika.” <verse eid="GEN 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2"/>Yakobo kamuwonela ludoko Laheli na kalonga, “Sidaha kusola hanhu ha Mulungu. Yeye muhala niiyo yakukimilile weye sekeupate wana.”<verse eid="GEN 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3"/>Laheli kamulongela, “Ino hano mtumwa wangu Biliha, ibandame nayo muladi yapate wana kwa ichimu changu. Ivo nizakuwa mama kufosela yeye.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4"/>Laheli kamwing'ha mulumake Yakobo mtumwa wake Biliha yawe fana muke wake, nayo Yakobo kambandama. <verse eid="GEN 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5"/>Biliha kapata wimo na kamwelekela Yakobo mwana wa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6"/>Laheli kalonga, “Mulungu kanigombela, kauhulika usungu wangu na kuning'ha mwana wa chilume.” Ivo Laheli kamtanga zina jake Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7"/>Biliha mtumwa wake wa chike kapata wimo kaidi na kamwelekela Yakobo mwana imwenga wa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8"/>Laheli kalonga, “Nikala na ugomvi mkulu na mwali wangu, mbali nihuma.” Ivo kamtanga mwana iyo Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9"/>Leya viyawonile kuwa kaleka kulela, kamsola Zilipa mtumwa wake wa chike na kamwing'ha Yakobo yawe fana muke wake. <verse eid="GEN 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10"/>Maabaho Zilipa kamwelekela Yakobo mwana wa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11"/>Leya kalonga, “Nipata sudi,” ivo kamtanga zina jake Gadi. <verse eid="GEN 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12"/>Zilipa mtumwa wake wa Leya kamwelekela Yakobo mwana imwenga wa chilume, <verse eid="GEN 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13"/>Leya kalonga, “Nodeng'helela! Lelo wanaake wezalonga kuwa kanadeng'ho” Kamtanga zina jake Asheli.<verse eid="GEN 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14"/>Lusita lwa kuhuna ngano, Lubeni kahita kuchuwala, uko kapata makalanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wahuwila kuwa mwanamke yahaja makalanga kezalela ng'hani.</char></note> na kamgalila Leya mami yake. Laheli kamulongela Leya, “Nopula uning'he makalanga yamwenga ya mwanago.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15"/>Leya kamwidika, “Vino kogesa mbuli ndodo kunihoka mulumangu? Lelo kolonda kusola makalanga ya mwanangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Laheli kalonga, “One wahaning'ha makalanga ya mwanago, Yakobo kezagona kumwako chilo cha diyelo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16"/>Ichigulogulo Yakobo viyakalile kobwela kulawa kuchuwala, Leya kahita kumuhokela na kamulongela, “Chilo cha diyelo uhite kugona kumwangu kwaviya nikwing'ha makalanga ya mwanangu.” Ivo chilo icho kagona nayo.<verse eid="GEN 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17"/>Mulungu kahulika nhosa ya Leya, na kapata wimo na kamwelekela Yakobo mwana wetano wa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18"/>Leya kalonga, “Mulungu kaning'ha yombe jangu, kwaviya nimwing'ha mulume wangu msang'hani wangu wa chike”; Ivo kamtanga zina jake Isakali. <verse eid="GEN 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19"/>Leya kapata wimo kaidi na kamwelekela Yakobo mwana wa sita wa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20"/>Leya kalonga, “Mulungu kaning'ha chitumetume chinogile. Lelo mulumangu kezanitogola, kwaviya nimwelekela wana sita wa chilume.” Ivo kamtanga zina jake Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21"/>Hamwande Leya kapata mwana wa chike, na kamtanga zina jake Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22"/>Maabaho Mulungu kamkumbuka Laheli na kahulika chiyapulile, ivo kamtenda yadahe kupata wana. <verse eid="GEN 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23"/>Laheli kapata wimo na kaibasula mwana wa chilume na kalonga, “Mulungu kanisegezela chinyala changu.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24"/>Kamtanga zina jake Yosefu, kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu uning'he mwana imwenga.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo woitogolela na Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25"/>Laheli viyamweleka Yosefu, Yakobo kamulongela Labani, “Unileke nibwele ukaye yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26"/>Uning'he wake zangu na wanangu woniwapatile kwa ichimu cha usang'hano wonikusang'hanile, nisegele nawo, kwaviya kuvimanya nikusang'hanila vinogile.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27"/>Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Leka na niye nilonge. Niifunza kwa usawi wangu kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kanitemela mate kwa ichimu chako. <verse eid="GEN 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28"/>Longa yombe jako na niye nizakuliha.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29"/>Yakobo kedika, “Weye mwenyewo kuvimanya viya vinikusang'hanile, kuvimanya viniwekile goya wanyama wako. <verse eid="GEN 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30"/>Kwaviya vinizile kukala na vinhu vidodo, mbali kusongela nifike vinhu vako vongezeka ng'hani na Mndewa Mulungu kakutemela mate chila hanhu honihitile. Mbali lelo kaye yangu nizailola goya zuwaki?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31"/>Labani kamuuza, “Nikulihe choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakobo kamwidika, “Silonda yombe jojose. One chihaitogolela, nizagendelela kwika goya wanyama wako. <verse eid="GEN 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32"/>Nilekele nifose hagati ya wanyama wako wose diyelo nigole muna dibumbila chila mnyama yeli na uzegenha na uzolizoli, chila mnyama mtitu na luti weli na uzegenha na uzolizoli. Ijo niijo yombe donilonda. <verse eid="GEN 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33"/>Siku zikwiza, kwaminika kwangu kwizawoneka funhulafunhula vondawize kulola yombe jangu. One yahawoneka luti yoyose yelibule uzegenha hebu uzolizoli, hebu ng'hondolo yoyose heli na utitu muna dibumbila jangu, iyo kezakuwa kabawigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34"/>Labani kedika, “Vinoga. Chizatenda fana viulongile.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35"/>Mbali siku iyo Labani kahita kayagola mabebelu yose yeli na mindilizi na uzegenha na luti wose mizike wowakalile na uzolizoli na uzegenha, chila luti wowakalile na uzelu muna ulukuli na chila ng'hondolo yeli na utitu, kaweka hasi ya ulolezi wa wanage, <verse eid="GEN 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36"/>Maabaho Bumbila da Labani dikala kutali na bumbila da Yakobo kwa siku nhatu. Yakobo kadilolesa bumbila da wanyama wa Labani dodisigale.<verse eid="GEN 30:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37"/>Yakobo kasola mango mbisi za mibiki mitatu mbasakanyo, kazigomola yamagome muladi mindilizi mizelu iwoneke muna zimango izo. <verse eid="GEN 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38"/>Maabaho kazisimika zimango izo haulongozi wa iwanyama hana zimbaluti za kung'wila mazi iwanyama. Ivo wanyama wezile kung'wa mazi wapata wimo uko. <verse eid="GEN 30:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39"/>Wapata wimo haulongozi wa mango izo, weleka wanyama weli na mindilizi hebu uzolizoli hebu uzegenha.<verse eid="GEN 30:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40"/>Yakobo kawagola wanang'hondolo wawo, maabaho kawalagusila kuna iwanyama weli na uzolizoli na mindilizi na weli na utitu muna dibumbila da Labani. Kwa ichimu icho Yakobo kapata bumbila jake mwenyewo hadihanganye na diya da Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41"/>Wanyama wanenehe viwatizile, Yakobo keka zimango haulongozi hawo hana zimbaluti za kung'wizila mazi muladi wapate wimo habehi na mango izo. <verse eid="GEN 30:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42"/>Mbali Yakobo hekile zimango izo haulongozi wa wanyama wasokile viwapatile wimo. Ivo wanyama wasokile wawa wa Labani na wanenehe wawa wa Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43"/>Ivo Yakobo kawa tajili ng'hani na kawa na mabumbila makulu ya wanyama na wasang'hani wa chilume na wa chike na ngamiya na vihongwe.<verse eid="GEN 30:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo komkimbila Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1"/>Yakobo kawahulika wanage Labani wolonga, “Yakobo kasola chila chinhu cha tati yetu. Utajili wake wose ulawa kwa tati yetu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2"/>Yakobo kavimanya kuwa Labani hamgesile fana baho haumwaka. <verse eid="GEN 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3"/>Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Yakobo, “Bwela kuna iisi ya wasaho zako na kwa ndugu zako. Na niye nizakuwa hamwe na weye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4"/>Yakobo katuma wanhu wakawatange Laheli na Leya kwiichuwala koyakalile kowadima iwang'hondolo wake. <verse eid="GEN 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5"/>Yakobo kawalongela, “Nowona kuwa tati yenu hanigesa fana umwaka, mbali Mulungu wa tati yangu kahamwe na niye. <verse eid="GEN 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6"/>Muvimanya kuwa nimsang'hanila tati yenu kwa nguvu zangu zose. <verse eid="GEN 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7"/>Hata ivo kanivwizila na kasakanya yombe jangu miyanza longo. Mbali Mulungu hamulekele yanilumize. <verse eid="GEN 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8"/>Haja tati yenu viyalongile, ‘Wanyama wose weli na mawolamawola wezakuwa yombe jako,’ ivo bumbila jose dilela wanyama weli na mawolamawola. Na haja viyalongile, ‘Wanyama wose weli na uzolizoli wezakuwa yombe jako,’ ivo bumbila jose dilela wanyama weli na uzolizoli. <verse eid="GEN 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9"/>Mulungu viyasolile wanyama wa tati yenu kaning'ha niye.<verse eid="GEN 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10"/>“Lusita lwa wanyama kupata wimo vilufikile nilota nzozi, na niwona mabebelu yose yoyakwelile mazike yakala na mindilizi na mawolamawola na uzolizoli. <verse eid="GEN 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11"/>Msenga wa kuulanga kalonga na niye muna zinzozi na kanitanga, ‘Yakobo,’ nimwidika, ‘Aino.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12"/>Na kalonga, ‘Inula meso yako na ulole mabebelu yose yeli na miliya na mawolamawola. Mbuli iyo iwa ivo kwaviya niwona viyakutendile Labani. <verse eid="GEN 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13"/>Niye ni Mulungu yoyakulawilile kuja Beseli, hanhu haja houitilile mavuta imhanda ya ukumbuso, na weye kunilahila. Lelo isasale na ubwele muna iisi yako yowelekigwe.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14"/>Laheli na Leya wamwidika Yakobo, “Cheye chabule kaidi hanhu ha vinhu hebu uhazi wowose muna ikaye ya tati yetu. <verse eid="GEN 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15"/>Tati yetu kachitenda fana nyambenyambe. Kachichuuza, na lelo kasang'hanila hela zose zoyalihigwe kwa ichimu chetu. <verse eid="GEN 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16"/>Utajili uno wose Mulungu woyausolile kulawa kwa tati yetu ni wetu cheye na wanetu. Tenda vovose viyakulongele Mulungu.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17"/>Yakobo kalamka na kaisasala kusegela kwa kuwakweza wanage na wake zake muna ingamiya, <verse eid="GEN 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18"/>Kasola wanyama wake wose na vinhu vake vose viyavipatile kuja Padani Alamu, kandusa mwanza kubwela kuna iisi ya Kanaani kwa Isaka tati yake. <verse eid="GEN 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19"/>Labani viyahitile kuwakanha mazoya ng'hondolo wake, Laheli kabawa nyang'hiti za milungu ya tati yake. <verse eid="GEN 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20"/>Yakobo kamvwizila Labani Mwalamu, hamulongele bule kuwa kosegela. <verse eid="GEN 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21"/>Kasola chila chinhu chake na kasegela chahimahima. Kaloka ulwanda lwa Efulati na kahita kuna mulima wa isi ya Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Labani komsondelela Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22"/>Siku nhatu hamwande Labani kalongiligwa kuwa Yakobo kakimbila. <verse eid="GEN 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23"/>Labani kawasola ndugu zake, kamsondelela Yakobo kwa siku saba. Kamfika kuna mulima wa isi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24"/>Muna zinzozi ichilo Mulungu kamwizila Labani Mwalamu na kamulongela, “Uiteganye, seke umtemele mate Yakobo hebu sekeumduwile.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25"/>Labani kamfika Yakobo lusita ulo Yakobo viyekile lago jake kumulima, Labani na ndugu zake weka lago jawo muna iisi ya mulima wa Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26"/>Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Habali kutenda vino, habali kunivwizila na kuwasola wandele wangu fana mateka kuna ing'hondo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27"/>Habali kunivwizila na kunikimbila? One uhanilongele, nahadahile kukulaga kwa deng'ho na nyila na ngoma na vilongelonge. <verse eid="GEN 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28"/>Habali huning'hile nyafasi ya kuwanonela wanangu na wazukulu zangu? Yayo youtendile ya chibozi! <verse eid="GEN 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29"/>Ninawo udahi wa kukulumiza, mbali chilo chifosile Mulungu wa tati yako kanizuma kalonga, ‘Seke umtemele mate Yakobo hebu sekeumduwile.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30"/>Novimanya kukimbila kwaviya kukala na hamu ng'hulu ya kubwela ukaye kwa tati yako. Mbali habali kubawa nyang'hiti za milungu yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31"/>Yakobo kamwidika Labani, “Nidumba kwaviya nigesa uhanihokile wandele wako. <verse eid="GEN 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32"/>Mbali one munhu yoyose uhamfika na nyang'hiti za milungu yako, umkome. Zahila haulongozi ha wanhu wetu, one uhawona chinhu chako uchisole.” Yakobo havimanyile bule fana Laheli kabawa nyang'hiti za milungu ya Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33"/>Ivo Labani kahita na kazahila nyang'hiti izo muna dihema da Yakobo, maabaho kengila hema da Leya na hema da wasang'hani waja waidi wa chike, mbali hawonile bule nyang'hiti za milungu yake. Maabaho kengila muna dihema da Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34"/>Laheli kakala yasolile nyang'hiti izo za milungu na kazifisa hasi ya chigoda cha kukalila uchanyha ya ngamiya, na kakala mchanyha yake. Mbali Labani kazahila muna dihema jose, mbali hazipatile bule. <verse eid="GEN 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35"/>Laheli kamulongela tati yake, “Tata, sekeuniwonele ludoko, mbali sizakwinuka bule haulongozi wako kwaviya namzisiku zangu.” Labani kazizahila nyang'hiti za milungu yake, mbali hazipatile bule.<verse eid="GEN 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36"/>Maabaho Yakobo kehilwa na kagomba na Labani, kalonga “Nihasanya choni mbaka unisondelele vino? <verse eid="GEN 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37"/>Vino kupekula vinhu vangu vose, chinhu chako chilihi chouchipatile kumwangu? Chike haulongozi wa ndugu zako na ndugu zangu wadahe kulola muladi wadahe kulamula fana imwe wetu kagolosa. <verse eid="GEN 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38"/>Nikala na weye miyaka malongo maidi, ng'hondolo wako hebu luti wako hawatengule wimo, na sidile mabebelu kulawa muna dibumbila jako. <verse eid="GEN 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39"/>Niye hata mwanza umwe sikugalile mnyama wako yoyakomigwe na mnyama wa kumbago, mbali niliha ubananzi uwo niye mwenyewo. Weye kunilonda nilihe bila kugesa fana kabawigwa imisi hebu ichilo. <verse eid="GEN 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40"/>Imisi nifunyila umoyo zuwa na ichilo nifunyila umoyo mbeho, sidahile kupata nhongo hata chidogo. <verse eid="GEN 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41"/>Miyaka malongo maidi yose nikala hamwe na weye. Nikusang'hanila miyaka longo na mine kwa ichimu cha wandele zako waidi na miyaka sita kwa ichimu cha wanyama wako, mbali weye kwasakanya yombe jangu miyanza longo. <verse eid="GEN 31:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42"/>Mulungu wa tati yangu na Mulungu wa Bulahimu na Mulungu yoyamtendile Isaka yamdumbe, one sigambeyawe hamwe na niye, wahaniwingile mikono muhala. Mbali Mulungu kayawona manhesa yangu na sang'hano yoniitendile, na ichilo chifosile kakubwakila.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na Labani woitogolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43"/>Labani kamwidika Yakobo, “Wanaake wano ni wandele wangu, na wana wawo ni wanangu, wanyama wano ni wangu. Chila chinhu chouwona hano ni changu. Mbali niye nodaha kutendaki diyelo kwa iwano iwandele wangu na iwana wowaweleke? <verse eid="GEN 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44"/>Izo chitende lagano niye na weye, iwe ukalangama hagati ya weye na niye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45"/>Yakobo kasola dibwe kulu na kudisimika fana mhanda ya ukumbuso. <verse eid="GEN 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46"/>Yakobo kawalongela ndugu zake waduganye mabwe, nawo waduganya mabwe na weka chibugulu. Maabaho waja ndiya habehi na chibugulu chiya cha mabwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47"/>Labani kachitanga chibugulu icho Yegasahadusa, mbali Yakobo kachitanga Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48"/>Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Chibugulu chino cha mabwe chizakuwa ukalangama kwa cheye waidi.” Kwa ivo lekamana chibugulu icho chotangigwa Galedi, <verse eid="GEN 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49"/>na iviya hatangigwa Misipa, mana kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu yachikalize weye na niye lusita vichiwa kutali bila kuiwona.” <verse eid="GEN 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50"/>Labani kagendelela kulonga, “One uhawagaza wandele zangu, hebu uhasola wake wamwenga, one ihawa siimanyile mbuli ino, uvimanye kuwa Mulungu ni mkalangama wetu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51"/>Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Chibugulu cha mabwe yano ya luwe na mhanda ya ukumbuso yoniisimike hagati ya weye na niye ni ukalangama wa dibwe.” <verse eid="GEN 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52"/>Chibugulu chino na mhanda ni ukalangama kuwa niye sizafosa chibugulu chino kwiza kumwako hebu weye hwizafosa chibugulu chino na mhanda ino kwiza kumwangu kwa wihi. <verse eid="GEN 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53"/>Mulungu wa Bulahimu na Mulungu wa Naholi, kezachihumiza niye na weye. Maabaho Yakobo kailaha kwa zina da Mulungu yoyamtendile Isaka yamdumbe. <verse eid="GEN 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54"/>Maabaho Yakobo kalava nhambiko ya kutimbula kuna mulima na kuwagoneka ndugu zake waje ndiya, viwakomeleze wasigala uko chilo chose. <verse eid="GEN 31:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55"/>Imitondo ng'hani Labani kawanonela wazukulu zake na wanage na kawatemela mate, maabaho kawalaga, kawaleka na kabwela ukaye.<verse eid="GEN 31:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo koisasala kwiiting'hana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1"/>Yakobo kahita na mwanza wake, wasenga wa kuulanga waiting'hana nayo. <verse eid="GEN 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2"/>Yakobo viyawawone kalonga, “Dino ni lago da Mulungu.” Kahatanga hanhu haja Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3"/>Yakobo katuma wasenga kumulongolela kwa sekulu wake Esau uko Seili kuna iisi ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4"/>Kawalagiliza wakamulongele mwenevale wake Esau, “Msang'hani wako Yakobo kolonga vino ‘Nikala kuugeni kwa Labani mbaka sambi. <verse eid="GEN 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5"/>Niye nina ng'ombe na vihongwe na ng'hondolo na luti na wasang'hani wa chilume na wa chike. Nogala mbuli yangu kumwako mwenevale muladi nitogoleke haulongozi wako.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6"/>Wasenga viwabwelile kwa Yakobo, walonga, “Chihita kwa sekulu wako Esau, nayo kamzila kokwiza kukuhokela. Kokwiza na walume magana mane.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7"/>Yakobo kadumba ng'hani na kengiligwa na luholozi. Kawagola mabumbila maidi wanhu wowakalile nayo, iviya ng'hondolo zake na luti zake na ng'ombe zake na ngamiya zake. <verse eid="GEN 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8"/>Yakobo kagesa, “One Esau yaheza na kuditowa bumbila da mwanduso, bumbila dondadisigale dizaibanga.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9"/>Maabaho Yakobo katosa, “Mulungu wa tati yangu Bulahimu na Mulungu wa tati yangu Isaka, nihulike niye! Mndewa Mulungu kunilongela nibwele kuna isi yangu kwa ndugu zangu, na kezanitendela chila chinhu chinogile kumwangu. <verse eid="GEN 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10"/>Niye sifaya hata chidogo sang'hano zako za ulondo wa ufunya umoyo na ubazi wounilaguse msang'hani wako. Vinilokile lwanda lwa Yoludani nikala nabule chinhu ila mhome muhala, mbali lelo ninayo mabumbila maidi. <verse eid="GEN 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11"/>Nikombole kwa sekulu wangu Esau. Nodumba kwaviya kezakwiza kuchitowa na kuchinanga cheye chose na wanaake na wana. <verse eid="GEN 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12"/>Kulonga kuwa kwiza nitendela yanogile na kutenda welesi wangu uwe mwingi fana msanga wa mwiibahali, haupeteka bule.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13"/>Yakobo kagona baho chilo chose, maabaho kabagula vinhu vake vimwenga viwe chitumetume kwa Esau sekulu wake, <verse eid="GEN 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14"/>mizike ya luti magana maidi na mabebelu ya luti malongo maidi, mizike ya ng'hondolo magana maidi na mabebelu yang'ondolo malongo maidi, <verse eid="GEN 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15"/>ngamiya wokong'heza malongo matatu hamwe na madang'ang'a yawo, mang'ombe mazike malongo mane na malume longo, mhunda mazike malongo maidi na malume longo, <verse eid="GEN 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16"/>kawagola wasang'hani wake, chila munhu bumbila jake. Kawalongela, “Longoleni, kuno muleka nyafasi hagati ya bumbila dimwe na dimwenga.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17"/>Kamulagiliza msang'hani yalongole, “Wahaiting'hana na sekulu wangu Esau, yahakuuza, ‘Weye kwa msang'hani wa yelihi? Kohitahi? Wanyama kuulongozi wako wa yelihi?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18"/>Kolondeka umwidike, ‘Ni wa msang'hani wako Yakobo. Komgalila chitumetume mwenevale wake Esau. Yakobo mwenyewo kahachisogo chetu kokwiza.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19"/>Kalagiliza ivoivo kwa msang'hani wa bumbila dekaidi na deketatu na wamwenga wose kwa kulonga, “Mwizamulongela Esau mbuli izo izo vondamwiiting'hane nayo. <verse eid="GEN 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20"/>Iviya mumulongele, ‘Msang'hani wako Yakobo kahachisogo chetu kokwiza.’ ” Yakobo katenda ivo kagesa, “Huwenda nizamuhoza kwa vitumetume ivo vonimulongozela, na hamwande nodaha kuiwona nayo chihanga kwa chihanga, huwenda kezanihokela.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21"/>Vitumetume va Yakobo vikala vimulongolela, mbali yeye chilo icho kakala mudilago.<verse eid="GEN 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22"/>Uko chilo icho Yakobo kalamuka kawasola wake zake waidi na watumwa zake wa chike waidi na wanage longo na imwe, na kawalosa lwanda lwa Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23"/>Viyakomeleze kuwalosa umwambu, iviya kalosa vinhu vose viyakalile navo, <verse eid="GEN 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24"/>mbali Yakobo kakala yaidumwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Munhu imwe keza na wagomba mbaka imitondo. <verse eid="GEN 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25"/>Munhu iyo viyawonile kuwa hadaha kumuhuma Yakobo, kamdalisa ichigudi mbaka kasiguka. <verse eid="GEN 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26"/>Munhu iyo kalonga, “Nileke nihite kwaviya kokunguzuka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Yakobo kamwidika, “Sikuleka bule mbaka unitemele mate.” <verse eid="GEN 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27"/>Munhu iyo kamuuza, “Zina jako nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Nayo kamwidika, “Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28"/>Munhu iyo kamulongela, “Zina jako hadizakuwa Yakobo kaidi. Mbali zina jako dizakuwa Isilaili, kwaviya kugomba na Mulungu na wanhu, na kufunya umoyo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29"/>Yakobo kamuuza, “Lelo nilongele zina jako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Mbali yeye kamwidika, “Habali kolonda kumanya zina jangu?” Maabaho kamtemela mate Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30"/>Yakobo kalonga, “Nimuwona Mulungu chihanga kwa chihanga na ning'hali mgima.”. Kahatanga hanhu baho Penueli. <verse eid="GEN 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31"/>Yakobo viyafosile Penueli, zuwa dikala dosomoza, kakala yonjumbila kwaviya kasiguka ichigudi. <verse eid="GEN 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32"/>Niivo ili mbaka diyelo Waisilaili hawaja bule muge wa chigudi, kwaviya imunhu ija kamdalisa Yakobo hana umuge wa ichigudi chake viwakalile wogomba.<verse eid="GEN 32:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo koiting'hana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1"/>Yakobo kayenula meso yake na kamuwona Esau kokwiza na walume magana mane, ivo kawagola wanage kwa Leya na Laheli, na wasang'hani wake wa chike waidi. <verse eid="GEN 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2"/>Kaweka kuulongozi iwasang'hani wa chike na wanawo, maabaho Leya na wanage, kuchisogo Laheli na mwanage Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3"/>Yakobo mwenyewo kawalongolela kwa kuhita yotumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi miyanza saba mbaka viyafikile habehi na sekulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4"/>Mbali Esau kahita yomkimbilila Yakobo, na kamgeleka isingo na kamnonela, na wose waidi walila. <verse eid="GEN 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5"/>Esau viyalolile na kuwawona iwanaake na iwana, kauza, “Wanhu wano wouli nawo welihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobo kamwidika, “Wano ni wana Mulungu woyaning'hile msang'hani wake kwa ubazi wake.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6"/>Maabaho waja iwasang'hani na wana wawo wafika habehi na wainama kwa hishima, <verse eid="GEN 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7"/>iviya Leya na wanage weza na wainama kwa hishima, maabaho Yosefu na Laheli weza na wainama kwa hishima.<verse eid="GEN 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8"/>Esau kauza, “Vino habali kuyatuma mabumbila yano kumwangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobo kamwidika, “Nilonda nitogoleke na weye mwenevale wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9"/>Mbali Esau kalonga, “Nina vinhu va kufaya sekulu wangu, vinhu viuli navo usigale navo.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10"/>Yakobo kamulongela Esau, “Haidahika bule, one kutogola kunihokela, nokulamba unihokele vitumetume vangu. Kweli nodeng'helela kukuwona weye fana viya niwona chihanga cha Mulungu, kwaviya viunihokele kwa unovu. <verse eid="GEN 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11"/>Nolamba utogole vitumetume vino vonikugalile, kwaviya Mulungu kaninogela na kanipatila chila chinhu chinili nacho.” Ivo Yakobo kambembeleza Esau mbaka kahokela.<verse eid="GEN 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12"/>Esau kalonga, “Haya chigendelele na mwanza wetu. Niye nizakulongolela.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13"/>Yakobo kamwidika, “Mwenevale wangu kovimanya kuwa wana wano ving'hele, iviya nogesa ng'hondolo na ng'ombe wokong'heza na niye nolondeka kuwalola goya. Fana chahawagendeza siku ngima, yodahika wezadanganika. <verse eid="GEN 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14"/>Ivo nolonda mwenevale wangu ulongolele na niye nizasondelela hachisogo ugaluga fana viya kwa ugenzi wa iwanyama na iwana, mbaka vondanifike kwa mwenevale wangu uko Seili.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15"/>Esau kalonga, “Leka nikulekele wanhu wangu wamwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Mbali Yakobo kamwidika, “Sekeusang'hane ivo. Vinoga kumwangu kutogoligwa na weye mwenevale wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16"/>Siku iyo Esau kandusa kwamha nzila yake kubwela Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17"/>Mbali Yakobo kahita Sukoti, uko kaizengela kaye mwenyewo na vizewe kwa ichimu cha wanyama wake. Ivo hanhu baho hatangigwa Sukoti.<verse eid="GEN 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18"/>Lusita viyabwelile kulawa Padani Alamu, Yakobo kafika goya muna dibululu da Shekemu muna iisi ya Kanaani na keka lago jake habehi na dibululu. <verse eid="GEN 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19"/>Kagula hanhu baho ha lago kulawa muna uwelesi wa Hamoli tati yake Shekemu kwa vihande gana va hela. <verse eid="GEN 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20"/>Kazenga lupango hanhu baho na kuhatanga Eli Elohe Isilaili, fambulo jake Mulungu ni Mulungu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="GEN 33:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1"/>Siku dimwe Dina yoyelekigwe na Yakobo na Leya, kahita kuwalaula wanaake wa isi iyo. <verse eid="GEN 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2"/>Shekemu mwana wa Hamoli Muhivi yoyakalile mkulu wa isi iyo, viyamuwene Dina kamwamha na kagona nayo kwa shuluti na kumtenda yawone chinyala. <verse eid="GEN 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3"/>Mbali Shekemu kanogelwa ng'hani na Dina mwana wa Yakobo, ivo kandusa kumbembeleza. <verse eid="GEN 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4"/>Ivo Shekemu kamulongela Hamoli tati yake, “Uning'he mndele ino yawe muke wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5"/>Yakobo kahulika kuwa Dina mwanage katendigwa yambule mwiko na Shekemu, Mbali kwaviya wanage wakala wodima wanyama, kanyamala mbaka wanage viwabwelile. <verse eid="GEN 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6"/>Hamoli tati yake Shekemu kahita kwa Yakobo muladi yadahe kulonga nayo. <verse eid="GEN 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7"/>Ivo wanage Yakobo wabwela kulawa kudima wanyama wawo, viwahulike ivo wawona usungu na wehilwa ng'hani kwa yoyatendile Shekemu, kwaviya kawaliga wanhu wa Isilaili kwa kumbandama kwa shuluti mwana wa Yakobo, kwaviya mbuli iyo mwiko. <verse eid="GEN 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8"/>Hamoli kalonga, “Mwanangu Shekemu kanogelwa ng'hani na mndele wenu, ivo nolamba mumuleke yamsole. <verse eid="GEN 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9"/>Leka chiisole, mweye mwizawasola wanetu na cheye chizawasola wanenu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10"/>Maabaho mwizakala hano hana isi yetu hamwe na cheye, mwizakala hohose homulonda na mwizakuwa na ulegeho wa kugula na kuchuluza vinhu na kupata hanhu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11"/>Maabaho Shekemu kamulongela tati yake Dina na iwalumbu zake, “Nolamba munitende nitogoligwe haulongozi wenu na niye nizawagoleleni chomulonda. <verse eid="GEN 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12"/>Munilongele yombe jojose da zengele na chitumetume, hata yahawa ng'hulu vilihi, niye nizalava muladi nimsole yawe muke wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13"/>Wanage Yakobo wamwidika kwa kumvwizila Shekemu na tati yake Hamoli, kwaviya Shekemu kamtenda lumbu jawo Dina yambule mwiko. <verse eid="GEN 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14"/>Walonga, “Haidahika bule lumbu jetu kusoligwa na munhu hengizigwe ulungwana, kutenda ivo ni chinyala kumwetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15"/>Chodaha kwiitogolela kwa chinhu chimwe muhala mwizakuwa fana cheye kwa kumwingiza ulungwana chila mulume mmwenu. <verse eid="GEN 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16"/>Baho niivo vondamusole wandele zetu na cheye kusola wandele zenu. Chizakala hamwe na kuwa wanhu wamwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17"/>Mbali one hachiitogolela fana bumbila na kwingizigwa ulungwana, ivo chizamsola mndele wetu na kuhita.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18"/>Hamoli na Shekemu mwanage wanogelwa kwa icho chilongigwe, <verse eid="GEN 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19"/>imbwanga hakalame hata chidogo kufikiza chochilongigwe, kwaviya viyanogiligwe ng'hani na mndele wa Yakobo. Shekemu niiyo yoyahishimike kufosa wanhu wose ukaye kwa tati yake.<verse eid="GEN 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20"/>Hamoli na Shekemu mwanage wahita kuna ulwivi lwa dibululu hanhu ha mting'hano kulonga na wanhu wa dibululu, <verse eid="GEN 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21"/>“Wanhu wano mambwiya, waleke wakale muna iisi na kugula na kuchuluza vinhu. Isi yofaya kukala cheye na wawo. Wawo wasole wandele wetu na cheye chiwasole wandele wawo. <verse eid="GEN 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22"/>Mbali wanhu wano wahatogola kukala na cheye na kuwa wanhu wamwe, kwa chilagano chino cha kumwingiza ulungwana chila mulume vichili, fana viya wawo viwengizigwe ulungwana. <verse eid="GEN 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23"/>Vino hamuwona bule wanyama wawo na vinhu vawo vose vizakuwa vinhu vetu? Lelo chiitogolele nawo muladi wadahe kukala hamwe na cheye.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24"/>Walume wose wa dibululu wowaiting'hane hana ulwivi lwa dibululu ijo waitogolela na Hamoli na Shekemu imwanage. Maabaho walume wose wengizigwa ulungwana.<verse eid="GEN 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25"/>Siku yeketatu wengizigwe ulungwana wang'hali wana masungu ng'hani, wana waidi wa Yakobo, niiyo Simeoni na Lawi lumbu zake Dina wasola ngugulila zawo wadihitila dibululu ijo kwa kusinhukiza na kuwakoma walume wose. <verse eid="GEN 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26"/>Iviya wawakoma kwa ngugulila Hamoli na Shekemu imwanage. Maabaho wamsola Dina kulawa muna ikaye ya Shekemu na wahita nayo. <verse eid="GEN 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27"/>Viufosile ukomaji uwo, wana wamwenga wa Yakobo wengila muna dibululu na kusola vinhu kwaviya lumbu jawo katendigwa yambule mwiko shuluti. <verse eid="GEN 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28"/>Wasola ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na vihongwe na chila chinhu muna dibululu na muna imigunda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29"/>Wawagwila wana wawo wose na wanaake wawo wose, na wasola utajili na chila chinhu muna zikaye zawo.<verse eid="GEN 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30"/>Maabaho Yakobo kawalongela Simeoni na Lawi, “Mweye munigalila magayo kwa kunitenda nihiligwe na wanhu wa isi ino ya Wakanaani na Wapelizi. Niye nabule wanhu wengi, na one wahaiduganya hamwe, wezaninanga niye hamwe na ndugu zangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31"/>Simeoni na Lawi wedika, “Vino vinoga lumbu jetu kusang'haniligwa fana viya malaya?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35"/>
  <para style="s">Mulungu komtemela mate Yakobo uko Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1"/>Mulungu kamulongela Yakobo, “Segela hano, uhite Beseli na ukale uko. Unizengele lupango uko. Niye niiyo Mulungu yoyakulawilile viumkimbile sekulu wako Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2"/>Ivo Yakobo kawalongela ndugu zake na wanhu wose woyakalile nawo, “Segezeni zinyang'hiti za milungu ya chigeni zimuli nazo, mwiisafye na mwasakanye viwalo zenu. <verse eid="GEN 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3"/>Chosegela hano na chohita Beseli, uko nizamzengela lupango Mulungu yoyanitazile siku ya uzidilwa, Mulungu yoyakalile na niye muna umwanza wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4"/>Chila munhu wamtulila nyang'hiti zose za milungu ya chigeni zowakalile nazo, hamwe na heleni zowakalile wozivala mmagutwi. Yakobo kazihimbila hasi ya mbiki wa muwaloni ukalile habehi na Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5"/>Yakobo na wanage viwakalile wokwandusa kusegela, Mulungu kawadumbiza ng'hani wakaya wa mabululu yose ya habehi mbaka hawadahile kuwasondelela. <verse eid="GEN 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6"/>Yakobo na wanhu wake wafika Luzu, iviya yotangigwa Beseli, muna iisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7"/>Yakobo kazenga lupango baho na kahatanga hanhu baho Eli Beseli, kwaviya Mulungu kamulawilila baho viyamkimbile sekulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8"/>Debola yaya wa Lebeka kadanganika na kawandigwa hasi ya mbiki wa muwaloni ubanzi wa kusi wa Beseli. Ivo Yakobo kahatanga hanhu baho Aloni Bakusi, fambulo jake “muwaloni wa ndilo.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9"/>Yakobo viyabwelile kulawa Padani Alamu, Mulungu kamulawilila kaidi na kamtemela mate. <verse eid="GEN 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10"/>Mulungu kamulongela, “Weye zina jako Yakobo, mbali kwandusila sambi kwizatangigwa Isilaili.” Ivo Mulungu kamtanga zina Isilaili. <verse eid="GEN 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11"/>Mulungu kamulongela, “Niye Mulungu mwene Udaho, uwe na welesi mwingi na mongezeke. Wanhu wa makabila yose wezalawa kumwako, na kwizakuwa wasaho wa wafalume. <verse eid="GEN 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12"/>Isi yoniweng'hile Bulahimu na Isaka, nizakwing'ha weye na welesi wako.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13"/>Mulungu viyakomeleze kulonga na Yakobo, kasegela. <verse eid="GEN 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14"/>Yakobo kasimika mhanda hanhu haja Mulungu hoyalongile nayo, kaigidila divai na mavuta fana nhosa ya ching'waji. <verse eid="GEN 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15"/>Yakobo kahatanga hanhu baho Mulungu hoyalongile nayo Beseli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Laheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16"/>Yakobo na wanhu wake wagendelela na mwanza wasegela Beseli, viwakalile wang'hali hawanafika Efulata, Laheli kapata usungu ng'hani wa kuibasula. <verse eid="GEN 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17"/>Nayo viyakalile muna usungu ng'hani wa kuibasula, imulala kamulongela, “Sekeudumbe Laheli, kupata mwana imwenga wa chilume.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18"/>Mbali Laheli viyakalile habehi na kudanganika, kamwing'ha mwanage zina Benoni, mbali tati yake kamwing'ha mwanage zina Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19"/>Laheli viyadanganike kawandigwa mumgwazo gwazo wa dikulugumbi dodihita Efulata, sambi yomanyika Betelehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20"/>Yakobo kasimika mhanda uchanyha ya leme da Laheli, mbaka diyelo mhanda iyo yauko. <verse eid="GEN 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21"/>Isilaili kasegela baho, na keka lago jake viyafosile lingo da Edeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22"/>Isilaili viyakalile isi iyo, mwanage Lubeni kagona na Biliha imwe wa watumwa wa chike wakalile fana wake wa tati yake Isilaili na Isilaili kahulika mbuli izo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobo kakala na wana longo na waidi. <verse eid="GEN 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23"/>Wanage Leya wakala Lubeni, yeli chaudele wa Yakobo, na Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24"/>Wanage Laheli wakala Yosefu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25"/>Wana wa Biliha msang'hani wa chike wa Laheli wakala Dani na Nafutali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26"/>Wana wa Zilipa msang'hani wa chike wa Leya wakala Gadi na Asheli. Wana wano niiwawo woyaweleke Yakobo uko Padani Alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27"/>Yakobo kahita Mamule kwa Isaka tati yake, habehi na Kiliasi Aliba, iviya yotangigwa Hebuloni, howakalile Bulahimu na Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28"/>Isaka kakala na miyaka gana na malongo manane. <verse eid="GEN 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29"/>Isaka kadanganika mulala ng'hani na kakala na deng'ho, kahita kuilumba na wasaho zake. Esau na Yakobo wanage wamuwanda.<verse eid="GEN 35:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36"/>
  <para style="s">Welesi wa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1"/>Uno uwo ludongo lwa welesi wa Esau, iviya kotangigwa Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2"/>Esau kasola wanaake wa Kanaani, Ada niiyo mndele wa Eloni Muhiti, Oholibama mndele wa Ana na ni mzukulu wa Sibewoni Muhivi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3"/>na Basemati mndele wa Ishumaili, lumbu jake Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4"/>Ada kamwelekela Esau Elifazi na Basemati kamweleka Leuweli. <verse eid="GEN 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5"/>Oholibama kamweleka Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola. Wano wose wakala wana wa Esau, woyaweleke muna iisi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6"/>Maabaho Esau kawasola wake zake na wanage wa chilume na wanage wa chike na wanhu wose muna ikaye yake, ng'ombe wake na wanyama wake wamwenga wose na vinhu vake vose viyapatile muna iisi ya Kanaani, na kahita isi imwenga kutali na Yakobo mdodo wake. <verse eid="GEN 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7"/>Wasegela kwaviya isi yowakalile wokala Esau na Yakobo ikala haiwafaiye bule. Wakala na mifugo mingi na wapotwa kukala hamwe muna iisi ija. <verse eid="GEN 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8"/>Esau kakala muna iisi ya mulima wa Seili, zina dimwenga da Esau ni Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9"/>Uno niuwo ludongo lwa welesi wa Esau, wasaho wa Waedomu muna iisi ya milima ya Seili. <verse eid="GEN 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10"/>Wana wa Esau watangigwa Elifazi, yoyelekwe na Ada muke wake, na Leuweli yoyelekwe na Basemati imuke wake imwenga. <verse eid="GEN 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11"/>Wana wa Elifazi watangigwa Temani na Omali na Zefo na Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12"/>Elifazi kakala na muke imwenga zina jake Timino, iyo kamwelekela Esau mwana wa chilume zina jake Amaleki, wawo wakala wazukulu wa Ada muke wa Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13"/>Basemati muke wa Esau kamweleka Leuweli. Wana wa Leuweli watangigwa Nahati na Zela na Shama na Miza.<verse eid="GEN 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14"/>Muke wa Esau Oholibama, mndele wa Ana wa Sibewoni kamwelekela Esau wana watatu, nawo niiyo Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15"/>Wano ni wakulu wowalawile muna uwelesi wa Esau. Elifazi yoyakalile chaudele wa Esau kaweleka Temani na Omali na Zefo na Kenazi <verse eid="GEN 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16"/>na Kola na Gatamu na Amaleki, wano wose niuwo welesi wa Elifazi muna iisi ya Edomu, na wazukulu wa Ada muke wake Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17"/>Leuweli mwanage Esau kaweleka Nahati na Zela na Shama na Miza. Wawo wose wakala wakulu muna yamakabila yawo. Wano wose wakala wana wa Leuweli muna iisi ya Edomu na wazukulu na Basemati muke wa Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18"/>Wano ni wana wa Oholibama muke wa Esau, Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola. <verse eid="GEN 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19"/>Wano ni wawo wana wa chilume wa Esau yani Edomu, chila imwe wawo kawa mkulu wa kabila jake. Wawo wose wana wa Oholibama, mwana wa Ana, muke wa Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Welesi wa Seyili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20"/>Wana wa Seili Muholi wowakalile muna iisi iyo watangigwa Lotani na Shobali na Sibeyoni na Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21"/>na Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani. Wawo niwawo wakulu wa Waholi wa welesi wa Seili muna iisi ya Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22"/>Wana wa Lotani watangigwa Holi na Hemanina, lumbu jake Lotani katangigwa Timina.<verse eid="GEN 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23"/>Wana wa Shobali watangigwa Avani na Manahati na Ebali na Shefo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24"/>Wana wa Sibeyoni watangigwa Aya na Ana. Ana niiyo yatolile nzasa za mazi ya moto kuchuwala viyakalile kowadima mhunda wa tati yake Sibeyoni. <verse eid="GEN 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25"/>Wanage Ana watangigwa Dishoni na mndele wake zina jake Oholibama. <verse eid="GEN 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26"/>Wana wa Dishoni watangigwa Hemidani na Eshibani na Silani na Kelani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27"/>Wana wa Eseli watangigwa Bilihani na Zaawani na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28"/>Wana wa Dishani watangigwa Usi na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29"/>Wano wakala wakulu wa Waholi, Lotani na Shobali na Sibeyoni na Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30"/>na Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani. Wano wakala wakulu wa kabila da Waholi, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo muna iisi ya Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wafalume wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31"/>Wano wakala wafalume watawale mwiisi ya Edomu, yang'hali mfalume yoyose hanawatawala bule Waisilaili <verse eid="GEN 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32"/>Bela mwana wa Bewoli kakala mfalume wa Edomu. Bululu jake ditangigwa Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33"/>Viyadanganike Bela, katawala Yobabu mwana wa Zela kulawa bululu da Bosila, <verse eid="GEN 36:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34"/>Viyadanganike Yobabu, katawala Hushamu kulawa isi ya Watemani. <verse eid="GEN 36:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35"/>Viyadanganike Hushamu, Hadadi mwana wa Bedadi katawala, niiyo yoyawatowile na kuwahuma Wamidiani muna iisi ya Moabu, bululu jake ditangigwa Aviti. <verse eid="GEN 36:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36"/>Viyadanganike Hadadi, katawala Samula kulawa Masileka. <verse eid="GEN 36:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37"/>Viyadanganike Samula, katawala Shauli kulawa Lehoboti bululu dili habehi ya ulwanda lwa Efulati. <verse eid="GEN 36:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38"/>Viyadanganike Shauli, katawala Baalihanani mwana wa Akiboli. <verse eid="GEN 36:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39"/>Viyadanganike Baalihanani, mwana wa Akiboli, katawala Hadadi, bululu jake ditangigwa Pawu na muke wake katangigwa Mehetabeli mndele wa Matiledi na mzukulu wa Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40"/>Yano ni mazina ya masekulu wa Esau kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na hanhu hawo, nawo ni Timina na Aliva na Yeteti <verse eid="GEN 36:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41"/>na Oholibama na Ela na Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42"/>na Kenazi na Temani na Mibisali, <verse eid="GEN 36:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43"/>na Magidiyeli na Ilamu. Wawo ni wakulu wa makabila yoyalawile Edomu. Edomu niiyo Esau. Wamanyika kwa kusondelela ukazi wawo muna zisi zowakalile.<verse eid="GEN 36:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37"/>
  <para style="s">Yosefu na Ndugu zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1"/>Yakobo kagendelela kukala muna iisi ya Kanaani hanhu hoyakalile tati yake fana mgeni. <verse eid="GEN 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2"/>Zino ni mbuli za ugima wa Yakobo. Yosefu viyakalile mbwanga wa miyaka longo na saba, kakala kodima ng'hondolo na luti hamwe na ndugu zake wana wa Biliha na Zilipa, wake wa tati yake. Yosefu kamulongela tati yake mbuli zihile za ndugu zake.<verse eid="GEN 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3"/>Isilaili kamulonda ng'hani Yosefu kufosa wanage wose, kwaviya kamweleka lusita lwa ulala wake. Ivo kamtendela Yosefu ng'hanzu ya chiiyeka yoihambigwe goya. <verse eid="GEN 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4"/>Baho ndugu zake viwawonile kuwa tati yawo kamnogela Yosefu kufosa wawo, wamwihila na hawalongile nayo vinogile bule.<verse eid="GEN 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5"/>Chilo chimwe Yosefu kalota nzozi, na viyawasimulile ndugu zake, wawo waiyoha kumwihila ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6"/>Yosefu kawalongela, “Tegelezeni nzozi yonilotile. <verse eid="GEN 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7"/>Nilota kuwa cheye chikala kumgunda chofunga mikinza, na kwa kusinhusa kinza jangu dinuka zugaga! Mikinza yenu iiduganya kudizunguluka na kwiidulikila kinza jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8"/>Ndugu zake wamuuza, “Vino weye kochilongela kwiza chitawala?” Hebu kwizakuwa na ukulu kumwetu? Ivo waiyoha kugendelela kumwihila kwa ichimu cha nzozi na mbuli zake.<verse eid="GEN 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9"/>Maabaho Yosefu kalota nzozi imwenga na kawalongela ndugu zake, “Nilota nzozi imwenga, niwona zuwa na mwezi na nhondo longo na imwe zinitumbalila mavindi.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10"/>Mbali viyawalongele tati yake na ndugu zake, tati yake kambwakila kulonga, “Vino nzozi yaki iyo yuulotile? Vino izatendeza mami yako na ndugu zako na niye chikutumbalile mavindi mpaka chidalise hasi kwa hishima haulongozi wako?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11"/>Ndugu zake wamuwonela migongo, mbali tati yake kagendelela kuigesa mbuli iyo.<verse eid="GEN 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu kochuuzigwa na ndugu zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12"/>Siku dimwe ndugu zake Yosefu wahita kudima mifugo ya tati yawo uko Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13"/>Isilaili kamulongela Yosefu, “Nolonda weye uhite uko Shekemu kowadimila mifugo ndugu zako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yosefu kamwidika, “Ona nitogola.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14"/>Tati yake kamulongela, “Hita ukawalole ndugu zako na mifugo one wawo wagima na maabaho ubwele unilongele.” Ivo tati yake kamtuma kulawa muna zanda da Hebuloni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Yosefu kafika Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15"/>Munhu imwe kamuwona kowegela muichuwala na kamuuza, “Kozahila choni?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16"/>Yosefu kamwidika, “Nozahila ndugu zangu wowodima mifugo yawo. Kodaha kunilongela haja haweli?”<verse eid="GEN 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17"/>Munhu ija kamwidika, “Wasegela wamala. Kwaviya niwahulika wolonga wohita Dosani.” Ivo Yosefu kawasondelela ndugu zake na kawafika uko Dosani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18"/>Viwamuwone kwa kutali, na yang'hali kuwafikilila, wailungila kumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19"/>Wailongela, “Lola ija nyamiloto kokwiza. <verse eid="GEN 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20"/>Leka chimkome na chimwase muna disima dimwe. Na chizalonga kadigwa na ng'onyo kali da muna imbago. Maabaho chilole kuwa izo zinzozi zake zizakuwaze.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21"/>Mbali Lubeni viyahulike mbuli izo, kamkombola Yosefu kulawa kumwawo, kwa kulonga, “Sekechimkome.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22"/>Lubeni kawalongela, “Sekemwitile damu, mbali mwaseni muna disima dino hano haichuwala, mbali sekemumulumize.” Kalonga ivo muladi yamkombole Yosefu muna yamakono yawo, maabaho yambweleze kwa tati yake. <verse eid="GEN 37:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23"/>Yosefu viyafikile kwa ndugu zake, wamvula ng'hanzu yake ya chiiyeka yoiyawale. <verse eid="GEN 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24"/>Maabaho wamsola na kumwasa muna disima dilibule mazi.<verse eid="GEN 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25"/>Viwakalile woja wawona bumbila da Waishumaili wokwiza kulawa Gileadi kuhita Misili. Ngamiya wawo wakala wapapile vilungo na ubani na mavumba. <verse eid="GEN 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26"/>Yuda kawalongela ndugu zake, “Chizapata choni chihamkoma ndugu yetu, na kufisa ukomaji wake? <verse eid="GEN 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27"/>Chimgule kwa Waishumaili, mbali sekechimulumize kwaviya yeye ni ndugu yetu na iviya ni damu imwe na cheye.” Ndugu zake waitogolela, <verse eid="GEN 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28"/>Wagula vinhu Wamidiani viwafikile hanhu baho, ndugu zake wamulava Yosefu muna disima na wamchuuza kwa Waishumaili kwa vihande malongo maidi va hela, na Waishumaeli wamsola Yosefu mbaka Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29"/>Lubeni viyabwelile kuna disima dilibule mazi, hamwone Yosefu bule, Lubeni kadega walo jake kwa usungu. <verse eid="GEN 37:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30"/>Hamala baho Lubeni kawabwelela ndugu zake na kalonga, “Mbwanga kahabule hano! Choni chondanitende?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31"/>Hamala baho wachinja mwana luti na wachofeka ng'hanzu ya Yosefu muna idamu. <verse eid="GEN 37:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32"/>Waisola ing'hanzu mbaka kwa tati yawo na walonga, “Chiiitola ino, lola vino ino niiyo ng'hanzu ya mwanago?”<verse eid="GEN 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33"/>Yakobo kaimanya ing'hanzu kalonga, “Iyo yake! Mng'onyo wa kumbago kamgwila na kamuja. Yosefu kanyomholigwa vihande vihande!” <verse eid="GEN 37:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34"/>Baho Yakobo kayadega yamawalo yake kwa usungu, kaiyawaza mawalo ya maguniya muna ichigudi. Kamulilila mwanage kwa siku nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 37:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35"/>Wanage wa chilume na wachike wamwizila wadahe kumuliza, mbali Yakobo kalema kulizwa kwa kulonga, “Nilekeni nizagendelela kulila kwa chimu cha mwanangu, mbaka vondanihite kuzimu kuyeli.” Niivo tati yake viyagendelele kumulilila Yosefu.<verse eid="GEN 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36"/>Chipindi icho uko Misili Wamidiani wamgula Yosefu kwa Potifa imwe wa walangulizi wa mfalume yoyakalile mkulu wa chibumbila cha ukalizi.<verse eid="GEN 37:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38"/>
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1"/>Chipindi icho Yuda kawaleka ndugu zake na kahita kukala na munhu zina jake Hila, Mwadulamu <verse eid="GEN 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2"/>Uko Yuda kaiting'hana na mndele Mkanaani tati yake zina jake Shuwa. Yuda kamsola mndele iyo na kambandama, <verse eid="GEN 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3"/>Mndele wa Shuwa kapata wimo na keleka mwana wa chilume, Yuda kamtanga Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4"/>Kapata wimo umwenga kaidi na keleka mwana imwenga na zina jake kamtanga Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5"/>Kaidi kapata mwana imwenga wa chilume, kamtanga Shela. Shela viyelekwe, Yuda kakala uko Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6"/>Yuda kamfungiza zengele Eli mwanage chaudele, kwa muke yatangigwe Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7"/>Mbali Eli chaudele wa Yuda kakala na mbuli za mdukula haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, ivo Mndewa Mulungu kamkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8"/>Ivo Yuda kamulongela Onani ndugu wa Eli, “Hita ukamwingilile muke wa sekulu wako imgane, kwaviya niivo viulondeka utende udahe kumwelekela sekulu wako wana.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9"/>Mbali Onani kavimanya kuwa sigambe iwe wanage bule, ivo viyambandame muke wa sekulu wake, ketilila hasi zimbeyu, sekeyampatile wana sekulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10"/>Choyachitendile Onani iviya chiwa chiha kwa Mndewa Mulungu, iviya yeye nayo Mndewa Mulungu kamkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11"/>Yuda kamulongela Tamali imkoyi wake wa chike, “Bwela kwa tati yako ukale ugane mbaka mwanagu Shela vondayakule.” Yuda kadumba Shela sekeyadanganike fana viya ndugu zake. Ivo Tamali kabwela ukaye kwa tati yake.<verse eid="GEN 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12"/>Lusita lukulu lufosa, muke wake Yuda mwana wa Shuwa kadanganika. Yuda viyakomeleze ndilo, kasegela na mbwiyake Hila kulawa Mwadulamu wahita Timina kwa wakanha mizoya ya ng'hondolo wake. <verse eid="GEN 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13"/>Tamali kahulika kuwa mkoyi wake wa chilume kakala yohita Timina, kuwakanha mizoya ng'hondolo wake. <verse eid="GEN 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14"/>Tamali kayavula mawalo ya ukefilwa, kaigubika mtandilo maabaho kakala hana dikumba da kwingilila Enaimu, chibululu chochikalile mwiinzila kuhita Timina. Katenda ivo kwaviya kawona kuwa Shela kawa munhu mkulu mgima mbali Tamali hasoligwe bule na Shela.<verse eid="GEN 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15"/>Yuda viyamuwone Tamali kagesa kuwa kakala yochuuza lukuli lwake, kwaviya chihanga chake kakala yachigubike. <verse eid="GEN 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16"/>Baho havimanyile bule iyo kakala muke wa mwanage Yuda, kamuhitila baho hamgwazo ya inzila kamulongela, “Nolonda nikubandame.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Tamali kalonga, “Kwizaning'ha choni wahanibandama?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17"/>Yuda kamwidika, “Nizakwing'ha mwana luti kulawa bumbila jangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Tamali kamulongela, “Yose yanoga, yodahika wike wingilizi kulagusa kwizanigalila iyo iluti.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18"/>Yuda kamuuza, “Kolonda nikwing'he choni fana wingilizi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Tamali kamwidika, “Ning'he chinhu chili na luzabi chili na chilaguso chako na mhome.” Yuda kamwing'ha vinhu ivo vose na kambandama, nayo kapata wimo.<verse eid="GEN 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19"/>Maabaho Tamali kasegela, kahambula mtandilo woyaigubike, kayawala nyawalo zake za ugane.<verse eid="GEN 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20"/>Yuda viyamtumile ija imbwiya Mwadulamu, yamgalile ija mwanamke mwana luti muladi yambwelezele wingilizi yoyamulekele, mbali hamfikile bule. <verse eid="GEN 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21"/>Kawauza wanhu wa Enaimu, “Kakulihi muke ija malaya yoyakalile hano hana dikulugumbi yoyotenda umalaya fana nzila ya kutosela nyang'hiti za milungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Iwanhu wamwidika, “Hanhu hano hakalile na muke malaya bule.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22"/>Hila kambwelela Yuda na kalonga, “Simuwonile bule. Wanhu wa hanhu baho walonga kuwa hano hahakalile na muke malaya.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23"/>Yuda kalonga, “Leka yavisole vinhu ivo. Sekeyachitendeze wanhu wachizehe. Weye mwenyewo kuwona nimgalila mwana luti mbali weye humfikile bule.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24"/>Viifosile miyezi mitatu, Yuda kalongiligwa kuwa, “Mkoyi wako Tamali muke wa mwanago kapata wimo kwa ugoni wake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda kalagiliza, “Msoleni yalavigwe kunze yasomigwe moto mbaka yadanganike.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25"/>Viwakalile womulava kunze, Tamali katuma usenga kwa mkoyi wake wa chilume: “Niye nina wimo kwa munhu mwene vinhu vino. Umulole na ummanye munhu mwene chinhu chili na luzabi chili na chilaguso chako na mhome ino.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26"/>Yuda kavimanya vinhu ivo na kalonga, “Tamali kanoga kufosa niye, kwaviya simsolele mwanangu Shela.” Kusongela siku ijo Yuda hambandame kaidi Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27"/>Viifikile chipindi cha Tamali kwiibasula, kukala na mambasa mwiinda yake. <verse eid="GEN 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28"/>Usungu vuumfikile wa kwiibasula, mbasa imwe kalava mkono kunze, nayo imulala kamfunga kwa lusingija ludung'u kuno kolonga, “Ino niiyo yanduse kwelekigwa.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29"/>Mbali imwana viyaubweleze mkono mgati, ndugu yake kandusa kwelekigwa. Imulala kalonga, “Hee weye kufosa kwa nguvu kulawa kunze!” Ivo katangigwa zina jake Pelesi, fambulo jake “Kulawa kwa nguvu.” <verse eid="GEN 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30"/>Maabaho sekulu wake nayo kelekigwa kuno kana lusingija ludung'hu muna umkono wake, nayo katangigwa Zela.<verse eid="GEN 38:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39"/>
  <para style="s">Yosefu na Muke wa Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1"/>Waishumaili viwamsolile Yosefu wamgala mbaka Misili na wamchuuza kwa Potifa, imwe wa wakulu wa mfalume, na niiyo mkulu wa chibumbila chake cha wakalizi. <verse eid="GEN 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2"/>Mndewa Mulungu kakala hamwe na Yosefu, nayo katenda vinogile ng'hani kwa chila chinhu. Yosefu kakala muna ikaye ya mwenevale wake Mmisili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3"/>Mwenevale wake viyawonile kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kakala hamwe na Yosefu na chila chiyatendile katenda vinogile. <verse eid="GEN 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4"/>Ivo Potifa kanogeligwa ng'hani na Yosefu, na kamtenda msang'hani wake, ivo kamwika kuwa mulolesi wa kaye yake na chila chinhu chiyakalile nacho. <verse eid="GEN 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5"/>Kwandusila lusita ulo, kwa ichimu cha Yosefu Mndewa Mulungu kaitemela mate kaye ya Mmisili iyo na chila chinhu choyakalile nacho na migunda yake. <verse eid="GEN 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6"/>Potifa keka chila chinhu chiyakalile nacho haulolesi na ukalizi wa Yosefu, na hagesile chochose ila kuja ndiya yake muhala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yosefu kakala mbwanga yanogile na chihanga chinoga, <verse eid="GEN 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7"/>na lusita vilufosile muke wa Potifa kandusa kummelela mate Yosefu na kamulamba yahite yakaibandame nayo. <verse eid="GEN 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8"/>Yosefu kalema na kamulongela, “Mwenevale wangu kabule lugano jojose muna ikaye kwaviya niye nabaha, na kanitulila chila chinhu chiyeli nacho. <verse eid="GEN 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9"/>Hano hakaye kabule mamulaka kufosa niye, hanilemesa kwamha chochose ila weye muhala kwaviya weye kwa muke wake. Ivo nodahaze kutenda wihi fana uwo kwa kumuhasanya Mulungu?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10"/>Na muke wa Potifa kamulongela Yosefu mbuli iyo chila siku, mbali Yosefu kalema kumbandama na hata kuwa hamwe nayo.<verse eid="GEN 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11"/>Mbali siku dimwe Yosefu kengila mgati mwiikaye kusang'hana sang'hano yake na wasang'hani wamwenga hawakalile umo. <verse eid="GEN 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12"/>Muke wa Potifa kamgwila debwani jake na kulonga, “Unyangale.” Mbali Yosefu kasulupuka na kakimbilila kunze, kadileka debwani jake mmakono yake. <verse eid="GEN 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13"/>Muke wa Potifa viyawonile kuwa Yosefu kadileka debwani jake na kukimbilila kunze ya ikaye, <verse eid="GEN 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14"/>kawatanga wasang'hani wa kaye yake na kawalongela, “Loleni ino! Ino Muebulaniya mulumangu yoyomgalile mwiikaye kochiguma chinyala. Kengila muna ichiheleto changu muladi yanyangale, mbali niye niguta nyangi. <verse eid="GEN 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15"/>Viyahulike noguta nyangi, kakimbilila kunze, kadileka debwani jake hamwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16"/>Mwanamke ija kadika debwani diya, mbaka mwenevale wa Yosefu viyabwelile ukaye. <verse eid="GEN 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17"/>Kamsimulila mbuli iyo, “Iyo msang'hani Muebulaniya yoyumgalile hano kengila muna ichiheleto kuniguma chinyala. <verse eid="GEN 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18"/>Mbali vinigutile nyangi, kadileka debwani jake na kukimbilila kunze.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19"/>Mwenevale wa Yosefu viyazihulike mbuli izo za muke wake, kuwa ivo viyasang'hane msang'hani wake, kawa na ludoko <verse eid="GEN 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20"/>na kamgwila Yosefu na kumwika muna ichifungo hanhu hawakalile wafungigwa wa mfalume. Ivo Yosefu kalekigwa mwiichifungo. <verse eid="GEN 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21"/>Mbali hata umo muichifungo Mndewa Mulungu kakala nayo na kagendelela kumulagusa Yosefu ulondo wake, mbaka mkulu wa chifungo kanogelwa nayo. <verse eid="GEN 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22"/>Mkulu wa chifungo kamwika Yosefu yawe mkulu wa wafungigwa wose na chila chochitendeke umo muna ichifungo chitendeka kwa ulangulizi wake. <verse eid="GEN 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23"/>Mkulu wa chifungo hagesile chinhu chochose, Yosefu katuliligwa chila chinhu kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kakala hamwe nayo na chila chinhu choyachitendile katenda vinogile.<verse eid="GEN 39:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40"/>
  <para style="s">Yosefu kofambula Nzozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1"/>Viyafosile yayo mwikagoya ving'waji na mokaji magate wa mfalume wa Misili wamuhasanya mfalume wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2"/>Mfalume kawawonela ludoko walangulizi wake waidi, mwikagoya ving'waji na mokaji magate <verse eid="GEN 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3"/>na kawaguma muna ichifungo muna ikaye ya mkulu wa wakalizi, hanhu hoyafungigwe Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4"/>Wanhu wawo wakala muna ichifungo kwa lusita, na mkulu wa wakalizi kamwing'ha ukulu Yosefu yawalolese.<verse eid="GEN 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5"/>Ikala chilo chimwe, mwikagoya ving'waji na mokaji magate wa mfalume wa Misili wowafungigwe muna ichifungo walota nzozi, chila imwe kalota nzozi mbasakanyo na miyage, nzozi zikala na fambulo mbasakanyo. <verse eid="GEN 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6"/>Yosefu viyezile imitondo, kawawona kuwa wawa luholozi. <verse eid="GEN 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7"/>Yosefu kawauza wakulu wawo wa mfalume wowakalile hamwe nayo mwiichifungo mwiikaye ya mwenevale wake, “Habali diyelo muna vihanga va luholozi?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8"/>Nawo wamwidika, “Chilota nzozi na habule yodaha kuchifambulila nzozi zetu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yosefu kalonga, “Vino siyo Mulungu muhala yoyodaha kufambula nzozi?” Nilongeleni nzozi zenu.<verse eid="GEN 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9"/>Mwikagoya ving'waji wa mfalume kamulongela Yosefu, “Muna inzozi yangu niwona kuzubuku da mzabibu haulongozi wangu, <verse eid="GEN 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10"/>nawo ukala na matambi matatu. Lusita viusukile mayani, maluwa yake yapumbuluka na vilobota vake viwa zabibu zivile. <verse eid="GEN 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11"/>Mmakono yangu nikala nokwamhilila nhungo ya mfalume. Baho nisola zabibu nizikamula muna inhungo na nimwing'ha mfalume.” <verse eid="GEN 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12"/>Yosefu kamulongela, “Dino niijo fambulo jake, matambi matatu ni siku nhatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13"/>Zahafika siku nhatu, mfalume kezakulava muna ichifungo na kukubweleza kaidi muna ukulu wako. Kwizamwing'ha mfalume nhungo fana viukalile kotenda baho haumwanduso. <verse eid="GEN 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14"/>Mbali ung'humbuke baho chila chinhu vondachihite goya kumwako, na nolamba unitendele yanogile na unitambule baho haulongozi wa mfalume na unitaze nilawe muna ichifungo chino. <verse eid="GEN 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15"/>Kwaviya niye nitolosigwa kulawa isi ya Waebulaniya na hano sitendile chochose chinitendeze nigumigwe muna ichifungo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16"/>Mkulu wa mokaji magate viyawone fambulo ijo dinoga da mwikagoya ving'waji, kamulongela Yosefu, “Iviya naniye nilota nzozi, nikala niitwikile vigelo vitatu va magate mditwi jangu. <verse eid="GEN 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17"/>Muna ichigelo cha uchanyha kukala na ndiya mbasakanyo zibanikigwe kwa ichimu cha mfalume, mbali udege wazija muna ichigelo uchanyha mditwi jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18"/>Yosefu kamwidika, “Dino niijo fambulo jake: Vigelo vitatu ni siku nhatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19"/>Muna zisiku nhatu mfalume kezakulava mchifungo, na kukuchinja ditwi jako. Kezakutumbika muna umbiki na ndege wezakuja nyama yako.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20"/>Siku ya tatu, ikala siku ya kufikiza kwelekigwa mfalume. Mfalume kawekila dugila wakulu wake wose, kamulava muna ichifungo mwikagoya ving'waji na mokaji magate mkulu na kaweka haulongozi wa wakulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21"/>Mfalume kambweleza mwikagoya ving'waji muna ukulu wake wa kung'wiza, muladi yamwing'he nhungo mfalume muna yamakono. <verse eid="GEN 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22"/>Mbali mokaji magate mkulu katumbikigwa fana viyalongile Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23"/>Mbali mwikagoya ving'waji, hamkumbuke bule Yosefu kamzimiza.<verse eid="GEN 40:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41"/>
  <para style="s">Yosefu Kofambula Nzozi za Mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1"/>Viifosile miyaka midi, mfalume wa Misili kalota nzozi, kuwa kakala yemile muna ingema ya lwanda lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2"/>lusita kawona ng'ombe saba watelele na wanenehe walawa kunze ya ulwanda lwa Naili na wandusa kuja mgina. <verse eid="GEN 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3"/>Maaabaho ng'ombe saba wamwenga weza, wowakalile wasisili na wasoka. Weza na wema habehi na waja ng'ombe mumgwazo wa ulwanda luja lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4"/>Ng'ombe waja saba wasisili na wasokile, wawaja ng'ombe waja watelele na wanenehe. Maabaho mfalume kalamuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5"/>Kagona kaidi na kalota nzozi zimwenga. Mimada saba ya uhemba imema na ikangala, ikung'huna muna dibuwa dimwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6"/>Mimada saba ya uhemba imisisili yoinyazigwe na mbeho ili na vuke ya ulawilo wa zuwa ilawilila. <verse eid="GEN 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7"/>Ivo mimada misisili iyaja ija imimada saba yoinenehe. Mfalume kalamuka kavimanya kuwa kakala kolota. <verse eid="GEN 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8"/>Imitondo kengilwa na lugano, katuma wasawi wose na wanhu wabala wose wa Misili. Na mfalume kawalongela nzozi zake, mbali habule munhu yoyose yamfambulile.<verse eid="GEN 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9"/>Maabaho mkulu wa mwikagoya ving'waji kamulongela mfalume, “Diyelo nokumbuka ubananzi wangu woniutendile. <verse eid="GEN 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10"/>Lusita luja viuchiwonele ludoko cheye wakulu wako, niye na mkulu wa mokaji magate na kuchifunga muna ichifungo muna ikaye ya mkulu wa wakalizi. <verse eid="GEN 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11"/>Chilo chimwe niye na yeye chilota nzozi, na chila nzozi ikala na fambulo jake. <verse eid="GEN 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12"/>Mbwanga iyo Muebulaniya msang'hani wa mkulu wa wakalizi kakala hamwe na cheye, Chimulongela nzozi zetu, na yeye kachifambulila. <verse eid="GEN 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13"/>Chila chinhu chilawilila fana viya viyalongile. Ukulu wangu nibweleziligwa mbali mokaji magate katumbikigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14"/>Mfalume kalagiliza Yosefu yagaligwe, na wamgala kulawa muna ichifungo. Yosefu viyamalile kuwegula na kusaula nyawalo zake, kahita kwa mfalume. <verse eid="GEN 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15"/>Mfalume kamulongela Yosefu, “Nilota nzozi, mbali habule munhu yoyose yoyadahile kunifambulila. Nilongiligwa kuwa weye kodaha kuzifambula nzozi.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16"/>Yosefu kamwidika mfalume, “Sidaha bule, mbali Mulungu kezamfambulila mfalume vinogile.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17"/>Mfalume kamulongela Yosefu, “Nilota nima muna ingema ya lwanda lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18"/>niwawona ng'ombe saba wolawa muna ulwanda lwa Naili watelele na wanenehe na wandusa kuja mgina. <verse eid="GEN 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19"/>Maabaho ng'ombe wamwenga saba wasisili na wasokile. Muna iisi yose ya Misili sinawawona bule wowalingile fana wawo. <verse eid="GEN 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20"/>Ng'ombe wasisili na wasokile weza na wawaja iwang'ombe saba waja wanenehe, <verse eid="GEN 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21"/>mbali viwamalile kuwaja ng'ombe waja wanenehe, munhu yoyose sigambe yavimanye kuwa wawaja wayawo, kwaviya wakala wasoka fana viya ichanduso. Maabaho nilamka mzinhongo. <verse eid="GEN 41:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22"/>Maabaho muna zinzozi zangu niwona mimada saba ya uhemba inogile na imema yokung'huna muna dibuwa dimwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23"/>Maabaho mimada saba ya uhemba, imisisili inyazigwe na mbeho ili na vuke ya ulawilo wa zuwa ilawilila, <verse eid="GEN 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24"/>na mimada iyo misisili imela ija mimada saba inogile. Niwalongela waganga nzozi izo, mbali habule munhu yoyadahile kunifambulila.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25"/>Yosefu kamulongela mfalume, “Nzozi zako mbili zina fambulo dimwe, Mulungu kakulongela chiya chondayatende. <verse eid="GEN 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26"/>Waja ng'ombe saba wanenehe ni miyaka saba, na ija mimada saba ya uhemba inogile iviya ni miyaka saba, fambulo jake ni dimwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27"/>Waja ng'ombe saba iwasisili na wasokile, waja wowasondelele waja wanenehe na ija mimada saba ya uhemba, yoinyazigwe na mbeho ya ulawilo wa zuwa, fambulo jake ni miyaka saba ya nzala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28"/>Fana viya vinimulongele mfalume, Mulungu kamulagusa yaja yondayatende. <verse eid="GEN 41:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29"/>Kwizakuwa na miyaka saba ya shibe muna iisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30"/>Yahafosa yayo, kwizalawilila miyaka saba ya nzala, na miyaka ija inogile izazimizwa muna iisi ya Misili, kwaviya nzala izalumiza isi. <verse eid="GEN 41:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31"/>Chipindi cha shibe hachizakumbukigwa, kwaviya nzala ikwiza izakuwa ng'hulu. <verse eid="GEN 41:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32"/>Kwaviya nzozi ya mfalume ibweleligwa miyanza midi, imulagusa kuwa Mulungu kalamula na kezaifikiza mbuli ino ivino sambi.<verse eid="GEN 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33"/>“Lelo mfalume kolondeka yamsagule munhu yeli na umanyi na ubala, yawe mulolezi muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34"/>Kaidi yeye mfalume, yawatome walolesi wamwenga hano mwiisi, yawalagilize waduganye hanhu ha tano ha ndiya ya miyaka saba ya shibe muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35"/>Yawalagilize waduganye ndiya zose chipindi cha miyaka inogile ikwiza, na kumwing'ha udahi mfalume wa kwika ndiya muna yamagulu kwa ichimu cha ndiya ya mabululu yose, ikalizwe kwa kwikigwa goya. <verse eid="GEN 41:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36"/>Ndiya iyo izakuwa ngama ya isi chipindi cha miyaka saba ya nzala yondaiwe muna iisi ya Misili. Kwa nzila ino wanhu hawezadanganika kwa nzala bule.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu kokwing'higwa ukulu Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37"/>Mbuli iyalongile Yosefu imnogeza mfalume na wakulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 41:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38"/>Ivo mfalume kawauza wakulu wake, “Vino chompatahi munhu fana ino Yosefu yeli na muhe wa Mulungu mgati yake?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39"/>Mfalume kamulongela Yosefu, “Kwaviya Mulungu kakulagusa yano yose, habule munhu yeli na ubala fana weye. <verse eid="GEN 41:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40"/>Nokwika weye muna ulolesi wa isi yangu, na wanhu wangu wose wezakutegeleza. Ukulu wako wizakuwa wekaidi kulawa niye. <verse eid="GEN 41:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41"/>Mfalume kamulongela Yosefu, Lelo nokwing'ha ukulu wa kutawala isi yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42"/>Mfalume kavula chinhu chili na luzabi chili na chilaguso chake muna ichidole chake, na kachiguma muna ichidole cha Yosefu. Kamuyawaliza walo da mgolole na kumvaza mkufu wa zahabu mwiiisingo yake. <verse eid="GEN 41:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43"/>Mfalume kamkweza muna umtuka wake wekaidi wa falasi, na wakalizi walongolela haulongozi wa Yosefu, kuno wolandula madizi yawo na kulonga, “Tumbaleni mavindi!” Ivo niivo mfalume viyamwing'hile ukulu Yosefu muna iisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44"/>Maabaho mfalume kamulongela Yosefu, “Niye mfalume, na habule munhu yoyose muna iisi yose ya Misili yondayenule mkono hebu mgulu bila ya kulongiligwa na weye.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45"/>Mfalume kamwing'ha Yosefu zina da Chimisili, Zefanati Paneya, na kamwing'ha muke, Asenati mwana wa Potifela, mkulu wa nhambiko wa bululu da Oni. Yosefu kahita uko na uko muna iisi ya Misili <verse eid="GEN 41:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46"/>Yosefu kakala na lika da miyaka malongo matatu viyanduse kumsang'hanila mfalume wa Misili. Yosefu kahasegela haulongozi wa mfalume na kahita kuna iisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47"/>Ivo muna imiyaka ija saba ya shibe, migunda muna iisi ilava ndiya mvunyo, <verse eid="GEN 41:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48"/>Yosefu kaduganya ndiya kwa miyaka saba muna iisi ya Misili na keka kuna yamabululu. Chila bululu keka ndiya kulawa mmigunda yoizunguluka. <verse eid="GEN 41:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49"/>Yosefu keka ngama ya ndiya mvunyo fana viya msanga wa mwiibahali mbaka kapotwa kuipeta kwaviya haipeteka.<verse eid="GEN 41:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50"/>Ing'hali hainakwandusa miyaka saba ya nzala, Yosefu kawa kapata wana waidi kwa imuke Asenati mwana wa Potifela mkulu wa nhambiko wa Oni. <verse eid="GEN 41:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51"/>Yosefu kamtanga mwanage chaudele zina jake Manase, kwaviya kalonga, “Mulungu kanitenda nizimize manhesa yangu yose na kaye ya tati yangu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52"/>Mwana magati kamtanga zina Efulaimu, fambulo jake, “Mulungu kaning'ha wana muna iisi ya manhesa yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53"/>Miyaka saba ya shibe iwa imala muna iisi ya Misili, <verse eid="GEN 41:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54"/>na miyaka saba ya nzala yandusa, fana viya Yosefu viyalongile. Kukala nzala muna zisi zimwenga zose, mbali muna iisi ya Misili kukala na ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 41:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55"/>Wamisili viwanduse kuwa na nzala, wamulilila mfalume yaweng'he ndiya. Mbali mfalume kawalongela Wamisili wose, “Muhite kwa Yosefu na mutende chondayawalongele.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56"/>Nzala yenela muna iisi yose, Yosefu kayavugula madungu yose na kawachuluzila ndiya Wamisili, kwaviya nzala ikala ng'hulu muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57"/>Wanhu kulawa zisi zose weza Misili kugula ndiya kwa Yosefu, kwaviya nzala ikala ng'hulu ng'hani chila hanhu.<verse eid="GEN 41:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42"/>
  <para style="s">Ndugu zake Yosefu wohita Misili kugula uhemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1"/>Yakobo viyamanyile kuwa uko Misili kuna ndiya, kawalongela wanage, “Habali mweye moilola mweye kwa mweye muhala? <verse eid="GEN 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2"/>Nihulika uko Misili kuna ndiya, hiteni uko mukagule ndiya muladi sekechidanganike kwa nzala.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3"/>Ivo ndugu longo wa Yosefu wahita Misili kugula ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4"/>Mbali Yakobo hamulekele bule Benjamini mdodo wake Yosefu kuhita na ndugu zake, kwaviya kadumba chinhu chihile kumulumiza.<verse eid="GEN 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5"/>Wana wa Isilaili wafika Misili, wagula ndiya fana viya wamwenga, kwaviya uko kwiisi ya Kanaani kukala na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6"/>Chipindi icho, Yosefu niiyo yoyakalile mulolesi wa isi ya Misili, yoyawachuuzile ndiya wanhu walawile zisi zose. Ivo ndugu zake Yosefu weza na wamtumbalila mavindi mbaka vihanga vidalisa hasi. <verse eid="GEN 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7"/>Yosefu viyawawone ndugu zake kawatambula, mbali kaitenda fana viya hawamanyile bule. Kawauza kwa ukali, “Mweye mulawa kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Nawo wamwidika, “Chilawa isi ya Kanaani, chiza kugula ndiya.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8"/>Yosefu kawamanya sekulu zake, mbali wawo hawammanyile bule. <verse eid="GEN 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9"/>Yosefu kaikumbuka nzozi yoyailotile na kalonga, “Mweye mwiza kupelemba unyonyonde wa isi yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10"/>Ndugu zake wamwidika, “Siyo mwenevale. Cheye ni wasang'hani wako chiza kugula ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11"/>Cheye chose ni ndugu, cheye siyo wapelembaji, cheye wasang'hani wako ni wanhu hachilonda uvwizi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12"/>Mbali Yosefu kagendelela kulonga, “Siyo! Mwiza kupelemba unyondenyonde muna iisi yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13"/>Wamulongela, “Cheye wasang'hani wako, chose cha ndugu longo na waidi, wana wa munhu imwe mkaya wa Kanaani. Ndugu yetu imwe kadanganika, na mdodo wetu kasigala na tati yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14"/>Yosefu kawedika, “Fana viya viniwalongele, mweye mwa wapelembaji. <verse eid="GEN 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15"/>Vino niivo vondamugezigwe, noilaha kwa zina da mfalume, hano hamwizahalawa mbaka mdodo wenu vondayeze hano. <verse eid="GEN 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16"/>Mtumeni imwe wenu yamsondelele ndugu yenu imdodo na kuno wamwenga wogozela muna ichifungo baho hondaumanyike ulonzi wenu kweli yake, la sivo noilaha kwa zina da mfalume, mweye mwa wapelembaji.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17"/>Maabaho kawaguma muna ichifungo kwa siku nhatu. <verse eid="GEN 42:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18"/>Siku yetatu Yosefu kawalongela, “Kwaviya niye nomdumba Mulungu, tendeni vino na mweye mwizakala. <verse eid="GEN 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19"/>One mweye mwa wanhu siyo wauvwizi, imwe wenu yasigale muna ichifungo, wamwenga wawagalile ndiya ndugu zenu ukaye weli na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20"/>Maabaho mumgale mdodo wenu kumwangu. Iyo yolagusa ukweli wa ulonzi wenu, na hamwizakomigwa bule.” Waitogolela ivo. <verse eid="GEN 42:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21"/>Maabaho walonganya, “Lelo cheye cha muna yamagayo kwa ichimu cha yaja yochimtendele Yosefu ndugu yetu, chimuwona kakala na luholozi mkulu hata viya viyachilambile nhazo, mbali cheye hachimtegeleze bule. Lekamana magayo yano yose yochilawilila.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22"/>Lubeni kawedika, “Siwalongele bule kuwa sekemumulumize mbwanga? Mbali mweye hamunitegeleze bule! Lelo damu yake yolondigwa kumwetu.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23"/>Yosefu kakala yovimanya yose yowakalile wolonga, mbali wawo hawavimanyile bule kuwa kavimanya, kwaviya viyalongile kalonga nawo kwa nzila ya mfambulaji. <verse eid="GEN 42:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24"/>Yosefu kasegela hoyakalile na kandusa kulila. Kabwela na kulonga nawo, kamgwila Simeoni na kamfunga haulongozi wawo.<verse eid="GEN 42:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndugu wa Yosefu wobwela Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25"/>Yosefu kalagiliza maguniya yawo ya kusumila yamemezigwe ndiya na kumbwelezela chila imwe wawo hela muna diguniya jake na ndiya ya mzila. Ivo niivo itendeke. <verse eid="GEN 42:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26"/>Wawapapiza mbahasha zawo vihongwe, na maabaho wasegela. <verse eid="GEN 42:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27"/>Viwafikile hanhu ha kugona nyambenyambe, imwe wawo kafungula lobota jake yadahe kumdima chihongwe wake, kazanywa kuwona hela yake muna diguniya jake. <verse eid="GEN 42:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28"/>Kawalongela ndugu zake, “Hela yangu ibwelezigwa.” Aino hano hanadiguniya jangu! Viwahulike yayo mizoyo yawo igwa na wakala wogudema kwa ludumbo na kwiiuzagiza wenyewo, “Chinhu chaki chino Mulungu choyachitendele?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29"/>Viwafikile kwa tati yawo Yakobo uko kuna iisi ya Kanaani, wamulongela mbuli zose zozilawilile. <verse eid="GEN 42:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30"/>“Mkulu wa isi ya Misili kalonga na cheye kwa ukali na kuchilonga cheye cha wapelembaji muna iisi yake. <verse eid="GEN 42:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31"/>Mbali cheye chimwidika, ‘Cheye siyo wapelembaji, cha wanhu hachilonga uvwizi. <verse eid="GEN 42:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32"/>Chimulongela kuwa cheye cha ndugu longo na waidi, wana wa tata imwe. Ndugu yetu imwe ni mwene kwaga, mdodo wetu kauko kuna iisi ya Kanaani hamwe na tati yetu.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33"/>Mbali mkulu wa isi ija kachilongela, ‘Vino niivo vondanivimanye kuwa mweye mwa wanhu hamulonga uvwizi, mulekeni kumwangu ndugu yenu imwe, na wamwenga mgale ndiya kwa jamaa zenu weli na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34"/>Mumgale mdodo wenu kumwangu. Maabaho nizavimanya kuwa hamuli wapelembaji, mbali wanhu hawalonga uvwizi. Nizaweng'ha ndugu yenu kubwela nayo, na mwizadaha kulekelwa kutenda uchuluzi muna iisi ino.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35"/>Viwakalile wokung'huna ndiya kulawa muna yamaguniya yawo, wazanywa kuwona chila imwe wawo kabweleziligwa chifuko chake na hela mgati ya guniya jake. Viwawone zihela, wawo na tati yawo Yakobo wadumba. <verse eid="GEN 42:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36"/>Yakobo tati yawo kawalongela, “Monihoka wanangu, Yosefu kakwabule, Simeoni kakwabule, na lelo molonda kumsola Benjamini. Manhesa yose yamhata niye!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37"/>Lubeni kamulongela tati yake, “Fana niye simbweleze bule Benjamini kumwako, uwakome wanangu waidi. Muleke Benjamini muna imikono yangu na niye nizamkaliza na kumbweleza kumwako.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38"/>Mbali Yakobo kalonga, “Mwanangu haita hamwe na mweye bule, sekulu wake kadanganika, na kasigala yaidumwe muhala. One jojose dahamulawilila mwiinzila, niye namulala nili na uhenga, ivo mwizanikoma kwa lugano dondanipate.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43"/>
  <para style="s">Mwanza wa kaidi kuhita Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1"/>Maabaho nzala ikala ng'hulu muna iisi. <verse eid="GEN 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2"/>Viwakomeleze kuja ndiya yose yoigaligwe kulawa Misili, tati yawo kawalongela wanage, “Bweleni na kugula ndiya chidogo kwa ichimu chetu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3"/>Mbali Yuda kamulongela, “Munhu ija kachizuma kwa ukali kalonga, ‘Sizawahokela bule fana hamwizile nayo ndugu yenu.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4"/>One kotogola chihite nayo mdodo wetu, chizahita kukugulila ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5"/>Mbali one wahalema yahite na cheye, hachizahita bule, kwaviya munhu ija kachilongela funhula funhula kuwa ‘Sizawahokela mweye mbaka mwize na mdodo wenu.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6"/>Isilaili kalonga, “Habali moniguma muna diyangwayangwa kwa kumulongela imunhu iyo kuwa munayo mdodo wenu imwenga?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7"/>Wawo wamwidika, “Imunhu iyo kachiuzagiza ugaluga ng'hani kusonhela mbuli zetu na welesi wetu kalonga, ‘Tati yenu yang'hali mgima? Mumpata ndugu imwenga?’ Cheye chimwidika kwa viya viyauzile. Chihavimanyile vilihi fana kochilongela mwize na mdodo wenu?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8"/>Yuda kamulongela tati yake Isilaili, “Mulekelele mwanago hamwe na niye, na chizasegela mwanza umwe muladi cheye na weye na wanetu chidahe kuwa wagima sekechidanganike. <verse eid="GEN 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9"/>Niye mwenyewo nokuwa mwingilizi, na weye kwizanyamhilila niye. One simbweleze kumwako, nidaigwe niye siku zose <verse eid="GEN 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10"/>Mbali one hachikalame bule, chahahitile uko na kubwela hano miyanza midi.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11"/>Tati yawo Isilaili kawalongela, “Haya kwaviya yolondeka iwe ivo, basi, tendeni ivo, soleni kulawa muna imifuko yenu mazao yanogile ya isi, mavuta chidogo ya mkwazu na uki chidogo na ubani na mavuta yonung'ha goya na mbeyu za kuja. <verse eid="GEN 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12"/>Soleni hela ya miyanza midi yoilondeka, kwaviya yolondeka mwiibweleze hela ija yoikigwe muna yamalobota yenu. Yodahika ibwelezigwa chiubananzi. <verse eid="GEN 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13"/>Msoleni ndugu yenu na muhite nayo kwa munhu iyo. <verse eid="GEN 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14"/>Mulungu mwene Udaho yawanogele kupata ubazi haulongozi wa munhu iyo na yawalekelele ndugu yenu imwenga, kezaweng'ha Benjamini na ndugu yenu imwenga kubwela mose, one nahalondeka niwagize wanangu, nizawagiza.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15"/>Iwandugu wasola vitumetume na hela miyanza midi kufosa ija ya ichanduso. Wahita Misili hamwe na ndugu yawo Benjamini. Viwafikile wahita kwima haulongozi wa Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16"/>Baho Yosefu viyamuwonile Benjamini hamwe nawo, kamulongela mulolesi wa kaye yake, “Wasole wanhu wano mbaka ukaye yangu. Wezakuja ndiya ya imisi hamwe na niye. Chinja mnyama na usasale ndiya.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17"/>Mulolesi kaye katenda fana viya viyalagilizigwe, kawasola mbaka kwiikaye ya Yosefu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18"/>Viwawone wogaligwa kwiikaye ya Yosefu, wadumba na walonga, “Chogaligwa kuno kwa ichimu cha ija ihela yochibweleziligwe muna yamalobota yetu vichizile mwanza wanduso yadahe kupata ulongelo wa kuchidusa kwa kuchihoka vihongwe wetu na kuchitenda chiwe watumwa wake.”<verse eid="GEN 43:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19"/>Viwawile hana ulwivi lwa ikaye ya Yosefu, wamulongela msang'hani, <verse eid="GEN 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20"/>“Chilekelele mwenevale, chiza hano kugula ndiya umwanza wa ichanduso. <verse eid="GEN 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21"/>Vichifikile kaye ya nyambenyambe, chifungula malobota yetu, chila imwe wetu kafika hela muna yamalobota yake. Ivo chinayo, chikubwelezela. <verse eid="GEN 43:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22"/>Iviya chinazo hela zimwenga za kugulila ndiya kaidi. Hachivimanyile bule yelihi yekile hela yetu muna malobota yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23"/>Mulolesi kawedika, “Muwe na tindiwalo na sekemdumbe. Mulungu wenu, Mulungu wa tati yenu, niiyo yekile hela zenu muna yamaguniya. Nihokela maliho yenu.” Maabaho kawagalila Simeoni.<verse eid="GEN 43:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24"/>Mulolesi kawasola mbaka mwiikaye ya Yosefu. Kaweng'ha mazi wanawe nhende, na kawadima vihongwe wawo. <verse eid="GEN 43:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25"/>Nawo wasasala vitumetume vawo va kumwing'ha Yosefu, vondayabwele imisi, kwaviya walongiligwa kuwa wezakuja ndiya hamwe nayo. <verse eid="GEN 43:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26"/>Ivo Yosefu viyabwelile ukaye, wasola vitumetume muna ikaye na wamtumbalila mavindi mbaka chihanga chidalisa hasi. <verse eid="GEN 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27"/>Kawauza kuhusu ugima wawo na maabaho kalonga, “Munisimulila kuhusu tati yenu imulala, vino kachelwa? Vino yang'hali mgima?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28"/>Wawo wamwidika, “Msang'hani wako tati yetu yang'hali mgima na kachelwa.” Maabaho wamtumbalila mavindi mbaka chihanga chidalisa hasi.<verse eid="GEN 43:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29"/>Yosefu kachinula chihanga chake na kamuwona ndugu yake Benjamini, mwana wa mami yake na kalonga, “Ino niiyo ndugu yenu imdodo, yomnilongele mbuli zake? Mulungu yakunogele, mwanangu.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30"/>Yosefu kahalawa hima hima hanhu baho, kwaviya kaihulika giyogiyo kwa ichimu cha kumemwa na ubazi wa ndugu yake, kahita kuna ichiheleto chake na kalila umo. <verse eid="GEN 43:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31"/>Viyakomeleze kunawa chihanga chake, kalawa kunze, na kaiyangambiza, kalagiliza yagaliligwe ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 43:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32"/>Yosefu kagaliligwa ndiya yake yaidumwe mwiimeza, na wandugu zake waidumwe. Wamisili wadile hamwe iviya waigola kwaviya ni mwiko kuja ndiya hamwe na Waebulaniya. <verse eid="GEN 43:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33"/>Ndugu zake Yosefu wakala kwa kuipanga haulongozi wake kwa kusondelela lika jawo. Kwandusila wa mwanduso mbaka wa uhelelo, wakala woilola kwa mwazanyo. <verse eid="GEN 43:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34"/>Ndiya ikala isoligwe kulawa kwa Yosefu na kugaligwa kumwawo, mbali Benjamini kagoliligwa miyanza mitano kufosa ndugu zake. Ivo wang'wa na wadeng'helela hamwe nayo.<verse eid="GEN 43:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44"/>
  <para style="s">Nhungo yopatika kwa Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1"/>Yosefu kamulagiliza mulolesi wa kaye yake, “Memeza malobota ya wanhu wano ndiya fana viya vowodaha kupapa, na mwikile chila munhu hela muna umulomo wa guniya jake. <verse eid="GEN 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2"/>Ika nhungo malumu muna umulomo wa lobota da ija imdodo, hamwe na hela ya ndiya yake.” Nayo katenda fana viya viyalongiligwe na Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3"/>Imitondo ng'hani ndugu wawo watogoleligwa kusegela na vihongwe wawo. <verse eid="GEN 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4"/>Nawo viwawile hawanahita hatali kulawa muna dibululu, Yosefu kamulongela mulolesi wa kaye yake, “Himahima wasondelele na wahawapata uwagwile na uwauze, ‘Habali muliha yehile kwa yanogile? <verse eid="GEN 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5"/>Vino habali mubawa nhungo malumu ya mwenevale wangu? Vino nhungo ino siyo ija iyong'wila nayo koisang'hanila kulagula? Ivo mutenda vihile kwa dino!’”<verse eid="GEN 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6"/>Ivo mulolesi viyawafikile kawalongela mbuli izo izo. <verse eid="GEN 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7"/>Wamulongela, “Habali mwenevale kolonga mbuli fanile zino? Cheye wasang'hani wako hachidaha kusang'hana mbuli fanile ino bule. <verse eid="GEN 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8"/>Lola mwenevale hela ichifikile muna imilomo ya maguniya yetu chiibweleza kulawa muna iisi ya Kanaani. Lelo habali chibawe hela hebu zahabu kulawa muna ikaye ya mwenevale wako? <verse eid="GEN 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9"/>Mwenevale, one imwe wetu yahawoneka kanayo, yakomigwe, na chondachisigale chizakuwa watumwa wako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10"/>Kalonga, “Nitogola, mbali ija yasolile nhungo yangu muhala niiyo yondayawe mtumwa wangu, na wondamusigale mwizailegeha.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11"/>Ivo wahulumusa hasi maguniya yawo himahima, na chila munhu kafungula lobota jake. <verse eid="GEN 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12"/>Mulolesi wa Yosefu kapekula maguniya yose kwandusila da mkulu kabisa mbaka da mdodo kabisa na nhungo ipatika kwa idodo kabisa muna diguniya da Benjamini <verse eid="GEN 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13"/>Baho wadega viwalo vawo kwa lugano, wawapapiza mizigo vihongwe wawo, na wabwela kuna dibululu.<verse eid="GEN 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14"/>Yuda na ndugu zake viwezile kuna ikaye ya Yosefu, Yosefu kakala yang'hali umo. Ivo wamtumbalila mavindi kwa hishima. <verse eid="GEN 44:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15"/>Yosefu kawauza, “Mutenda choni? Hamuvimanyile kuwa munhu fana niye nodaha kulagula?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16"/>Yuda kamwidika, “Mwenevale, chodaha kulonga choni?” Chodahaze kulema? “Chodahaze kuigombela? Mulungu kalagusa ubananzi wetu. Lelo cheye chose na ija yatoligwe na nhungo yako, chawatumwa wako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17"/>Yosefu kalonga, “Bule! Niye sidaha kutenda ivo! Ija muhala yasolile nhungo yangu niiyo yondayawe mtumwa wangu. Mweye musigalile bweleni kwa tindiwalo kwa tati yenu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda komulamba Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18"/>Yuda kamkwenhukila Yosefu na kamulongela, “Mwenevale, nokulamba, unilekelele niigombele. Sekeuniwonele ludoko weye kulinga fana mfalume mwenyewo. <verse eid="GEN 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19"/>Mwenevale, weye kuchiuza cheye, ‘Mweye muna tata hebu ndugu?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20"/>Chidika, ‘Chinayo tata mulala na ndugu mdodo, kamweleka muna ulala wake. Sekulu wake kadanganika, na yeye muhala niiyo mwana yasigale kwa mami yake na tati yake komulonda ng'hani.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21"/>Mwenevale, kuchilagiliza cheye wasang'hani wako chimgale hano, muladi umuwone, <verse eid="GEN 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22"/>na chikulongele kuwa mbwanga iyo hadaha kumuleka tati yake, one yahamuleka tati yake, tati yake kezadanganika. <verse eid="GEN 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23"/>Maabaho kuchilongela wasang'hani wako, ‘One hamwizile na ndugu yenu imdodo sizamuhokelani bule.’<verse eid="GEN 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24"/>“Vichibwelile ukaye kwa msang'hani wako tati yangu, chimulongela mbuli zako mwenevale. <verse eid="GEN 44:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25"/>Maabaho tati yetu kachilongela chibwele kugula ndiya chidogo. <verse eid="GEN 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26"/>Chimwidika, ‘Hachidaha kuhita, mbali hachihokeligwa mbaka chihite na mdodo wetu. One hezahita na cheye bule hachidaha kuhokiligwa na munhu ija.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27"/>Tati yetu kachilongela, ‘Movimanya kuwa muke wangu Laheli kanyelekela wana waidi muhala wa chilume. <verse eid="GEN 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28"/>Imwe kaga kamala. Na nilonga kuwa yodahika kalumizigwa na wang'onyo wa muna imbago. Kwaviya sinamuwona kaidi kwandusila viyasegele. <verse eid="GEN 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29"/>One muhamsola ino iviya kulawa kumwangu yahapatigwa na yehile mwizanihumulusa kuzimu na kuno na mulala nili na mnamilo.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30"/>“Ivo mwenevale,” Nihambwelela tati yangu msang'hani wako bila ya mbwanga ino na kuno ugima wa tata ohuwila ugima wa mbwanga ino. <verse eid="GEN 44:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31"/>“Yahawona kahabule hamwe na cheye kezadanganika. Ivo cheye wasang'hani wako chizamtenda tati yetu yadanganike kwa mnamilo. <verse eid="GEN 44:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32"/>Yose ya yayo niye niilava niwe mwingilizi wa mbwanga ino kwa tati yangu, nilonga one simbweleze bule Benjamini kumwako ubananzi uwe kumwangu siku zose. <verse eid="GEN 44:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33"/>Lelo weye mwenevale nokulamba, niye msang'hani wako, nisigale niwe mtumwa wako kwa chimu cha mbwanga ino. Muleke yeye yabwele ukaye hamwe na ndugu zake. <verse eid="GEN 44:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34"/>Nodahaze kubwela kwa tati yangu one mbwanga heli na niye? Sidaha kufunya umoyo kuwona yehile yondayampate tati yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45"/>
  <para style="s">Yosefu koilagusa kwa ndugu zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1"/>Baho Yosefu kapotwa kufunya umoyo haulongozi ha wasang'hani wake, ivo kawalongela wose walawe kunze ya chiheleto. Ivo Yosefu kakala yaidumwe viyailaguse kwa ndugu zake. <verse eid="GEN 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2"/>Kalila kwa dizi kulu mbaka Wamisili wamuhulika, mbaka wanhu wa kaye ya mfalume nawo wahulika. <verse eid="GEN 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3"/>Maabaho Yosefu kawalongela ndugu zake, “Niye ni Yosefu. Vino tati yangu yang'hali mgima?” Mbali ndugu zake viwahulike ivo, wadumba mbaka hawadahile kwidika bule. <verse eid="GEN 45:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4"/>Maabaho Yosefu kawalongela, “Nolamba, kwenhukeni habehi yangu.” Wakwenhuka, nayo kalonga, “Niye ni ndugu yenu Yosefu, yomunichuuzile kuhita Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5"/>Mbali lelo sekemwingilwe na luholozi na sekemuilaumu wenyewe kwaviya munichuuza. Mulungu kanituma kuulongozi wenu muladi nikombole ugima wa wanhu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6"/>Uno ni mwaka wekaidi wa nzala muna iisi, na ing'hali miyaka imwenga mitano iyo wanhu hawezadaha kulima hebu kugobola. <verse eid="GEN 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7"/>Mulungu kanigala kuulongozi wenu muladi niwatende mweye musigale muna iisi na kuwakombola kwa ukombola mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 45:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8"/>Ivo siyo mweye yomunigalile hano, mbali Mulungu. Kanitenda niwe tata kwa mfalume. Niye ni mwimilizi wa kaye yose, niye ni mtawala wa isi yose ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9"/>“Ivo himahima mubwele kwa tata na mumulongele kuwa vino ivo viyolonga Yosefu mwanago; ‘Mulungu kanitenda niwe mtawala wa isi yose ya Misili, izo kumwangu bila kukalama. <verse eid="GEN 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10"/>Kwizakala muna iisi ya Gosheni, kwizakuwa habehi na niye, weye na wanago na wazukulu zako na ng'hondolo wako na luti wako na ng'ombe wako na chila chinhu chiulinacho. <verse eid="GEN 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11"/>Vondauwe Gosheni, nizakulola goya weye, ndugu zako hamwe na fugo yako muladi sekemupuwe chochose chomulonda, kwaviya ing'hali miyaka imwenga mitano ya nzala.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12"/>Yosefu kagendelela kulonga, “Mweye wenyewo muwona kwa meso yenu na hata ndugu yangu Benjamini kaniwona kwa meso yake kuwa niye iyo mwenyewo Yosefu yonilonga na mweye. <verse eid="GEN 45:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13"/>Na mweye mwizamulongela tati yangu hishima inili nayo hano Misili na yose yomuyawone, maabaho himahima mukamsole tati yangu na mumgale hano.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14"/>Maabaho Yosefu kamuhagatila Benjamini ndugu yake na kalila, Benjamini nayo kalila na kuno waihagatila. <verse eid="GEN 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15"/>Maabaho wogendelela kulila, Yosefu kawanonela ndugu zake na kalila. Viyakomelezeke yayo ndugu zake wandusa kulonga nayo.<verse eid="GEN 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16"/>Mbuli izo vizifikile kwiimhongono ya mfalume, kuwa ndugu wa Yosefu weza, zimnogela mfalume na wakulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17"/>Ivo mfalume kamulongela Yosefu, “Walongele ndugu zako wawapapize mizigo yawo vihongwe na wabwele kuna iisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18"/>Wamgale hano tati yawo na wanhu wawo. Niye nizaweng'ha hanhu hanogile ha isi ya Misili, nawo wezadeng'helela matunda yose ya isi ino. <verse eid="GEN 45:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19"/>Iviya walongele kulawa Misili, wasole mituka ibululigwa kuwagalila wana wawo wadodo na wake zawo na iviya sekewaswele kumgala tati yawo. <verse eid="GEN 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20"/>Walongele sekewagese vinhu vawo kwaviya vinhu vinogile muna iisi ya Misili vizakuwa vawo.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21"/>Ivo wana wa Isilaili watenda fana viya viwalongiligwe. Yosefu kaweng'ha mituka fana viyalagilize mfalume na ndiya ya kuja mwiinzila. <verse eid="GEN 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22"/>Kamwing'ha chila munhu viwalo va kusaula. Mbali kamwing'ha Benjamini vihande magana matatu va hela na viwalo vitano va kusaula. <verse eid="GEN 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23"/>Hamala baho vitumetume vino kamwing'ha tati yake kwa ichimu cha mwanza, vihongwe longo wowapapile vinhu vinogile kulawa Misili, vihongwe wake longo wowapapile ndiya, magate na ndiya zimwenga. <verse eid="GEN 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24"/>Ivo Yosefu kailaga na ndugu zake. Viwakalile wosegela Yosefu kawazuma kulonga, “Sekemugombe mwiinzila.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25"/>Baho wasegela Misili na kubwela ukaye kwa tati yawo Yakobo mwiisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26"/>Wamulongela tati yawo, “Yosefu mgima!” Niiyo mtawala wa isi yose ya Misili! Baho tati yawo kengilwa na mkangagile, kwaviya hadahile bule kuzitogola mbuli zawo.<verse eid="GEN 45:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27"/>Mbali viwamulongele Yakobo mbuli izo zose ziwalagilizigwe na Yosefu na viyawone mituka yoyagaliligwe na Yosefu kumsola, moyo wake umema deng'ho ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 45:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28"/>Isilaili kalonga, “Lelo moyo wangu woibwanha, mwanangu Yosefu mgima. Nohita nikamuwone ning'hali sinadanganika bule.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na kaye yake wohita Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1"/>Isilaili kandusa mwanza wake hamwe na vinhu vake vose kahita Belisheba, uko kalava nhambiko kwa Mulungu wa tati yake Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 46:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2"/>Mulungu kalonga na Isilaili muna yamalaguso ichilo na kamtanga, “Yakobo, Yakobo!” Nayo kamwidika, “Yemwe, aino hano.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3"/>Mulungu kalonga, “Niye niiyo Mulungu, Mulungu wa tati yako.” “Sekeudumbe kuhita Misili, vondauwe uko, nizakutenda uwe makabila mengi. <verse eid="GEN 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4"/>Niye mwenyewo nohita na weye uko Misili, na nizakubweleza muna iisi ino. Yosefu kezakuwa na weye baho vondaudanganike na mkono wake wizamfumba meso yako.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5"/>Yakobo kahasegela Belisheba. Wanage Isilaili wamguma Yakobo tati yawo muna imituka yoyailavile mfalume wa Misili hamwe na iwana iwadododo na wake zawo. <verse eid="GEN 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6"/>Iviya wasola mifugo na vinhu vawo vose, viwakalile wapata muna iisi ya Kanaani, maabaho wahita Misili. Yakobo kasola welesi wake wose, <verse eid="GEN 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7"/>wanage wa chilume na wachike na wazukulu zake na welesi wake kaugala Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8"/>Yano yayo mazina ya wana wa Isilaili wowahitile muna iisi ya Misili, wakala Yakobo na wanage na Lubeni chaudele wa Yakobo, <verse eid="GEN 46:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9"/>na wanage Lubeni wakala Henoki na Palu na Heziloni na Kalimi, <verse eid="GEN 46:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10"/>na wanage Simeoni wakala Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohali na Shauli yoyelekigwe na mwanamke Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11"/>Wanage Lawi wakala Gelishoni na Kohasi na Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12"/>Wanage Yuda wakala Eli na Onani na Shela na Pelesi na Zela. Mbali Eli na Onani wadanganika muna iisi ya Kanaani. Wana wa Pelesi wakala Hesiloni na Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13"/>Wanage Isakali wakala Tola na Puva na Yobu na Shimuloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14"/>Wanage Zabuloni wakala Seledi na Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15"/>Wano ni wana wa chilume waja Leya woyamwelekele Yakobo kuja Padani Alamu, hamwe na Dina mndele wake. Pete ya wanage, wandele zake na wabwanga zake wakala malongo matatu na watatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16"/>Wanage Gadi wakala Zefoni na Hagi na Shuni na Esboni na Eli na Alodi na Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17"/>Wanage Asheli wakala Imina na Ishiva na Ishivi na Belia na Sela yeli lumbu jawo. Na wanage Beliya wakala Hebeli na Melikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18"/>Wano longo na sita ni wana wa Yakobo na Zilipa, mtumwa niiyo Labani yamwing'hile Leya mndele wake.<verse eid="GEN 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19"/>Laheli, muke wa Yakobo kamwelekela wana waidi wa chilume, Yosefu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20"/>Muna iisi ya Misili Yosefu keleka wana waidi, Manase na Efulaimu, kwa Asenati mndele wa Potifela, mkulu wa nhambiko wa Oni. <verse eid="GEN 46:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21"/>Wanage Benjamini wakala Bela na Bekeli na Ashibeli na Gela na Naamani na Ehi na Loshi na Mupimu na Hupimu na Alidi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22"/>Wanhu wana longo na wane ni wana na wazukulu wa Yakobo na Laheli muke wake.<verse eid="GEN 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23"/>Mwanage Dani kakala Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24"/>Wanage Nafutali wakala Yaseeli na Guni na Yaseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25"/>Wawo saba ni wana na wazukulu wa Yakobo na Biliha msang'hani wa chike iyo Labani kamwing'ha mndele wake Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 46:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26"/>Wanhu wose wa welesi wa Yakobo wowahitile nayo kuna iisi ya Misili, bila kuwapeta wake wa wanage, wakala wanhu malongo sita na sita. <verse eid="GEN 46:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27"/>Uko kwiisi ya Misili Yosefu keleka wana waidi. Ivo peta yose ya welesi wa Yakobo wengile Misili wakala malongo saba.<verse eid="GEN 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na kaye yake muna iisi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28"/>Yakobo kamulongoza Yuda kwa Yosefu muladi yamulaguse nzila mbaka Gosheni. Ivo weza mbaka hanhu ha Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 46:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29"/>Yosefu kakwela mtuka wake na kahita kumkimilila Isilaili tati yake uko Gosheni. Viwaiting'hane na tati yake, waigeleka zisingo na kalila kwa lusita lutali. <verse eid="GEN 46:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30"/>Isilaili kamulongela Yosefu, “One nahadanganika sambi si chinhu bule, kwaviya nichiwona chihanga chako na kuvimanya kuwa weye kwa mgima.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31"/>Hamala baho Yosefu kawalongela ndugu zake na wanhu wose wa tati yake, “Nolondeka kuhita na kumulongela mfalume kuwa ndugu zangu na wanhu wose wa tati yangu wokala mwiisi ya Kanaani, wanizila. <verse eid="GEN 46:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32"/>Nizamulongela kuwa mweye mwawadimaji wanyama kwaviya mukala wafugaji, na kwaviya mufika hamwe na luti na ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na vinhu venu vimulinavo. <verse eid="GEN 46:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33"/>Ivo mfalume yahawatanga na kuwauza sang'hano yenu choni, <verse eid="GEN 46:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34"/>longeni, ‘Mwenevale, cheye wasang'hani wako chawafugaji wanyama kwandusila udodo wetu mbaka diyelo, kwaviya niivo viwakalile wasaho zetu.’ Longeni ivo muladi mudahe kutogoligwa kukala mkowa wa Gosheni.” Yosefu kalonga ivo kwaviya kwa Wamisili wadimaji wa ng'hondolo si chinhu bule.<verse eid="GEN 46:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1"/>Yosefu kamulongela mfalume, “Tati yangu na ndugu zangu weza kulawa Kanaani na ng'hondolo wawo na luti wawo na ng'ombe wawo na vinhu vawo vose viweli navo. Sambi wokala muna umkowa wa Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2"/>Kawasagula ndugu watano na kawalagusa kwa mfalume. <verse eid="GEN 47:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3"/>Mfalume kawauza, “Sang'hano yenu ilihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Nawo wamwidika mfalume, “Cheye wasang'hani wako ni wadimaji fana viya viwakalile wasaho zetu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4"/>Maabaho wamulongela mfalume, “Cheye wasang'hani wako chiza kukala fana nyambenyambe muno mwiisi kwaviya uko Kanaani kuna nzala ng'hulu na kaidi chabule mgina wa wanyama wetu wa kufugigwa. Ivo mwenevale, chokupula cheye, wasang'hani wako, uchilekele kukala muna umkowa wa Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5"/>Mfalume kamulongela Yosefu, “Tati yako na ndugu zako wakwizila weye, <verse eid="GEN 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6"/>isi ya Misili ni yako. Weng'he tati yako na ndugu zako hanhu hanogile muna umkowa wa Gosheni. Waleke wakale muna iisi, na one kuwamanya wanhu wene ujuzi wawo viweli wasagule wawe walolesi wa mifugo yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7"/>Maabaho Yosefu kamsola tati yake Yakobo na kumulagusa kwa mfalume. Maabaho Yakobo kamtemela mate mfalume, <verse eid="GEN 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8"/>na mfalume kamuuza Yakobo, “Lika jako ni miyaka mingahi?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9"/>Yakobo kamwidika, “Miyaka yangu fana mfosanzila ni gana na malongo matatu. Miyaka iyo iwa midodo na imema magayo, kaidi hainafika miyaka yowakalile mawasaho fana wafosa nzila.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10"/>Maabaho Yakobo kamtemela mate mfalume na kusegela. <verse eid="GEN 47:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11"/>Maabaho Yosefu kaweng'ha hanhu hakukala tati yake na ndugu zake muna iisi ya Misili, kaweng'ha hanhu hanogile habehi na bululu da Lamasesi, fana viya mfalume viyalagilize. <verse eid="GEN 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12"/>Yosefu kaweng'ha ndiya tati yake na ndugu zake na wanhu wa mwiikaye yake kusondelela idadi ya wanawo wadododo.<verse eid="GEN 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13"/>Ivo hakukalile na ndiya bule muna iisi yose, kwaviya nzala ikala ng'hulu ng'hani muna iisi yose ya Misili na muna iisi ya Kanaani, na isi zigaya kwa nzala. <verse eid="GEN 47:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14"/>Yosefu kaduganya hela zose zoziguliligwe ndiya na kuzigala kuna iisi ya Misili na isi ya Kanaani. Kazigala hela zose muna ikaye ya mfalume wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15"/>Hela zose vizimalile muna iisi ya Misili na muna iisi ya Kanaani. Wamisili wose wamwizila Yosefu na wamulongela, “Uching'he ndiya! Habali chidanganike hana yameso yako. Hela zetu zose zimala.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16"/>Yosefu kawedika, “Galeni mifugo yenu. Niye nizaweng'ha ndiya kwasakanya na wanyama wenu, one mowona hela zenu zimala.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17"/>Wawagala wanyama wawo kwa Yosefu, nayo kaweng'ha ndiya kwa kwasakanya na vihongwe na ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na mhunda. Nayo kaweng'ha ndiya kwasakanya na wanyama wawo wose mwaka uwo.<verse eid="GEN 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18"/>Mwaka usondelele wamwizila kaidi na wamulongela, “Mwenevale, ukweli ni kuwa hela zetu zose zimala na iviya mifugo yetu iwa yako. Lelo mwenevale, cheye wasang'hani wako chabule chochose chochidaha kukwing'ha mbali ng'huli zetu na migunda yetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19"/>Ivo habali chidanganike hana yameso yako cheye na migunda yetu? Uchigule cheye hamwe na isi yetu chiwe watumwa wa mfalume kwa kwasakanya na ndiya. Cheye wenyewe hamwe na isi yetu chizamsang'hanila mfalume. Na uching'he mbeyu muladi chidahe kuwa wagima, ivo isi yetu isigale.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20"/>Maabaho Yosefu kamgulila mfalume isi yose ya Misili, kwaviya Wamisili wose wagula migunda yawo kwaviya nzala ikala iwayohela. Ivo isi yose ikala mali yake mfalume. <verse eid="GEN 47:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21"/>Yosefu kawatenda wanhu kuwa watumwa kulawa ubanzi uno wa Misili mbaka ubanzi umwenga. <verse eid="GEN 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22"/>Ila isi ya wakulu wa nhambiko muhala haigulile bule. Kwaviya wakulu wa nhambiko wakala wokwing'higwa yombe jawo kulawa kwa mfalume, ivo isi yawo haiguligwe bule. <verse eid="GEN 47:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23"/>Yosefu kawalongela wanhu, “Lelo loleni diyelo niwagula mweye na isi yenu kuwa mali ya mfalume. Zino hano mbeyu muzihande muna iisi yenu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24"/>Izakuwa chipindi cha kugobola, mwizamwing'ha mfalume chinhu chimwe muna ivinhu vitano na vinhu vine muna ivinhu vitano vizakuwa venu mweye wenyewo. Iwe mbeyu ya isi na ndiya yenu na wanhu wa mwiikaye yenu na wanenu iwadododo.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25"/>Nawo wamwidika, “Kuukombola ugima wetu, na kulagusa unovu wako na cheye chizakuwa watumwa wa mfalume.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26"/>Yosefu kaditenda dino lagilizo kwa isi ya Misili kuwa hanhu ha tano ni mali ya mfalume. Lagilizo dino disigala mbaka diyelo. Mbali zisi za wakulu wa nhambiko muhala haziwile mali ya mfalume bule.<verse eid="GEN 47:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za uhelelo za Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27"/>Waisilaili wakala wokala mkowa wa Gosheni muna iisi ya Misili, wapata utajili na wana wengi na wongezeka. <verse eid="GEN 47:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28"/>Yakobo kakala Misili miyaka longo na saba, mbaka viyawile na miyaka gana na malongo mane na saba. <verse eid="GEN 47:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29"/>Isilaili viyakalile habehi kudanganika, kamtanga Yosefu mwanage na kamulongela, “Lelo fana weye konogelwa na niye, ika mkono wako hasi ya diwambo jangu na unilaganile kuwa kwizanitendela kwa unovu na voilondeka, hwizaniwanda muna iisi ya Misili bule. <verse eid="GEN 47:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30"/>Nolonda niwandigwe howawandigwe tati zangu, unipape kulawa muna iisi ya Misili na uniwande kuna yamaleme yowawandigwe wawo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yosefu kamwidika, “Nizatenda fana voulonga.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31"/>Yakobo kamulongela, “Ilahe kwa yayo youlongile.” Yosefu kamulahila, maabaho Isilaili kainamila ubanzi wa ditwi da komwa jake.<verse eid="GEN 47:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kowatemela mate Efulaimu na Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1"/>Viyafosile yayo Yosefu kalongeligwa kuwa tati yake kolumwa. Ivo kawasola wanage waidi wa chilume, Manase na Efulaimu, na kahita kumulola Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2"/>Yakobo viyamulongele kuwa mwanage Yosefu keza kumulola, Isilaili kaigangamiza na kadundumala muna dikomwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3"/>Yakobo kamulongela Yosefu, “Mulungu mwene Udaho kanilawilila uko Luzu kuna isi ya Kanaani na kanitemela mate. <verse eid="GEN 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4"/>Kanilongela, ‘Nizakongezela wana wengi, na welesi wake wizakuwa kabila kulu, nizaweng'ha welesi wako isi ino kuwa yawo siku zose.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5"/>Yakobo kagendelela kulonga, “Wanago waidi wouwapatile hano Misili ning'hali sinafika, ni wanangu. Efulaimu na Manase wezakuwa wangu fana viya viweli Lubeni na Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6"/>One uhawa na wana wamwenga wengi, hawezakuwa wangu bule, uhazi wondawapate wizalawa kwa Efulaimu na Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7"/>Vinikalile nobwela kulawa Padani, Laheli kadanganika muna iisi ya Kanaani, siyo ugenzi mtali kufika Efulata. Nimuwanda baho hamgwazo wa dikulugumbi dihita Efulata, sambi yotangigwa Betelehemu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8"/>Isilaili viyawawonile wana wa Yosefu, kauza, “Wabwanga wano ni welihi?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9"/>Yosefu kamwidika, “Wano ni wanangu, woyaning'hile Mulungu hano Misili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Yakobo kalonga, “Nikwenhusile habehi muladi nidahe kuwatemela mate.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10"/>Meso ya Yakobo yakala hayalola kwa ichimu cha ulala. Ivo Yosefu kawakwenhusa wanage habehi na tati yake, na Yakobo kawahagatila na kawanonela. <verse eid="GEN 48:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11"/>Isilaili kamulongela Yosefu, “Sigesile bule kuwona chihanga chako kaidi, mbali humbe Mulungu kanogela mbaka kuwawona wanago.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12"/>Maabaho Yosefu kawasegeza wanage hana yamavindi ya tati yake na katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi.<verse eid="GEN 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13"/>Yosefu kaweka wanage wose waidi, Efulaimu kuna umkono wake wa kulume kusonhela mkono wa kumoso wa Isilaili, na Manase kuna umkono wake wa kumoso kusonhela mkono wa kulume wa Isilaili. Kawakwenhusa habehi nayo. <verse eid="GEN 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14"/>Mbali Isilaili kayafosesaza yamakono yake, mkono wa kulume kawika mditwi da Efulaimu, ingawa kakala mdodo na mkono wake wa kumoso kawika mditwi da Manase yoyakale chaudele. <verse eid="GEN 48:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15"/>Maabaho Isilaili kamtemela mate Yosefu kalonga, “Mulungu ija tati zetu Bulahimu na Isaka wakala fana viyolonda muna ugima wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Mulungu yoyanidimile muna uugima wangu mbaka diyelo,<verse eid="GEN 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16"/>Msenga wa kuulanga ija yoyanikombole niye muna yehile yose, yawatemele mate wabwanga wano!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Wezatangigwa wanangu kwa ludongo lwa welesi wa Bulahimu na Isaka na wongezeke kwa wingi muna iisi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17"/>Yosefu viyawone kuwa tati yake kawika mkono wake wa kulume kuna iditwi da Efulaimu, hanogelwe bule. Ivo kawamha mkono wa tati yake kalonda kuusegeza uchanyha ya ditwi da Efulaimu, yawike kuna iditwi da Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18"/>Yosefu kamulongela tati yake, “Siyo ivo tata. Ino niiyo chaudele, mwikile mkono wako wa kulume muna iditwi jake.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19"/>Mbali tati yake kalema, kalonga, “Novimanya mwanangu, novimanya. Welesi wa Manase iviya wezakuwa wanhu wakulu. Mbali mdodo wake kezakuwa mkulu kufosa yeye, na welesi wake wezakuwa makabila makulu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20"/>Ivo kawatemela mate siku ijo na kalonga, “Waisilaili wezasang'hanila mazina yenu kutemela mate, wezalonga, ‘Mulungu yakutende weye fana Efulaimu na Manase.’ ” Niivo Yakobo viyamwikile Efulaimu haulongozi wa Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21"/>Baho Isilaili kamulongela Yosefu, “Fana viya viuwona kuwa niye nahabehi kudanganika, mbali Mulungu kezakuwa na mweye na kuwasola kuwabweleza muna iisi ya wasaho zenu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22"/>Niye nikwing'ha weye siyo ndugu zako hanhu hotangigwa Shekemu na vinhu vonisolile muna yamakono ya Waamoli kwa upanga wangu na uta wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za uhelelo za Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1"/>Yakobo kawatanga wanage na kalonga, “Iduganyeni hamwe, na nizamulongelani yaja yondayamulawilileni siku zikwiza.”<verse eid="GEN 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2"/>“Izoni hamwe na mutegeleze, wana wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">Munitegeleze tati yenu Isilaili.”<verse eid="GEN 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3"/>“Lubeni, chaudele wangu, nguvu yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Na mwana wa mwanduso wa ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Mwene udahi na nguvu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4"/>Weye fana viya mazi yamemile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Mbali hwizakuwa wa mwanduso kaidi bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Kwaviya kugona muna dikomwa jangu na kumbandama mtumwa wangu, yalingile fana muke wengu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">hudihishimu komwa da tati yako.<verse eid="GEN 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5"/>“Simeoni na Lawi ni ndugu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">Wosang'hanila silaha zawo kutenda usede.<verse eid="GEN 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6"/>Mbali niye sizaihanganya muna uwihi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Sizaihanganya na mting'hano wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Kwaviya muna uludoko lwawo wamkoma munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Chiutundu wawo wakanha umuge wa ng'ombe.<verse eid="GEN 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7"/>Noduwila ludoko lwawo kwaviya lukali ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Na muna ing'hasiliki yawo, kwaviya ni usede.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Nizawagola muna iisi ya Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Nizawapwililisa muna iisi ya Isilaili.”<verse eid="GEN 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8"/>“Yuda, wana wa tati yako wezakutogola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Wehi wako kwizawanyoda singo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Wana wa tati yako wezatumbala mavindi haulongozi hako.<verse eid="GEN 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9"/>Yuda mwanangu, kulinga fana simba, yoyapatile maingo yake na kabwela ukaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Fana simba koigolola na kugona hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">simba yeli na ludabwa yelihi yoyodaha kumulamusa?<verse eid="GEN 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10"/>Yuda kezakwamha mhome ya chifalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Welesi wake wizatawala siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Mbaka vondayeze yeli na udahi wa ufalume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Mbaka makabila wezamtegeleza.<verse eid="GEN 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11"/>Komfunga chihongwe wake kwa nzabi muna umbiki wa zabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na komfunga mwanachihongwe kwa nzabi muna umbiki wa zabibu unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">muladi yaje mayani ya mzabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Kofuwa viwalo vake muna idivai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Viwalo vake muna idivai ndung'hu.<verse eid="GEN 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12"/>Meso yake yawe na madung'hu fana divai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">na meno yake yawe mazelu fana matombo.”<verse eid="GEN 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13"/>“Zabuloni kezakala habehi na bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Kezasigamiza meli yake muna ingema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Mbaka yake izahakana na Sidoni.”<verse eid="GEN 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14"/>Isakali kalinga fana chihongwe mwene nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">Yoyoigoneza hagati ya zimbahasha zake.<verse eid="GEN 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15"/>Mbali kowona kuwa hanhu ha kuhumula hanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Na kuwa isi iviya ni ya kunogeza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Konamiza mgongo wake kupapa mbahasha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Na kowangilizigwa kusang'hana usang'hano fana mtumwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16"/>Dani kezakuwa msemi kwa wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">fana imwe ng'holo za makabila ya Isilaili.<verse eid="GEN 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17"/>Dani kezakuwa nyoka muna inzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Nyoka yeli na sumu mumgwazo wa nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Yoyoluma visigino va vihongwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Yokwela chihongwe kogwa chingalingali.<verse eid="GEN 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18"/>“Mndewa Mulungu niugozela ukombola wako.”<verse eid="GEN 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19"/>“Gadi kezatowigwa na mabeduwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">Mbali yeye kezawasondelela kuchisogo na kuwatowa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20"/>“Isi ya Asheli izalava ndiya ya inogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">Nayo kezalava ndiya yoimfaya mfalume.”<verse eid="GEN 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21"/>Nafutali fana viya mbuguma ya mhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">yoyokweleka wana wanogile.<verse eid="GEN 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22"/>“Yosefu ni fana mbiki ukwima, mbiki ukwima mwiingema ya nzasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">matambi yake yatanda muna inhumba.<verse eid="GEN 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23"/>Watowa misale wamtowa ng'hani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">Na wampigisila misale na wamgaza ng'hani.<verse eid="GEN 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24"/>Mbali upinde wake ung'hali ugangamala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Makono yake yana udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Kwa udahi wa Mndewa Mulungu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Mdimi na luwe lwa Isilaili.<verse eid="GEN 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25"/>Kwa Mulungu wa tati yako yondayakutaze</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Kwa Mulungu mwene Udaho yondayakutemele mate</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Yakutemele mate kwa mvula kulawa kuchanyha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Kutemiligwa mate mazi yoyolawa hasi mwiisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Kutemiligwa mate kweleka wana na fugo,<verse eid="GEN 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26"/>Kutemeligwa mate kwa tati yako kuhume kutemiligwa mate kwa migongo ya umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Kutemiligwa mate uko kuwe uchanyha ya ditwi da Yosefu, uchanyha ya ditwi jake yeli mkulu kufosa ndugu zake.”<verse eid="GEN 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27"/>“Benjamini ni mbwizi mkali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">Imitondo koja maingo yake na ichigulogulo kogola viyahokile.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28"/>Izo niizo ng'holo longo na maidi ya Isilaili, na izo niizo zimbuli ziyawalongele tati yawo iyawatemele mate, fana viya chila munhu viyalondeke.<verse eid="GEN 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kudanganika na kuwandigwa kwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29"/>Maabaho Yakobo kawalagiliza wanage wa chilume vino, “Lelo niye nohita kwiilumba na wanhu wangu muna ifa, muniwande hamwe na tati zangu muna dituka muna umgunda wa Efiloni Muhiti <verse eid="GEN 49:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30"/>kuja Makipela ulawilo wa zuwa wa Mamule mwiisi ya Kanaani. Bulahimu kagula tuka ijo na mgunda kwa Efiloni Muhiti diwe hanhu hake ha kuwandila. <verse eid="GEN 49:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31"/>Uko niuko kuwawandigwe Bulahimu na muke wake Sala, iviya uko niuko kuwawandigwe Isaka na muke wake Lebeka, iviya uko niuko nimuwandile Leya. <verse eid="GEN 49:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32"/>Mgunda na tuka dili umo viguligwa kulawa kwa Wahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33"/>Yakobo viyakomeleze kuwalagiliza wanage, kayabweleza magulu yake mdikomwa, na kadanganika kaihanganya na walala wake wowamulongolele.<verse eid="GEN 49:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1"/>Maabaho Yosefu kalila na kamuhagatila tati yake na kamnonela. <verse eid="GEN 50:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2"/>Maabaho Yosefu kawalagiliza waganga wake wamuhake dawa Isilaili muladi sekeyawole, nawo watenda ivo. <verse eid="GEN 50:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3"/>Isola siku malongo mane, lusita luzoweleke kwa kwika dawa. Wamisili wamulilila kwa siku malongo saba.<verse eid="GEN 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4"/>Nhanga viikomelezeke, Yosefu kawalongela iwakulu wa mfalume, “One nihamnogezani, nolamba soleni usenga uno muugale kwa mfalume, <verse eid="GEN 50:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5"/>‘Tati yangu viyakalile habehi na kudanganika, kanikila lagano kumuwanda muna dituka doyasasale muna iisi ya Kanaani. Ivo lekeni nihite nikamuwande tati yangu na maabaho nizabwela.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6"/>Mfalume kamwidika, “Hita ukamuwande tati yako, fana viuilagane nayo.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7"/>Ivo Yosefu kahita kumuwanda tati yake. Wakulu wose wa kaye ya mfalume na walala wa kaye ya mfalume na walala wose wa isi ya Misili wahita hamwe na Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 50:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8"/>Iviya Yosefu kaisondelela na wanhu wa muna ikaye yake na ndugu zake na wanhu wose weli muna ikaye ya tati yake Yakobo. Muna umkowa wa Gosheni wasigala wana wawo muhala hamwe na ng'hondolo na luti na ng'ombe wawo. <verse eid="GEN 50:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9"/>Wanhu wokwendesha mituka na wanhu wokwela vihongwe iviya wahita hamwe nayo, dikala bumbila kulu. <verse eid="GEN 50:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10"/>Viwafikile hanhu ha kuhululila nafaka wa Atadi, ulawilo wa zuwa wa ulwanda lwa Yoludani, walila kwa luholozi kwa lusita lukulu, na Yosefu kamtendela mwenekwaga tati yake matanga ya siku saba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11"/>Wakaya wa mabululu ya Kanaani viwawonile wanhu wotenda matanga halubuga lwa Atadi, walonga, “Matanga yano ya Wamisili ni makulu.” Kwa ivo hanhu baho hatangigwa Abeli Misili ili umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yoludani.<verse eid="GEN 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12"/>Wana wa Yakobo wamtendela tati yawo fana viyawalagilize, <verse eid="GEN 50:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13"/>wausola ulukuli lwake mbaka isi ya Kanaani na wamuwanda muna dituka dodikalile muna umgunda uko Makipela, ulawilo wa zuwa wa Mamule, muna umgunda Bulahimu woyaugulile kulawa kwa Efiloni Muhiti hawe hanhu ha kuwandila. <verse eid="GEN 50:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14"/>Yosefu viyakomeleze kumuwanda tati yake, kabwela Misili hamwe na ndugu zake na wanhu wose wowakalile waisondelela nayo kuhita kumuwanda tati yake.<verse eid="GEN 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu kowasegezela mnamilo ndugu zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15"/>Viwawone tati yawo kadanganika, ndugu zake Yosefu walonga, “Yodahika Yosefu kezachihila na kezachiliha yehile yose yochimtendele?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16"/>Ivo wamtumila usenga Yosefu na kumulongela “Tati yako kachasila usenga yang'hali hanadanganika, <verse eid="GEN 50:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17"/>mulongeleni Yosefu vino, ‘Nolamba uwalekelele ndugu zako wihi wawo na uhasanyi wawo, kwaviya wakutendela yehile.’ Lelo chokulamba uchilekelele wihi, wasang'hani wa Mulungu wa tati yako.” Yosefu viyauhokele usenga uwo kalila.<verse eid="GEN 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18"/>Maabaho ndugu zake Yosefu wamwizila na wamtumbalila mavindi na walonga, “Cheye hano cha watumwa wako.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19"/>Mbali Yosefu kawalongela, “Sekemudumbe, vino niye ni Mulungu? <verse eid="GEN 50:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20"/>Mweye mwiilunga kunitendela yehile, mbali Mulungu kailungila yanogile, muladi wanhu wengi wadahe kuwa wagima fana viya vimuwona diyelo chochilawilile. <verse eid="GEN 50:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21"/>Sekemudumbe. Nizaweka goya mweye na wanenu.” Ivo kawaguma moyo kwa kulonga nawo mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="GEN 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22"/>Yosefu kagendelela kukala muna iisi ya Misili hamwe na kaye ya tati yake. Yosefu viyadanganike kakala na miyaka gana na kumi. <verse eid="GEN 50:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23"/>Yosefu kanogelwa kuwawona wana na wazukulu wa Efulaimu na kuwahokela fana viya wanage wana wa Makili mwana wa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 50:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24"/>Yosefu kawalongela ndugu zake, “Niye nahabehi kudanganika, mbali Mulungu kezawezila na kwika goya na kezawalava muna iisi ino na kuwagala muna iisi yoyawalahile Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25"/>Hamala baho Yosefu katenda chilaho kwa wana wa Isilaili kulonga, “Nilaganileni kuwa Mulungu vondayawasegezeni muna iisi ino, mwizaipapa mivuha yangu kulawa hanhu hano.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26"/>Ivo Yosefu kadanganika uko Misili yahawa na miyaka gana na longo. Waluboboda dawa lukuli lwake na walwika muna disanduku muladi sekeluwole.<verse eid="GEN 50:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50"/>
</usx>
